<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="EZK" style="id"/>
  <para style="h">Ézéchiel</para>
  <para style="toc1">ÉZÉCHIEL</para>
  <para style="toc2">Ézéchiel</para>
  <para style="toc3">Éz</para>
  <para style="mt1">ÉZÉCHIEL</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="EZK 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 1:1"/>Alò, li te vin rive nan trèzyèm ane, sou senkyèm jou a Katriyèm mwa a, pandan mwen te akote rivyè Kebar a, pami egzile yo, ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 3:16">Mat 3:16</ref></char></note>syèl yo te louvri, e mwen te wè vizyon a Bondye.<verse eid="EZK 1:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 1:2"/>(Sou senkyèm jou nan mwa a, nan senkyèm ane egzil a Wa Jojakin nan, <verse eid="EZK 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 1:3"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2PE 1:21">II Pi 1:21</ref></char></note>Pawòl SENYÈ a te rive eksprè a Ézéchiel, prèt la, fis a Buzi, nan peyi Kaldeyen yo akote rivyè Kebar a; epi la, men SENYÈ a te vini sou li.)<verse eid="EZK 1:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 1:4"/>Pandan mwen t ap gade, men gade byen, yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 21:1">És 21:1</ref></char></note>van tanpèt te vini soti nan nò, yon gwo nwaj ak loraj ki t ap tire san rete; yon limyè byen klere te antoure l e nan mitan l, yon bagay tankou metal ki klere nan mitan dife a. <verse eid="EZK 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 1:5"/>Anndan li, te gen fòm ki te sanble <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 10:15">Éz 10:15</ref></char></note>kat kreyati vivan. Men ki jan yo te parèt: yo te gen yon fòm tankou moun. <verse eid="EZK 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 1:6"/>Yo chak te gen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 1:10">Éz 1:10</ref></char></note>kat figi ak kat zèl. <verse eid="EZK 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 1:7"/>Janm yo te dwat, pye yo te tankou zago jenn bèf, e yo te klere tankou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 10:6">Dan 10:6</ref></char></note>bwonz poli. <verse eid="EZK 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 1:8"/>Anba zèl yo, nan kat kote yo, te gen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 10:8-21">Éz 10:8-21</ref></char></note>men a moun. Yo kat te gen figi ak zèl yo konsa: <verse eid="EZK 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 1:9"/>Zèl pa yo te jwente youn lòt. Yo pa t vire lè yo te deplase. Yo chak te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 1:12">Éz 1:12</ref></char></note>ale tou dwat devan.<verse eid="EZK 1:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 1:10"/>Pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 4:7">Rev 4:7</ref></char></note>fòm a figi yo a, yo chak te gen figi tankou a yon moun. Toule kat te gen figi a yon lyon adwat, figi a yon towo agoch, e toule kat te gen figi a yon èg. <verse eid="EZK 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 1:11"/>Se konsa figi yo te ye. Zèl yo te ouvri anlè. Yo chak te gen de ki te touche a yon lòt kreyati e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 6:2">És 6:2</ref></char></note> de ki te kouvri kò yo. <verse eid="EZK 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 1:12"/>Epi yo chak te ale tou dwat devan. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 1:20">Éz 1:20</ref></char></note>Nenpòt kote lespri a te prèt pou ale, yo ta ale, san menm vire pandan yo t ap prale a. <verse eid="EZK 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 1:13"/>Nan mitan kreyati vivan yo, te gen yon bagay ki te sanble ak <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 104:4">Sòm 104:4</ref></char></note>chabon dife, tankou tòch ki t ap file fè ale retou pami kreyati vivan yo. Dife a te klere e loray te vòltije soti nan dife a. <verse eid="EZK 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 1:14"/>Epi kreyati vivan yo te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 4:10">Za 4:10</ref></char></note>kouri fè ale retou tankou kout loray.<verse eid="EZK 1:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 1:15"/>Alò, pandan mwen t ap gade kreyati vivan yo, gade byen, te gen yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 1:19-21">Éz 1:19-21</ref></char></note>wou sou tè a akote kreyati vivan yo, pou chak nan kat fas de yo. <verse eid="EZK 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 1:16"/>Wou yo te sanble, jan yo te fèt la, tankou yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 10:9">Éz 10:9</ref></char></note>wòch krizolit briyan. E toule kat te gen menm fòm. Nan aparans la, jan yo fè l la, yo te fèt konsi yon wou te anndan yon lòt wou. <verse eid="EZK 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 1:17"/>Nenpòt lè yo deplase, yo te deplase nan nenpòt nan kat direksyon yo, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 1:9-12">Éz 1:9-12</ref></char></note>san menm vire pandan yo t ap deplase a. <verse eid="EZK 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 1:18"/>Wotè a wou yo te tèlman wo. Yo te etonan. Arebò toule kat te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 10:12">Éz 10:12</ref></char></note>plen ak zye toutotou l nèt.<verse eid="EZK 1:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 1:19"/>Nenpòt lè kreyati vivan yo te deplase, wou yo te deplase avèk yo. Epi nenpòt lè kreyati vivan yo te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 10:19">Éz 10:19</ref></char></note> leve kite tè a, wou yo te leve tou. <verse eid="EZK 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 1:20"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 1:12">Éz 1:12</ref></char></note>Nenpòt kote lespri a te prèt pou ale, yo ta ale nan direksyon sa a. Epi wou yo te leve toupre bò kote yo; paske lespri a kreyati vivan yo te nan wou yo. <verse eid="EZK 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 1:21"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 10:17">Éz 10:17</ref></char></note>Nenpòt kote sa yo te ale, sila yo te ale tou. Lè sa yo te kanpe an plas, sila yo te kanpe an plas tou. Epi nenpòt lè sa yo te monte kite tè a, wou yo te leve toupre bò kote yo; paske lespri a kreyati vivan yo te nan wou yo.<verse eid="EZK 1:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 1:22"/>Alò, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 10:1">Éz 10:1</ref></char></note>anwo tèt a kreyati vivan yo, te gen yon bagay tankou yon gwo espas, tankou yon briyans mèvèy kon kristal, ki te ouvri byen laj sou tèt yo. <verse eid="EZK 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 1:23"/>Anba gwo espas la, zèl yo te lonje dwat, youn anvè lòt. Yo chak te gen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 1:6-11">Éz 1:6-11</ref></char></note>de zèl ki te kouvri kò l tou, youn yon kote e youn yon lòt kote. <verse eid="EZK 1:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 1:24"/>Anplis, mwen te tande son a zèl yo tankou son anpil gwo dlo pandan yo t ap prale, tankou vwa a Toupwisan an, yon son a gwo boulvèsman, tankou son a yon lame ki nan kan li. Nenpòt lè yo sispann fè mouvman, yo lage desann zèl yo.<verse eid="EZK 1:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 1:25"/>Konsa, te sòti yon vwa depi anwo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 1:22">Éz 1:22</ref></char></note> gran espas lan ki te sou tèt pa yo. Nenpòt lè yo te sispann fè mouvman, yo te lage desann zèl yo. <verse eid="EZK 1:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 1:26"/>Alò, anwo gwo espas ki te anwo tèt yo a, te gen yon bagay ki <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 6:1">És 6:1</ref></char></note>te sanble ak yon twòn, tankou yon pyè safì nan aparans. Epi sou sa ki te sanble a yon twòn nan, byen wo, te gen yon fòm ak aparans a yon nonm. <verse eid="EZK 1:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZK 1:27"/>Sa mwen te wè, te soti nan aparans a ren Li ak piwo, yon bagay tankou metal klere ki te sanble dife toutotou anndan l. Soti nan aparans a ren Li e piba, mwen te wè yon bagay tankou dife, epi te gen yon ekla limyè ki te antoure Li. <verse eid="EZK 1:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZK 1:28"/>Menm jan ak aparans a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 9:13">Jen 9:13</ref></char></note>lakansyèl nan nwaj yo nan jou l ap fè lapli, konsa aparans a ekla limyè ki te antoure li a te ye.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EZK 1:28">Konsa aparans a imaj a glwa a SENYÈ a te ye. Lè m te wè l, mwen te tonbe sou figi mwen, e mwen te tande yon vwa ki t ap pale.<verse eid="EZK 1:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="EZK 2"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 2:1"/>Li te di mwen: “Fis a lòm, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 10:11">Dan 10:11</ref></char></note>kanpe sou pye ou pou m ka pale avèk ou!” <verse eid="EZK 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 2:2"/>Pandan Li t ap pale ak mwen an, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 3:24">Éz 3:24</ref></char></note>Lespri a te antre nan mwen. Li te mete mwen sou pye mwen, epi mwen te tande Li pale ak mwen.<verse eid="EZK 2:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 2:3"/>Li te di m: “Fis a lòm, Mwen ap voye ou kote fis Israël yo, a yon pèp rebèl ki te fè rebèl kont Mwen. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 20:18-30">Éz 20:18-30</ref></char></note>Yo menm ak papa zansèt yo te transgrese kont Mwen jis rive jodi a. <verse eid="EZK 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 2:4"/>M ap voye ou kote sila yo ki angran, ki gen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 95:8">Sòm 95:8</ref></char></note>tèt di. Ou va di yo: ‘Konsa pale Senyè BONDYE a.’ <verse eid="EZK 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 2:5"/>Pou yo menm, menm si yo koute oswa pa koute—paske se kay rebèl ke yo ye—yo va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 33:33">Éz 33:33</ref></char></note>konnen ke yon pwofèt te pami yo. <verse eid="EZK 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 2:6"/>Epi ou menm, fis a lòm, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 51:12">És 51:12</ref></char></note>pa krent yo ni krent pawòl yo, malgre pikan ak zepin avèk ou, e malgre ou chita pami eskòpyon yo. Ni pa krent pawòl yo, ni twouble nan prezans yo, paske se yon kay rebèl ke yo ye. <verse eid="EZK 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 2:7"/>Men ou va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 1:7-17">Jr 1:7-17</ref></char></note>pale pawòl Mwen yo avèk yo, menm si yo koute oswa yo pa koute, paske se rebèl yo ye. <verse eid="EZK 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 2:8"/>Alò, ou menm, fis a lòm, koute sa ke M ap pale ou a. Pa vin fè rebèl tankou kay rebèl sila a. Ouvri bouch ou pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 15:16">Jr 15:16</ref></char></note>manje sa ke M ap bay ou a.”<verse eid="EZK 2:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 2:9"/>Konsa, mwen te gade e gade byen, yon men te lonje vè mwen menm. Epi alò, yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 36:2">Jr 36:2</ref></char></note>woulo liv te ladann. <verse eid="EZK 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 2:10"/>Lè L te louvri li devan mwen, li te ekri ni pa devan ni pa dèyè, e ekri sou li, se te lamantasyon, doulè ak <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 3:11">És 3:11</ref></char></note>mizè.<verse eid="EZK 2:10"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="EZK 3"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 3:1"/>Li te di mwen: “Fis a lòm, manje sa ou jwenn. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 2:9">Éz 2:9</ref></char></note>Manje woulo sa a pou ale pale ak lakay Israël.”<verse eid="EZK 3:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 3:2"/>Konsa, mwen te louvri bouch mwen e<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 25:17">Jr 25:17</ref></char></note>Li te lonje ban m woulo a pou manje.<verse eid="EZK 3:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 3:3"/>Li te di mwen: “Fis a lòm, bay vant ou manje, e plen kò ou ak woulo sa ke Mwen ap bay ou a.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EZK 3:3">Alò, mwen te manje li. Li te dous kon siwo myèl nan bouch mwen.<verse eid="EZK 3:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 3:4"/>Konsa, Li te di mwen: “Fis a lòm, ale lakay Israël pou pale pawòl Mwen yo avèk yo. <verse eid="EZK 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 3:5"/>Paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JON 1:2">Jon 1:2</ref></char></note>ou p ap voye kote yon pèp ak langaj ki difisil, men a pèp Israël la. <verse eid="EZK 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 3:6"/>Ni a anpil pèp ak pawòl ki pa ka konprann, ni lang difisil, ak pawòl ke ou p ap ka konprann. Men Mwen voye ou kote sila ki ta dwe koute ou yo. <verse eid="EZK 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 3:7"/>Malgre sa, lakay Israël p ap dakò koute ou, akoz yo p ap dakò koute Mwen menm. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 8:7">I Sam 8:7</ref></char></note>Anverite, tout lakay Israël gen tèt di e wondonmon. <verse eid="EZK 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 3:8"/>Gade byen, Mwen te fin fè figi ou di kont figi yo, e fwontèn ou di kont fwontèn yo. <verse eid="EZK 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 3:9"/>Tankou dyaman, pi di pase silèks, Mwen te fè fwontèn ou. Pa krent yo ni vin twouble devan yo, malgre yo se yon kay rebèl.”<verse eid="EZK 3:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 3:10"/>Anplis, Li te di mwen: “Fis a lòm, pran mete nan kè ou tout <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 22:22">Job 22:22</ref></char></note>pawòl Mwen yo, ke Mwen va pale a ou e koute ak atansyon. <verse eid="EZK 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 3:11"/>Ale kote egzile yo, fis a pèp ou yo. Pale ak yo e di yo, menm si yo koute oswa yo pa koute: ‘Konsa pale Senyè BONDYE a.’”<verse eid="EZK 3:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 3:12"/>Konsa, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 3:14">Éz 3:14</ref></char></note>Lespri a te leve mwen monte e mwen te tande yon gwo bri k ap gwonde dèyè m: “Beni se glwa SENYÈ a nan plas Li a.” <verse eid="EZK 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 3:13"/>Epi mwen te tande zèl a kreyati vivan yo, youn k ap touche lòt e bri a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 1:15">Éz 1:15</ref></char></note>wou yo bò kote yo, menm yon gwo bri k ap gwonde. <verse eid="EZK 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 3:14"/>Konsa, Lespri a te leve mwen monte e te pran m ale. Mwen te vini byen anmè ak laraj nan lespri m, e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 3:15">II Wa 3:15</ref></char></note>men SENYÈ a te fò sou mwen. <verse eid="EZK 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 3:15"/>Konsa, mwen te vini kote egzile ki te rete akote rivyè Kebar yo nan Thel-Abib. Mwen te chita la, etonen nèt pandan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 2:13">Job 2:13</ref></char></note>sèt jou kote yo te rete a.<verse eid="EZK 3:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 3:16"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:16 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 42:7">Jr 42:7</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Nan fen sèt jou yo, pawòl SENYÈ a te vini sou mwen e te di: <verse eid="EZK 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 3:17"/>“Fis a lòm, Mwen te chwazi ou kon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 52:8">És 52:8</ref></char></note>gadyen pou lakay Israël. Depi lè ou tande yon pawòl sòti nan bouch mwen, avèti yo li soti nan Mwen. <verse eid="EZK 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 3:18"/>Lè Mwen di a mechan an: ‘Ou va, anverite, mouri’ e ou pa avèti li, ni pale fò pou avèti mechan an pou kite chemen mechan l lan, pou l ka viv, mechan sila a va mouri nan inikite li, men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 3:20">Éz 3:20</ref></char></note>san li, mwen va egzije li soti nan men ou. <verse eid="EZK 3:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 3:19"/>Men si ou te avèti mechan an, e li pa kite mechanste li a, ni chemen mechan li an, li va mouri nan inikite li, men ou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 14:14-20">Éz 14:14-20</ref></char></note>delivre nanm ou.”<verse eid="EZK 3:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 3:20"/>“Ankò, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 125:5">Sòm 125:5</ref></char></note>lè yon nonm ladwati ta vire kite ladwati pou komèt inikite e Mwen plase yon obstak devan l, li va mouri. Akoz ou pa t avèti li, li va mouri nan peche li e zèv ladwati ke li te konn fè yo, p ap sonje, men san li, mwen va egzije li nan men ou. <verse eid="EZK 3:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 3:21"/>Sepandan, si ou te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 20:31">Trav 20:31</ref></char></note>avèti nonm dwat la ke moun ladwati pa dwe peche, e li pa peche, li va anverite viv, akoz li te koute avètisman an; epi ou delivre nanm ou.”<verse eid="EZK 3:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 3:22"/>Men a SENYÈ a te sou mwen la, e Li te di m: “Leve ou menm, ale deyò nan plèn nan, epi la, Mwen va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 9:6">Trav 9:6</ref></char></note>pale avèk ou.”<verse eid="EZK 3:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 3:23"/>Konsa, mwen te leve ale nan plèn nan. Epi gade byen, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 1:28">Éz 1:28</ref></char></note>glwa a SENYÈ a te kanpe la, tankou glwa ke m te wè akote rivyè Kebar a. Epi mwen te tonbe sou figi m.<verse eid="EZK 3:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 3:24"/>Nan lè sa a, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 2:2">Éz 2:2</ref></char></note>Lespri a te antre nan mwen. Li te fè m kanpe sou pye m, Li te pale avè m e te di mwen: “Ale, fèmen tèt ou anndan lakay ou. <verse eid="EZK 3:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 3:25"/>Selon ou menm, fis a lòm, y ap <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 4:8">Éz 4:8</ref></char></note>mete kòd sou ou pou mare ou ak yo. Konsa, ou p ap ka sòti deyò pami yo. <verse eid="EZK 3:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 3:26"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 24:27">Éz 24:27</ref></char></note>Mwen va fè lang ou kole anlè bouch ou pou ou vin bèbè e pou ou p ap ka fè yo repwoch, paske lakay yo rebèl. <verse eid="EZK 3:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZK 3:27"/>Men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 24:27">Éz 24:27</ref></char></note>lè M pale ak ou, Mwen va ouvri bouch ou e ou va di yo: ‘Konsa pale Senyè BONDYE a’. Sila ki tande a, kite li tande; epi sila ki refize tande a, kite li refize; paske yo se yon kay rebèl.”<verse eid="EZK 3:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="EZK 4"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 4:1"/>“Alò, ou menm, fis a lòm, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 20:2">És 20:2</ref></char></note>chache pou ou yon moso mozayik. Mete l devan ou e desiyen yon vil sou li, menm Jérusalem nan. <verse eid="EZK 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 4:2"/>Konsa, poze <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 6:6">Jr 6:6</ref></char></note>fè syèj kontra li. Bati yon miray syèj, leve teras, fòme kan a, prepare e pozisyone dè belye mouton kont li tout ozanviwon. <verse eid="EZK 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 4:3"/>Ankò, chache pou ou yon plak an fè, pozisyone li tankou yon miray ki fèt an fè antre ou menm ak vil la e mete fas ou anvè li. Li anba syèj. Konsa ou va mete li anba syèj menm. Sa va yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 8:18">És 8:18</ref></char></note>sign pou lakay Israël.<verse eid="EZK 4:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 4:4"/>“Pou ou menm, kouche sou kote goch ou e mete inikite lakay Israël la sou li. Ou va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 10:17">Lev 10:17</ref></char></note> pote inikite yo pou menm fòs jou ke ou kouche sou li yo. <verse eid="EZK 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 4:5"/>Mwen te kontwole fòs kantite jou ki koresponn a fòs kantite ane a inikite yo; twa-san-katra-ven-di jou. Konsa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 14:34">Nonb 14:34</ref></char></note>ou va pote inikite a lakay Israël la.<verse eid="EZK 4:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 4:6"/>Lè ou fin konplete sila yo, ou va kouche yon dezyèm fwa sou kote dwat ou pou pote inikite lakay Juda a. Mwen te kontwole li pou ou pandan karant jou; yon jou pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 14:34">Nonb 14:34</ref></char></note>chak ane. <verse eid="EZK 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 4:7"/>Konsa, ou va mete figi ou vè syèj a Jérusalem ak bra ou dekouvri pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 21:2">Éz 21:2</ref></char></note>pwofetize kont li. <verse eid="EZK 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 4:8"/>Alò, gade byen, Mwen va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 3:25">Éz 3:25</ref></char></note>mete kòd sou ou pou ou pa kapab vire soti yon kote a yon lòt jiskaske ou fin konplete jou a syèj ou yo.<verse eid="EZK 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 4:9"/>“Men pou ou menm, pran ble, lòj, pwa, pwa tann, pitimi, ak <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 9:32">Egz 9:32</ref></char></note>ble mòn. Mete yo nan yon sèl veso e fè pen ak yo. Ou va manje l selon nonb jou ke ou kouche sou kote ou yo, twa-san-katre-ven-di jou. <verse eid="EZK 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 4:10"/>Manje ke ou va manje a va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 45:12">Éz 45:12</ref></char></note> ven sik pa jou selon pwa li. Ou va manje ladann de tanzantan. <verse eid="EZK 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 4:11"/>Dlo ou bwè a va yon sizyèm en (1 lit pa mezi). Ou va bwè l de tanzantan. <verse eid="EZK 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 4:12"/>Ou va manje li kon gato lòj. Ou va kwit li devan yo ak fimye <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 36:12">És 36:12</ref></char></note>poupou moun.” <verse eid="EZK 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 4:13"/>Epi SENYÈ a te di: “Konsa fis Israël yo va manje pen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 1:8">Dan 1:8</ref></char></note>pa pwòp yo pami nasyon kote m ap chase yo ale yo.”<verse eid="EZK 4:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 4:14"/>Men mwen te di: “Ah Senyè BONDYE! Mwen pa t janm konn souye nanm mwen. Paske depi nan jenès mwen jis rive koulye a, mwen pa t janm manje sa ki te mouri pou kont li, oswa ki te chire pa bèt sovaj, ni okenn <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 10:14">Trav 10:14</ref></char></note>vyann ki pa t pwòp pa t janm antre nan bouch mwen.”<verse eid="EZK 4:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 4:15"/>Konsa, Li te di mwen: “Men gade, m ap bay ou kaka bèf pou ranplase poupou moun nan. Sou li menm ou va prepare pen ou an.”<verse eid="EZK 4:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 4:16"/>Anplis ke sa, Li te di mwen: “Fis a lòm, gade byen, Mwen va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 26:26">Lev 26:26</ref></char></note>kase pen sa a nan Jérusalem. Yo va manje pen mezire selon pwa, e ak kè twouble. Yo va bwè dlo pa mezi ak gwo laperèz <verse eid="EZK 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 4:17"/>ke pen ak dlo va vin ra. Konsa, yo va etonnen youn lòt e yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 26:39">Lev 26:39</ref></char></note>vin deperi nan inikite yo.”<verse eid="EZK 4:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="EZK 5"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 5:1"/>“Pou ou menm, Fis a lòm, pran yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 21:5">Lev 21:5</ref></char></note>nepe byen file. Pran l pou sèvi kon razwa sou tèt ou ak bab ou. Epi pran yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 5:27">Dan 5:27</ref></char></note>balans pou peze e divize cheve a. <verse eid="EZK 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 5:2"/>Yon tyè, ou va brile nan dife nan mitan vil la, lè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 39:1-2">Jr 39:1-2</ref></char></note>jou syèj yo vin fini. Epi ou va pran yon tyè e frape l avèk nepe toupatou nan vil la e yon tyè, ou va gaye nan van. Konsa, Mwen va rale yon nepe fè l sòti nan fouwo pa dèyè yo. <verse eid="EZK 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 5:3"/>Pran osi, kèk grenn nan cheve a, pa anpil, e mare yo nan pwent wòb ou. <verse eid="EZK 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 5:4"/>Ankò, pran kèk nan yo pou jete nan dife, e brile yo nan dife a. Soti nan li, yon dife va gaye rive nan tout lakay Israël la.<verse eid="EZK 5:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 5:5"/>“Konsa pale Senyè BONDYE a: ‘Sa se Jérusalem. Mwen te mete li nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 4:6">Det 4:6</ref></char></note>mitan a nasyon yo ak peyi ki antoure li yo. <verse eid="EZK 5:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 5:6"/>Men li te fè rebèl kont lòd Mwen yo pi mal pase nasyon yo, e kont règleman Mwen yo, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 17:8-20">II Wa 17:8-20</ref></char></note>plis ke peyi ki antoure li yo. Paske yo te rejte lòd Mwen yo, e pa t mache nan règleman Mwen yo.’<verse eid="EZK 5:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 5:7"/>“Akoz sa, konsa pale Senyè BONDYE a: ‘Akoz ou gen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 21:9-11">II Wa 21:9-11</ref></char></note>plis twoub pase nasyon ki te antoure ou yo, ou pa t mache nan règleman Mwen yo, ni ou pa t swiv lòd Mwen yo, ni ou pa t swiv lòd a nasyon ki te antoure ou yo’; <verse eid="EZK 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 5:8"/>akoz sa, konsa pale Senyè BONDYE a: ‘Gade byen, Mwen, Mwen menm kont ou, e Mwen va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 24:9">Jr 24:9</ref></char></note>egzekite jijman pami nou pou tout lòt nasyon yo ka wè. <verse eid="EZK 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 5:9"/>Akoz tout abominasyon nou yo, Mwen va fè pami nou sa ke Mwen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 9:12">Dan 9:12</ref></char></note>pa t fè, e tankou sa Mwen p ap janm fè ankò. <verse eid="EZK 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 5:10"/>Pou sa, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 44:11">Sòm 44:11</ref></char></note>papa yo va manje fis yo pami nou, e fis yo va manje papa yo. Paske Mwen va egzekite jijman sou nou e gaye tout retay nou yo nan tout van. <verse eid="EZK 5:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 5:11"/>Jan Mwen viv la’, deklare Senyè BONDYE a: ‘Anverite, akoz nou te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 7:9-11">Jr 7:9-11</ref></char></note>souye Sanktyè pa M nan ak tout zidòl abominab nou yo, e ak tout abominasyon nou yo, konsa M ap desann nou. Pou sa, Zye m p ap gen pitye, e Mwen p ap epanye pèsòn. <verse eid="EZK 5:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 5:12"/>Yon tyè nan nou va mouri akoz epidemi. Yo va vin mouri nan gwo grangou nan mitan nou. Yon tyè va tonbe devan nepe ki toupatou nou. Yon tyè, mwen va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 5:2-10">Éz 5:2-10</ref></char></note>gaye nan tout van yo, e Mwen va rale yon nepe dèyè yo.’”<verse eid="EZK 5:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 5:13"/>Konsa, kòlè M va achevi. Mwen va satisfè gwo mekontantman Mwen sou yo, e Mwen va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 1:24">És 1:24</ref></char></note>satisfè. Epi yo va vin konnen ke Mwen menm, SENYÈ a, Mwen te pale ak zèl lè Mwen te achevi kòlè Mwen sou yo a.<verse eid="EZK 5:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 5:14"/>“‘Anplis, Mwen va fè ou vin yon kote dezole ak yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 74:3-10">Sòm 74:3-10</ref></char></note>objè repwòch pami nasyon ki antoure ou yo, nan zye a tout sila ki pase la yo. <verse eid="EZK 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 5:15"/>Konsa, sa va yon repwòch, yon ensilt, yon avètisman e yon objè degoutan pou nasyon ki antoure ou yo lè Mwen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 66:15-16">És 66:15-16</ref></char></note>egzekite jijman kontra ou nan kòlè Mwen, mekontantman, ak repwòch plen ak raj— Mwen, SENYÈ a fin pale— <verse eid="EZK 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 5:16"/>lè Mwen voye kont yo flèch mechan yo, kon gwo grangou a, yon flèch ki te voye pou detwi nou. Mwen va osi fè gwo grangou a vin pi rèd sou ou e va kase retire sous pen an. <verse eid="EZK 5:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 5:17"/>Anplis, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 26:22">Lev 26:22</ref></char></note>Mwen va voye sou ou gwo grangou, ak bèt sovaj yo e yo va fè ou soufre gwo pèt. Epidemi ak vèse san va rive sou ou. Mwen va mennen nepe sou ou. Mwen, SENYÈ a, Mwen te pale sa a.’”<verse eid="EZK 5:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="EZK 6"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 6:1"/>Pawòl SENYÈ a te vin kote mwen. Li te di: <verse eid="EZK 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 6:2"/>“Fis a lòm, mete figi ou vè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 36:1">Éz 36:1</ref></char></note>mòn Israël yo, e pwofetize kont yo. <verse eid="EZK 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 6:3"/>Di yo: ‘Mòn Israël yo, koute pawòl Senyè BONDYE a! Konsa pale Senyè BONDYE a a mòn yo, kolin yo, ravin dlo yo, ak vale yo: “Gade byen, Mwen menm, Mwen va mennen yon nepe sou nou, e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 26:30">Lev 26:30</ref></char></note>Mwen va detwi wo plas nou yo. <verse eid="EZK 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 6:4"/>Konsa lotèl nou yo va vin dezole, e lotèl lansan yo va vin kraze nèt. Mwen va fè mò nou yo tonbe devan zidòl nou yo. <verse eid="EZK 6:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 6:5"/>Anplis, Mwen va poze kadav mò fis Israël yo devan zidòl yo. E Mwen va gaye <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 23:14-20">II Wa 23:14-20</ref></char></note>zo nou yo toutotou lotèl nou yo. <verse eid="EZK 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 6:6"/>Nan tout kote nou rete, vil nou yo va vin yon savann, e wo plas yo va vin dezole, pou lotèl nou yo kapab vin abandone nèt. Yo va fè yon kote dezole, pou zidòl nou yo ka vin kraze e fini nèt, pou lotèl lansan yo ka vin kraze nèt e zèv nou yo ka vin efase nèt. <verse eid="EZK 6:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 6:7"/>Sila yo touye yo va tonbe pami nou, e nou va konnen ke se Mwen ki SENYÈ a.<verse eid="EZK 6:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 6:8"/>“‘“Malgre sa, Mwen va kite yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 6:13">És 6:13</ref></char></note>retay, paske nou va genyen sila ki chape anba nepe pami nasyon yo nan lè nou vin gaye pami lòt peyi yo. <verse eid="EZK 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 6:9"/>Nan moman sa a, sila ki te chape yo va sonje Mwen pami nasyon yo kote yo pote kon kaptif yo. A la blese Mwen blese <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 78:40">Sòm 78:40</ref></char></note>pa kè adiltè yo, ki te vire kite Mwen e pa zye yo, ki te fè pwostitiye dèyè zidòl yo. Yo va rayi tèt yo nan pwòp zye yo pou mechanste ke yo te komèt yo, pou tout abominasyon yo. <verse eid="EZK 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 6:10"/>Konsa, yo va konnen ke Mwen se SENYÈ a. Se pa anven ke M te di Mwen ta mennen dezas sa a fè vin rive sou yo.”’<verse eid="EZK 6:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 6:11"/>“Konsa pale Senyè BONDYE a: ‘Bat men nou, frape pye nou atè e di: “Elas!”, akoz mechanste a tout mal abominab lakay Israël ki va tonbe pa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 5:12">Éz 5:12</ref></char></note>nepe a, gwo grangou ak epidemi yo. <verse eid="EZK 6:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 6:12"/>Sila ki lwen an va mouri pa epidemi, sila ki pre a va tonbe sou nepe e sila ki rete vin anba syèj la, va mouri nan gwo grangou a. Konsa, Mwen va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LAM 4:11-22">Lam 4:11-22</ref></char></note>pase gwo kòlè Mwen sou yo. <verse eid="EZK 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 6:13"/>Nan moman sa a, nou va konnen ke Mwen se SENYÈ a. Lè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 6:4-7">Éz 6:4-7</ref></char></note>moun touye pa yo jwenn pami zidòl ki antoure lotèl yo, sou tout kolin ki wo, sou tout tèt mòn, anba tout bwa vèt— kote yo te ofri odè ki santi bon a tout zidòl yo. <verse eid="EZK 6:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 6:14"/>Konsa, pami tout abitasyon yo, Mwen va lonje men m kont yo, fè peyi a vin pi dezole e abandone, depi dezè a ki pase vè Dibla a, jis rive nan tout abitasyon yo. Konsa, yo va konnen ke Mwen se SENYÈ a.’”<verse eid="EZK 6:14"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <chapter eid="EZK 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="EZK 7"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 7:1"/>Anplis, pawòl SENYÈ a te vin kote mwen. Li te di: <verse eid="EZK 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 7:2"/>Ou menm, fis a lòm, konsa pale Senyè BONDYE a, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 7:3-6">Éz 7:3-6</ref></char></note>Lafen! Lafen ap pwoche sou kat kwen peyi a. <verse eid="EZK 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 7:3"/>Se koulye a, lafen an sou ou, e Mwen va voye kòlè Mwen kont ou. Mwen va jije ou selon zèv ou. Mwen va mennen tout abominasyon ou yo sou ou. <verse eid="EZK 7:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 7:4"/>Paske zye M p ap gen pitye pou ou, ni Mwen p ap ralanti pou ou, men Mwen va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 11:21">Éz 11:21</ref></char></note>mennen chemen ou yo rive sou ou, abominasyon ou yo va pami ou, e ou va konnen ke Mwen se SENYÈ a!<verse eid="EZK 7:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 7:5"/>“Konsa pale Senyè BONDYE a: ‘Yon gwo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 21:12-13">II Wa 21:12-13</ref></char></note>dezas! Yon dezas san parèy! Gade byen, l ap vini. <verse eid="EZK 7:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 7:6"/>Lafen an ap vini. Lafen an gen tan rive! Li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 13:7">Za 13:7</ref></char></note>leve kont ou. Gade byen, li fin rive! <verse eid="EZK 7:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 7:7"/>Move lè ou a fin rive, O moun peyi a! Lè a rive! <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 22:5">És 22:5</ref></char></note>Jou toupre a—gwo zen olye kri lajwa a ap kriye sou mòn yo. <verse eid="EZK 7:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 7:8"/>Koulye a, nan yon ti tan, Mwen va vide kòlè Mwen sou ou, e achevi kòlè Mwen kont ou. Konsa, M ap <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 7:3">Éz 7:3</ref></char></note>jije ou selon tout chemen ou yo, e mennen sou ou tout abominasyon ou yo. <verse eid="EZK 7:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 7:9"/>Zye m p ap montre okenn pitye, ni Mwen p ap ralanti. Mwen va rekonpanse ou selon chemen ou yo pandan abominasyon ou yo pami nou. Konsa, ou va konnen ke se Mwen, SENYÈ a, ki fè frap la.<verse eid="EZK 7:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 7:10"/>“‘Gade jou a! Gade l byen, l ap vini! Move lè ou a deja parèt. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 89:32">Sòm 89:32</ref></char></note>Baton an fin boujonnen. Ògèy la fin fleri. <verse eid="EZK 7:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 7:11"/>Vyolans fin grandi pou vin fè yon baton <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 73:8">Sòm 73:8</ref></char></note>mechanste. Okenn nan yo p ap rete; okenn nan moun yo, okenn nan richès yo, ni okenn bagay ki gen gwo valè pami yo. <verse eid="EZK 7:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 7:12"/>Lè a fin rive! Jou a prè. Pa kite moun k ap achte a rejwi, ni moun k ap vann nan soufri, paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 5:13-14">És 5:13-14</ref></char></note>gwo chalè a kont tout foul moun yo. <verse eid="EZK 7:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 7:13"/>Anverite, moun k ap vann nan p ap <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 25:24-31">Lev 25:24-31</ref></char></note>retounen nan sa li te vann nan, malgre yo toujou vivan; paske vizyon konsène tout foul moun yo. Yo p ap retounen, ni okenn nan yo p ap ka pwolonje lavi yo nan mitan inikite yo. <verse eid="EZK 7:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 7:14"/>Yo te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 10:9">Nonb 10:9</ref></char></note>soufle twonpèt la, e te fè tout bagay vin prè, men pèsòn pa prale nan batay la, paske gwo kòlè Mwen an kont tout foul moun yo.<verse eid="EZK 7:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 7:15"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:15 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 14:18">Jr 14:18</ref>
      </char>
    </note>“‘Nepe a deyò e epidemi ak gwo grangou a anndan. Sila ki nan chan an va mouri pa nepe. Gwo grangou ak epidemi va, anplis, manje sila anndan vil yo. <verse eid="EZK 7:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 7:16"/>Menm lè sila ki chape yo rive deyò, yo va sou mòn yo tankou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 38:14">És 38:14</ref></char></note>toutrèl nan vale yo, yo tout ap kriye, yo chak nan pwòp inikite yo. <verse eid="EZK 7:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 7:17"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 13:7">És 13:7</ref></char></note>Tout men yo va lage vid e tout jenou yo va vin kon dlo. <verse eid="EZK 7:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 7:18"/>Yo va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 15:3">És 15:3</ref></char></note>abiye yo menm ak twal sak e lafyèv frison va boulvèse yo. Lawont va sou tout figi yo, e tout tèt yo va chòv. <verse eid="EZK 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 7:19"/>Yo va jete <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 11:4">Pwov 11:4</ref></char></note>ajan yo nan lari, e lò yo va vin yon bagay repinyans. Lajan ak lò yo p ap kapab delivre yo nan jou gwo chalè SENYÈ a. Yo p ap ka satisfè apeti yo, ni yo p ap kapab plen vant yo, paske se li ki te fè yo chite. <verse eid="EZK 7:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 7:20"/>Yo te transfòme bote a òneman pa Li yo pou vin ògèye <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 7:30">Jr 7:30</ref></char></note>yo te fè imaj abominasyon yo ak bagay detestab yo avè l. Konsa, Mwen va fè l vin yon bagay abominab pou yo menm. <verse eid="EZK 7:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 7:21"/>Mwen va bay li nan men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 24:13">II Wa 24:13</ref></char></note>etranje yo kon piyaj, nan men mechan sou latè yo kon donmaj, e yo va pwofane li nèt. <verse eid="EZK 7:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 7:22"/>Anplis, Mwen va vire <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 18:17">Jr 18:17</ref></char></note>figi Mwen lwen yo, e yo va pwofane plas sekrè Mwen an. Vòlè yo va antre nan li, e yo va pwofane li.<verse eid="EZK 7:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 7:23"/>“‘Fè chèn nan, paske peyi a plen ak <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 9:9">Éz 9:9</ref></char></note>krim sanglan, e vil la plen ak vyolans. <verse eid="EZK 7:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 7:24"/>Akoz sa, Mwen va mennen fè vini sila ki pi mal nan tout nasyon yo, e se yo k ap posede lakay yo. Mwen va, anplis, fè ògèy a sila ki pwisan yo sispann. Lye sen yo va vin gate nèt. <verse eid="EZK 7:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 7:25"/>Lè gwo doulè a rive, yo va chache <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 13:10-16">Éz 13:10-16</ref></char></note>lapè, men p ap genyen menm. <verse eid="EZK 7:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 7:26"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 47:11">És 47:11</ref></char></note>Gwo dega va rive sou gwo dega, e gwo koze sou gwo koze. Konsa, yo va chache yon vizyon soti nan yon pwofèt, men lalwa va fin pèdi nan men prèt la, e p ap gen konsèy menm nan men ansyen yo. <verse eid="EZK 7:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZK 7:27"/>Wa a va fè dèy, prens lan va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 8:22">Job 8:22</ref></char></note>abiye ak dezespwa, e men a pèp peyi a va pran tranble. Selon kondwit yo, Mwen va aji avèk yo, e selon jijman yo, Mwen va jije yo. Konsa, yo va konnen ke se Mwen ki SENYÈ a.’”<verse eid="EZK 7:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="EZK 8"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 8:1"/>Li te vin rive nan sizyèm ane, sou senkyèm jou, nan sizyèm mwa a, pandan mwen te chita lakay mwen ak ansyen a Juda yo ki te chita devan m, ke men Senyè BONDYE a te tonbe sou mwen la. <verse eid="EZK 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 8:2"/>Answit, mwen te gade e vwala, yon imaj kon aparans a yon nonm—soti nan ren li pou rive anba, te gen aparans dife e soti nan ren li pou monte, aparans yon bagay briyan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 1:4-27">Éz 1:4-27</ref></char></note>tankou metal k ap klere. <verse eid="EZK 8:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 8:3"/>Li te lonje yon bagay sanblab ak yon men, e li te kenbe m nan cheve m nan pati dèyè tèt mwen. Konsa, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 3:12">Éz 3:12</ref></char></note>Lespri a te leve m monte rive antre tè a ak syèl la, e li te mennen mwen nan vizyon Bondye yo pou rive Jérusalem nan antre kote nò nan pòtay pa anndan an, kote ki te gen chèz pou zidòl ki rele jalouzi a, ki konn pwovoke jalouzi a. <verse eid="EZK 8:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 8:4"/>Gade byen, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 1:28">Éz 1:28</ref></char></note>glwa Bondye Israël la te la, tankou aparans ke m te wè nan plèn nan.<verse eid="EZK 8:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 8:5"/>Li te di mwen: “Fis a lòm, leve zye ou koulye a vè nò.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EZK 8:5">Konsa, mwen te leve zye m vè nò, e gade byen, nan nò a pòtay lotèl, se te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 78:58">Sòm 78:58</ref></char></note>zidòl jalouzi a ki te nan antre a.<verse eid="EZK 8:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 8:6"/>Li te di mwen: “Fis a lòm, èske ou wè ki sa y ap fè, gwo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 23:4-5">II Wa 23:4-5</ref></char></note>abominasyon ke lakay Israël ap fè isit la, pou m ta kite sanktyè Mwen an? Malgre toujou, ou va wè abominasyon ki pi gwo.”<verse eid="EZK 8:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 8:7"/>Li te mennen m nan antre lakou enteryè a, e lè m te gade, vwala, yon twou nan mi an. <verse eid="EZK 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 8:8"/>Li te di mwen: “Fis a lòm, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 29:15">És 29:15</ref></char></note>fouye yon twou fonse antre nan mi an.” Konsa, mwen te fouye yon twou fonse antre nan mi an e vwala, yon pòt pou antre.<verse eid="EZK 8:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 8:9"/>Li te di mwen: “Antre ladann pou wè abominasyon mechan ke y ap komèt isit la.”<verse eid="EZK 8:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 8:10"/>Konsa, mwen te antre e vwala, tout fòm bagay ki trennen atè, bèt ak bagay abominab, ak tout zidòl lakay Israël yo te grave kon desen sou mi an toutotou li. <verse eid="EZK 8:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 8:11"/>Epi te kanpe devan yo, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 11:16-25">Nonb 11:16-25</ref></char></note>swasann-dis lansyen a lakay Israël yo, e Jaazania, fis a Schaphan an, te kanpe nan mitan yo, chak moun ak pwòp veso lansan li, e odè nwaj lansan an a t ap leve.<verse eid="EZK 8:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 8:12"/>Epi Li te di mwen: “Fis a lòm, èske ou wè sa ke ansyen lakay Israël yo ap komèt nan fènwa a, chak moun nan chanm a pwòp imaj taye li? Paske men ki sa y ap di: ‘SENYÈ a pa wè nou. SENYÈ a fin abandone peyi a.’” <verse eid="EZK 8:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 8:13"/>Epi Li te di mwen: “Malgre sa, ou va wè abominasyon ki pi gwo ke y ap komèt.”<verse eid="EZK 8:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 8:14"/>Konsa, Li te mennen mwen nan antre a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 44:4">Éz 44:4</ref></char></note>pòtay lakay SENYÈ a ki te vè nò; epi vwala, te gen fanm la ki t ap kriye pou Thammuz. <verse eid="EZK 8:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 8:15"/>Li te di mwen: “Èske ou wè sa, fis a lòm? Malgre sa, ou va wè pi gwo abominasyon ke sa yo.”<verse eid="EZK 8:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 8:16"/>Konsa, Li te mennen mwen antre nan lakou enteryè lakay SENYÈ a. Epi vwala, nan antre tanp SENYÈ a, antre galri ak lotèl la, anviwon venn-senk òm, avèk do yo bay tanp SENYÈ a, e figi yo vè lès. Epi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 4:19">Det 4:19</ref></char></note>yo t ap pwostène yo nan lès vè solèy la.<verse eid="EZK 8:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 8:17"/>Li te di mwen: “Èske ou wè sa, fis a lòm? Èske se yon bagay twò piti pou lakay Juda ta komèt abominasyon ke yo te komèt isit la? Paske yo te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 7:11-23">Éz 7:11-23</ref></char></note>ranpli peyi a ak vyolans e te pwovoke M plizyè fwa? Gade byen, y ap vekse M menm ak ti branch bwa yo poze sou nen yo. <verse eid="EZK 8:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 8:18"/>Akoz sa, anverite, Mwen va aji ak gwo kòlè. Zye m p ap gen pitye, ni Mwen p ap epanye pèsòn. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 1:15">És 1:15</ref></char></note>Malgre yo kriye nan zòrèy Mwen ak gwo vwa, malgre sa, Mwen p ap koute yo.”<verse eid="EZK 8:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="EZK 9"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 9:1"/>Answit, Li te kriye fò pou m tande ak yon gwo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 6:8">És 6:8</ref></char></note>vwa e te di: “Vin pi pre, O nou menm ki an chaj vil la, chak moun ak pwòp zam destriksyon li nan men l.” <verse eid="EZK 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 9:2"/>Gade byen, sis moun te sòti nan pòtay anlè ki pozisyone vè nò a, chak moun ak pwòp zam masak li nan men l. Pami yo, te gen yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 16:4">Lev 16:4</ref></char></note>sèten nonm abiye an len, ak yon valiz pou ekri nan senti l. Epi yo te antre ladann e te kanpe akote lotèl an bwonz lan.<verse eid="EZK 9:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 9:3"/>Konsa, laglwa Bondye Israël la te leve monte soti nan cheriben kote l te poze a, pou rive nan papòt tanp lan. Epi Li te rele nonm abiye an len ak yon valiz pou ekri nan senti li an. <verse eid="EZK 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 9:4"/>SENYÈ a te di li: “Ale pase nan mitan vil la, menm nan mitan Jérusalem, mete yon mak sou fwon a mesye ki plenn nan gòj e ki <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 119:53-136">Sòm 119:53-136</ref></char></note>fè soupi pou tout abominasyon k ap komèt nan mitan li yo.”<verse eid="EZK 9:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 9:5"/>Men pou lòt yo, Li te di nan zòrèy mwen: “Travèse vil la dèyè li pou frape. Pa kite zye ou fè pitye, ni pa ralanti. <verse eid="EZK 9:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 9:6"/>Konplètman, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 36:17">II Kwo 36:17</ref></char></note>touye granmoun, jenn gason, jenn fi, timoun yo ak fanm, men pa touche okenn moun ki gen mak la. Kòmanse soti nan sanktyè pa M nan.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EZK 9:6">Konsa, yo te kòmanse ak ansyen ki te devan tanp yo.<verse eid="EZK 9:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 9:7"/>Epi Li te di yo: “Souye tanp lan e plen lakou a ak mò yo. Ale deyò!” Konsa, yo te ale deyò pou te frape moun nan vil yo.<verse eid="EZK 9:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 9:8"/>Pandan yo t ap frape moun yo e mwen sèl te rete, mwen te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 21:16">I Kwo 21:16</ref></char></note>tonbe sou figi mwen, mwen te kriye fò pou te di: “Anmwey, Senyè BONDYE! Èske W ap detwi tout retay Israël la pandan W ap vide gwo kòlè ou sou Jérusalem nan?”<verse eid="EZK 9:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 9:9"/>Li te reponn mwen: “Inikite lakay Israël ak Juda yo vin trè trè gran. Peyi a vin plen ak san, e vil la <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 22:29">Éz 22:29</ref></char></note>plen ak pèvèsyon. Paske yo di: ‘SENYÈ a te abandone tout peyi a e SENYÈ a pa wè!’ <verse eid="EZK 9:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 9:10"/>Men pou Mwen, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 65:6">És 65:6</ref></char></note>zye M p ap gen pitye ni Mwen p ap ralanti, men Mwen va fè kondwit yo vin rive sou pwòp tèt yo.”<verse eid="EZK 9:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 9:11"/>Epi gade byen, nonm abiye an len, ki te gen valiz ekri nan senti li jan nou te di a, t ap di: “Mwen te fè l jis jan ou te kòmande mwen an.”<verse eid="EZK 9:11"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="EZK 10"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 10:1"/>Answit, mwen te gade e vwala, nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 1:22-26">Éz 1:22-26</ref></char></note>gran espas ouvri ki te sou tèt a cheriben yo, yon bagay tankou yon wòch safì ki pa aparans, te sanble yon twòn ki te parèt anlè yo. <verse eid="EZK 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 10:2"/>Li te pale ak nonm abiye an len an e te di: “Antre nan mitan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 1:15-21">Éz 1:15-21</ref></char></note>wou k ap vire vit fè wonn anba cheriben an, plen men nou ak chabon tou limen ki antre cheriben yo e gaye yo toupatou nan vil la.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EZK 10:2">Konsa, li te antre pou m te ka wè l. <verse eid="EZK 10:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 10:3"/>Alò, cheriben yo te kanpe bò dwat a tanp lan lè nonm nan te antre ladann nan e nwaj la te plen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 8:3-16">Éz 8:3-16</ref></char></note>lakou enteryè a. <verse eid="EZK 10:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 10:4"/>Epi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 9:3">Éz 9:3</ref></char></note>glwa a SENYÈ a te leve monte soti nan cheriben yo, jis rive nan papòt tanp lan. Tanp lan te plen ak nwaj la e lakou a te plen ak ekla a glwa SENYÈ a. <verse eid="EZK 10:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 10:5"/>Anplis, bri a zèl cheriben yo te vin tande jis rive nan lakou eksteyè a, tankou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 40:9">Job 40:9</ref></char></note>vwa SENYÈ Pwisan an lè L pale.<verse eid="EZK 10:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 10:6"/>Li te vin rive lè Li te kòmande nonm abiye an len an e te di: “Pran dife soti nan mitan wou k ap vire vit fè wonn yo, soti antre cheriben yo”. Epi li te antre e te kanpe akote yon wou. <verse eid="EZK 10:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 10:7"/>Konsa, cheriben an te lonje men l soti antre cheriben kote dife ki te antre cheriben yo, pran ladann pou mete nan men a sila ki te abiye an len an, ki te pran l e te sòti deyò. <verse eid="EZK 10:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 10:8"/>Fòm men a yon moun te parèt isit nan cheriben nan anba zèl yo.<verse eid="EZK 10:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 10:9"/>Alò, mwen te gade e vwala, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 1:15-17">Éz 1:15-17</ref></char></note>kat wou akote cheriben yo, yon wou akote chak cheriben. Aparans a wou yo te tankou ekla a pyè krizolit. <verse eid="EZK 10:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 10:10"/>Selon aparans yo, toule kat te sanble menm jan, konsi se te yon wou ki te anndan yon lòt wou. <verse eid="EZK 10:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 10:11"/>Lè yo te deplase yo, yo te ale <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 1:17">Éz 1:17</ref></char></note>nan kat direksyon pa yo, san vire pandan yo t ap prale a. Yo te toujou swiv direksyon kote yo te fikse a, san vire pandan yo t ap prale a. <verse eid="EZK 10:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 10:12"/>Tout <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 4:6-8">Rev 4:6-8</ref></char></note>kò yo, do yo, men yo, zèl yo e wou yo te plen zye toutotou, wou ki t ap sèvi pou toule kat yo. <verse eid="EZK 10:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 10:13"/>Wou yo te rele nan zòrèy mwen, kon wou toubiyon. <verse eid="EZK 10:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 10:14"/>Yo chak te gen kat figi. Premye figi a te figi a yon cheriben, dezyèm figi a te figi a yon nonm, twazyèm figi a te figi yon lyon e katriyèm figi a te figi a yon èg.<verse eid="EZK 10:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 10:15"/>Konsa, cheriben yo te leve monte. Yo se <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 1:3-5">Éz 1:3-5</ref></char></note>kreyati vivan ke m te wè akote rivyè Kebar a. <verse eid="EZK 10:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 10:16"/>Lè cheriben yo te deplase, wou yo ta ale bò kote yo; anplis, lè cheriben yo te leve zèl yo pou leve atè a, wou yo pa t vire pou kite bò kote yo. <verse eid="EZK 10:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 10:17"/>Lè cheriben yo te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 1:21">Éz 1:21</ref></char></note>kanpe an plas, wou yo ta kanpe an plas. Lè yo te leve, wou yo ta leve avèk yo, paske lespri a kreyati vivan an te nan yo.<verse eid="EZK 10:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 10:18"/>Epi glwa SENYÈ a te kite papòt tanp lan, e te kanpe <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 18:10">Sòm 18:10</ref></char></note>anwo cheriben yo. <verse eid="EZK 10:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 10:19"/>Lè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 11:22">Éz 11:22</ref></char></note>cheriben yo te pati, yo te leve zèl yo pou te monte leve kite tè a devan zye m avèk wou yo bò kote yo. Konsa, yo te kanpe dyanm nan antre a pòtay lès lakay SENYÈ a; e glwa a Bondye Israël la te tann sou yo.<verse eid="EZK 10:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 10:20"/>Sa yo se <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 1:5-26">Éz 1:5-26</ref></char></note>kreyati vivan ke m te wè anba Bondye Israël la akote rivyè Kebar a; konsa, mwen te konnen ke se cheriben yo te ye. <verse eid="EZK 10:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 10:21"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 1:6-8">Éz 1:6-8</ref></char></note>Chak te gen kat figi, chak te gen kat zèl, e anba zèl yo, se te fòm men moun. <verse eid="EZK 10:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 10:22"/>Selon sa figi yo te sanble, yo te gen menm figi yo aparans ke mwen te wè akote rivyè Kebar a. Yo chak te ale tou dwat devan.<verse eid="EZK 10:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="EZK 11"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 11:1"/>Anplis, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 3:12-14">Éz 3:12-14</ref></char></note>Lespri a te leve m monte e te mennen mwen nan pòtay lès lakay SENYÈ a ki te anfas vè lès. Epi gade byen, venn-senk mesye nan antre pòtay la e pami yo, mwen te wè Jaazania, fis a Azzur a ak Pelathia, fis a Benaja a, chèf yo a pèp la. <verse eid="EZK 11:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 11:2"/>Li te di mwen: “Fis a lòm, sila yo se mesye yo ki fè plan inikite e ki <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 2:1">Sòm 2:1</ref></char></note>bay move konsèy nan vil sa a, <verse eid="EZK 11:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 11:3"/>ka p di: ‘Tan pou bati kay yo pa pwòch. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 1:13">Jr 1:13</ref></char></note>Vil sa a se chodyè a e nou se chè a.’ <verse eid="EZK 11:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 11:4"/>Akoz sa, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 3:4-17">Éz 3:4-17</ref></char></note>pwofetize kont yo, fis a lòm. Se pou ou pwofetize!”<verse eid="EZK 11:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 11:5"/>Lespri SENYÈ a te tonbe sou mwen e Li te di mwen: “Pale konsa, ‘Konsa pale SENYÈ a: “Konsa ou reflechi, o lakay Israël, paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 11:20">Jr 11:20</ref></char></note>Mwen konnen panse nou yo. <verse eid="EZK 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 11:6"/>Nou te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 1:15">És 1:15</ref></char></note>miltipliye moun ki touye yo nan vil sa a, e plen ri yo nèt avèk yo.”<verse eid="EZK 11:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 11:7"/>“‘Pou sa, pale Senyè BONDYE a: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 24:3-13">Éz 24:3-13</ref></char></note>“Moun touye nou yo ke nou te fè kouche nan mitan vil la, se chè a, e vil la se chodyè a; men nou va mennen sòti ladann. <verse eid="EZK 11:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 11:8"/>Nou te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 10:24">Pwov 10:24</ref></char></note>pè yon nepe. Pou sa, mwen va mennen yon nepe rive sou nou,” deklare Senyè BONDYE a. <verse eid="EZK 11:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 11:9"/>“Epi Mwen va mennen nou sòti nan mitan vil la. Mwen va delivre nou nan men a etranje yo, e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 5:8">Éz 5:8</ref></char></note>egzekite jijman kont nou. <verse eid="EZK 11:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 11:10"/>Nou va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 52:9-10">Jr 52:9-10</ref></char></note>tonbe pa nepe. Mwen va jije nou jis rive nan lizyè Israël la. Konsa, nou va konnen ke Mwen se SENYÈ a. <verse eid="EZK 11:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 11:11"/>Vil la p ap yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 11:3-7">Éz 11:3-7</ref></char></note>chodyè pou nou, ni nou p ap chè nan mitan l. Men Mwen va jije nou jis rive nan lizyè Israël la. <verse eid="EZK 11:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 11:12"/>Konsa, nou va konnen ke Mwen se SENYÈ a, paske nou pa t mache nan règleman Mwen yo. Ni nou pa t <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 18:8-9">Éz 18:8-9</ref></char></note>swiv lalwa Mwen yo, men nou te aji selon lalwa a nasyon sila ki antoure nou yo.”’”<verse eid="EZK 11:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 11:13"/>Alò, li te vin rive ke pandan mwen t ap pwofetize a, ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 11:1">Éz 11:1</ref></char></note>Pelathia, fis a Benaja a, te mouri. Epi mwen te tonbe sou figi mwen, mwen te kriye fò ak yon gwo vwa e mwen te di: “Anmwey, Senyè BONDYE! Èske Ou va mennen retay Israël la pou fin detwi nèt?” <verse eid="EZK 11:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 11:14"/>Epi pawòl SENYÈ a te rive kote mwen. Li te di: <verse eid="EZK 11:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 11:15"/>“Fis a lòm, frè ou yo, fanmi ou yo, egzile parèy ou yo ak tout lakay Israël la, yo tout, se moun a sila abitan Jérusalem yo te di: ‘Ale lwen SENYÈ a; peyi sa a te bay a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 33:24">Éz 33:24</ref></char></note>nou kon posesyon.’”<verse eid="EZK 11:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 11:16"/>“Akoz sa, ou va di: ‘Konsa pale Senyè BONDYE a: “Byenke mwen te deplase yo byen lwen pami nasyon yo e byenke mwen te gaye yo pami peyi yo, malgre mwen va yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 31:20">Sòm 31:20</ref></char></note>abri pou yo pou yon ti tan nan peyi kote yo rive yo.”’<verse eid="EZK 11:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 11:17"/>“Akoz sa, ou va di: ‘Konsa pale Senyè BONDYE a: “Mwen va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 11:11-16">És 11:11-16</ref></char></note>ranmase nou soti nan pèp yo, Mwen va rasanble nou sòti nan peyi pami sila nou te gaye yo, e Mwen va bannou peyi Israël la.”<verse eid="EZK 11:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 11:18"/>“‘Lè yo vini la, yo va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 37:23">Éz 37:23</ref></char></note>retire tout bagay abominab li yo ak tout abominasyon li yo sòti ladann. <verse eid="EZK 11:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 11:19"/>Konsa, Mwen va bay yo yon sèl kè e Mwen va mete yon lespri nèf anndan yo. Epi Mwen va retire <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 7:12">Za 7:12</ref></char></note>kè wòch ki nan chè yo a, e Mwen va bay yo yon kè ki fèt ak chè, <verse eid="EZK 11:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 11:20"/>pou yo ka <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 105:45">Sòm 105:45</ref></char></note>mache nan règleman Mwen yo e kenbe lalwa Mwen yo pou fè yo. Konsa, yo va pèp Mwen e Mwen va Bondye yo. <verse eid="EZK 11:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 11:21"/>Men pou sila ak kè k ap swiv bagay abominab yo ak abominasyon yo, Mwen va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 9:10">Éz 9:10</ref></char></note>mennen kondwit yo desann sou tèt yo,” deklare “Senyè BONDYE a.”<verse eid="EZK 11:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 11:22"/>Epi cheriben yo te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 10:19">Éz 10:19</ref></char></note>leve zèl yo ak wou akote yo e glwa a Bondye Israël la te vin pann sou yo. <verse eid="EZK 11:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 11:23"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 8:4">Éz 8:4</ref></char></note>Glwa SENYÈ a te monte soti nan mitan vil la e te kanpe anwo mòn ki nan pati lès vil la. <verse eid="EZK 11:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 11:24"/>Epi Lespri a te fè m leve e te mennen mwen nan yon vizyon pa Lespri Bondye a, bò kote egzile Chaldée yo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EZK 11:24">Se konsa vizyon mwen te wè a, te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 10:16">Trav 10:16</ref></char></note>kite mwen. <verse eid="EZK 11:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 11:25"/>Epi mwen te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 2:7">Éz 2:7</ref></char></note>di egzile yo tout bagay ke SENYÈ a te montre mwen.<verse eid="EZK 11:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="EZK 12"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 12:1"/>Pawòl SENYÈ a te vin kote mwen. Li te di: <verse eid="EZK 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 12:2"/>Fis a lòm, ou rete nan mitan yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 78:40">Sòm 78:40</ref></char></note>kay rebèl, ki gen zye pou wè, men yo pa wè, e zòrèy pou tande, men yo pa tande; paske se kay rebèl yo ye.<verse eid="EZK 12:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 12:3"/>“Pou sa, fis a lòm, prepare valiz ou menm pou ou ekzile e antre an egzil nan mitan jounen an kote yo ka wè l byen klè. Nan egzil, ou va deplase yon kote pou rive yon lòt kote devan zye yo. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 26:3">Jr 26:3</ref></char></note>Petèt yo va konprann, malgre se yon kay rebèl yo ye. <verse eid="EZK 12:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 12:4"/>Mete bagaj ou deyò devan zye yo, kon bagaj pou egzil. Konsa, ou va sòti deyò nan aswè devan zye yo, tankou sila ki prale an egzil yo. <verse eid="EZK 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 12:5"/>Fouye yon twou nan miray la devan zye yo, e sòti ladann pou vin deyò. <verse eid="EZK 12:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 12:6"/>Mete bagaj ou sou zepòl ou devan yo pou yo wè e pote li sòti deyò nan aswè. Ou va kouvri figi ou pou ou pa ka wè peyi a, paske Mwen plase ou kon yon sign pou lakay Israël.”<verse eid="EZK 12:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 12:7"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:7 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 24:18">Éz 24:18</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Mwen te fè sa konsa jan mwen te kòmande a. Nan lajounen, mwen te mennen bagaj mwen deyò, tankou bagaj a yon egzile. Epi nan aswè, mwen te fouye yon twou nan miray la ak men m. Mwen te sòti deyò nan fènwa a e te pote li sou zepòl mwen pou yo ta ka wè l.<verse eid="EZK 12:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 12:8"/>Nan maten, pawòl SENYÈ a te rive kote mwen e te di: <verse eid="EZK 12:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 12:9"/>“Fis a lòm, èske lakay Israël, kay rebèl sa a, pa t di ou: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 17:12">Éz 17:12</ref></char></note>‘Kisa w ap fè la a?’<verse eid="EZK 12:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 12:10"/>“Di yo: ‘Konsa pale Senyè BONDYE a: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 9:25">II Wa 9:25</ref></char></note>“Fado sa a se pou prens Jérusalem nan, li menm ak tout lakay Israël ki ladann nan.”’<verse eid="EZK 12:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 12:11"/>“Di yo: ‘Mwen se yon sign pou nou. Jan mwen te fè, se konsa l ap vin rive nou. Konsa, yo va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 15:2">Jr 15:2</ref></char></note>ale an egzil, an kaptivite.<verse eid="EZK 12:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 12:12"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:12 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 25:4">II Wa 25:4</ref>
      </char>
    </note>“‘Prens ki pami yo a va chaje bagaj li sou zepòl li nan aswè pou sòti. Yo va fouye yon twou nan miray la pou fè l sòti. Li va kouvri figi li pou li pa wè peyi a ak pwòp zye li. <verse eid="EZK 12:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 12:13"/>Anplis, Mwen va voye filè Mwen sou li e li va vin kenbe nan pèlen Mwen. Konsa, Mwen va mennen li Babylone, nan peyi a Kaldeyen yo. Men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 39:7">Jr 39:7</ref></char></note>li p ap wè l; malgre sa, se la l ap mouri. <verse eid="EZK 12:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 12:14"/>Mwen va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 25:4-5">II Wa 25:4-5</ref></char></note>gaye nan tout van, tout sila ki antoure li yo, moun k ap ede li yo ak tout sòlda li yo. Epi se nepe a Mwen va rale dèyè yo.<verse eid="EZK 12:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 12:15"/>“‘Pou yo ka <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 6:7-14">Éz 6:7-14</ref></char></note>konnen ke Mwen se SENYÈ a lè Mwen gaye yo pami nasyon yo e pwopaje yo pami peyi yo. <verse eid="EZK 12:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 12:16"/>Men Mwen va epanye kèk nan yo de nepe a, gwo grangou a, ak epidemi a, pou yo ka pale tout abominasyon yo pami nasyon kote yo prale yo. Konsa, yo va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 22:8-9">Jr 22:8-9</ref></char></note>konnen ke Mwen se SENYÈ a.’”<verse eid="EZK 12:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 12:17"/>Anplis, pawòl SENYÈ a te vin kote mwen e te di: <verse eid="EZK 12:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 12:18"/>“Fis a lòm, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LAM 5:9">Lam 5:9</ref></char></note>manje pen ou ak tranbleman, e bwè dlo ou ak tranbleman e ak kè twouble. <verse eid="EZK 12:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 12:19"/>Di a pèp peyi a: ‘Konsa pale Senyè BONDYE a konsènan moun ki rete Jérusalem yo nan peyi Israël la: “Yo va manje pen yo ak kè twouble e bwè dlo ak gwo laperèz, akoz peyi yo va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 10:22">Jr 10:22</ref></char></note>depouye nèt de tout bonte li, akoz vyolans a tout moun ki demere ladann yo. <verse eid="EZK 12:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 12:20"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 3:26">És 3:26</ref></char></note>Vil kote moun rete yo va vin devaste nèt e peyi a va vin yon dezolasyon. Konsa, ou va konnen ke Mwen se SENYÈ a.”’”<verse eid="EZK 12:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 12:21"/>Pawòl SENYÈ a te vin kote mwen e te di: <verse eid="EZK 12:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 12:22"/>“Fis a lòm, ki pwovèb sa a, ke nou menm pèp la, gen konsènan peyi Israël, ki di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 5:12">Jr 5:12</ref></char></note>‘Jou yo long e tout vizyon yo vin gate’? <verse eid="EZK 12:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 12:23"/>Pou sa, di yo: ‘Konsa pale Senyè BONDYE a: “Mwen va fè pwovèb sa a sispann pou yo pa sèvi l ankò kon pwovèb an Israël.”’ Men di yo: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 37:13">Sòm 37:13</ref></char></note> “Jou yo ap apwoche ansanm ak lè pou tout vizyon yo akonpli. <verse eid="EZK 12:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 12:24"/>Paske p ap gen ankò okenn <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 14:13-16">Jr 14:13-16</ref></char></note>fo vizyon ni okenn divinasyon flatè anndan kay Israël la. <verse eid="EZK 12:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 12:25"/>Paske Mwen menm, SENYÈ a va pale e nenpòt <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 14:28-34">Nonb 14:28-34</ref></char></note>pawòl ke M di, va vin acheve. Sa p ap pran reta ankò, paske nan jou ou yo, O lakay rebèl, Mwen va pale pawòl la e Mwen va akonpli li,” deklare Senyè BONDYE a.’”<verse eid="EZK 12:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 12:26"/>Anplis, pawòl SENYÈ a te vin kote mwen e te di: <verse eid="EZK 12:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZK 12:27"/>“Fis a lòm, gade byen, lakay Israël ap di: ‘Vizyon ke li fè a se pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 12:22">Éz 12:22</ref></char></note>anpil ane k ap vini e li pwofetize pou yon tan ki lwen.’<verse eid="EZK 12:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZK 12:28"/>“Pou sa, di yo: ‘Konsa pale Senyè BONDYE a: “Okenn nan pawòl Mwen yo p ap pran reta ankò. Nenpòt sa ke M pale, va vin akonpli,” deklare Senyè BONDYE a.’”<verse eid="EZK 12:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="EZK 13"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 13:1"/>Pawòl SENYÈ a te vin kote mwen. Li te di: <verse eid="EZK 13:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 13:2"/>“Fis a lòm, pwofetize kont <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 9:15">És 9:15</ref></char></note>pwofèt Israël ki pwofetize. Di a sila kap pwofetize pawòl ki soti nan pwòp enspirasyon pa yo, ‘Koute pawòl SENYÈ a: <verse eid="EZK 13:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 13:3"/>Konsa pale Senyè BONDYE a: “Malè a pwofèt san konprann k ap swiv pwòp lespri pa yo, e ki pa t vrèman wè anyen. <verse eid="EZK 13:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 13:4"/>O Israël, pwofèt nou yo te tankou rena pami pil mazi ki fin kraze. <verse eid="EZK 13:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 13:5"/>Nou pa t antre nan brèch yo, ni nou pa t bati yon miray pou antoure lakay Israël pou l ta ka kanpe nan batay nan jou SENYÈ a. <verse eid="EZK 13:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 13:6"/>Yo wè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 29:8">Jr 29:8</ref></char></note>tout sa ki fo, ak divinò k ap bay manti yo, k ap di: ‘Pawòl SENYÈ a deklare’, lè se pa SENYÈ a ki te voye yo. Malgre sa, yo gen espwa ke pawòl yo va vin akonpli. <verse eid="EZK 13:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 13:7"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 22:28">Éz 22:28</ref></char></note>Èske nou pa t fè yon fo vizyon, e pale ak lang ki t ap bay manti lè nou te di: ‘SENYÈ a deklare’, men se pa Mwen ki te pale a?”’”<verse eid="EZK 13:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 13:8"/>Akoz sa, pale Senyè BONDYE a: “Akoz nou te pale sa ki fo, e te wè yon manti; akoz sa, gade byen, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 5:8">Éz 5:8</ref></char></note>Mwen kont nou,” deklare Senyè BONDYE a. <verse eid="EZK 13:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 13:9"/>“Konsa, men Mwen va kont <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 20:3-6">Jr 20:3-6</ref></char></note>pwofèt yo ki fè fo vizyon yo; ki pale divinasyon ki manti yo. Yo p ap gen plas nan konsèy a pèp Mwen an ni yo p ap ekri nan rejis lakay Israël yo. Ni yo p ap antre nan peyi Israël la. Konsa, nou ka konnen ke Mwen se Senyè BONDYE a.”<verse eid="EZK 13:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 13:10"/>“‘Akoz, anverite yo te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 23:32">Jr 23:32</ref></char></note>egare pèp Mwen an lè yo te di: “Lapè,” lè pa t gen lapè. Lè nenpòt moun bati yon miray, gade byen, yo fè l randwi ak lacho. <verse eid="EZK 13:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 13:11"/>Donk, pale a sila ki randwi li ak lacho yo, ke li va tonbe. Yon inondasyon lapli va vini, e nou menm, o gran lagrèl, va tonbe. Yon van vyolan va pete l. <verse eid="EZK 13:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 13:12"/>Gade byen, lè miray la fin tonbe, èske yo p ap mande nou: “Kote lacho ke nou te sèvi nan randwi li a?”<verse eid="EZK 13:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 13:13"/>“‘Pou sa, pale Senyè BONDYE a: “Mwen va fè yon van vyolan vin pete nan kòlè Mwen. Anplis, va genyen nan mekontantman Mwen, yon inondasyon lapli ak <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 9:24-25">Egz 9:24-25</ref></char></note>lagrèl pou konsonmen li nèt ak gwo laraj. <verse eid="EZK 13:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 13:14"/>Konsa, Mwen va demoli miray ke nou te kouvri ak randisaj la jis rive atè, jis <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MIC 1:6">Mi 1:6</ref></char></note>fondasyon li yo fin ekspoze nèt. Epi lè l tonbe, nou va vin manje nan mitan li. Epi nou va vin konprann ke se Mwen ki SENYÈ a. <verse eid="EZK 13:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 13:15"/>Se konsa, Mwen va pase kòlè Mwen sou miray la ak sou sila ki te fè randisaj ak lacho sou li yo. Mwen va di nou, ‘Miray la pa la ankò, ni bòs randisaj yo pa la ankò. <verse eid="EZK 13:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 13:16"/>Konsa ak pwofèt Israël sa yo ki pwofetize a Jérusalem yo, ki te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 6:14">Jr 6:14</ref></char></note>fè vizyon lapè pou li yo, lè pat gen lapè a,’” deklare Senyè BONDYE a.<verse eid="EZK 13:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 13:17"/>Alò, ou menm, fis a lòm, mete figi ou kont fi a pèp ou yo, k ap pwofetize apati <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 13:2">Éz 13:2</ref></char></note>pwòp enspirasyon yo. Se pou ou pwofetize kont yo, <verse eid="EZK 13:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 13:18"/>pou di: “Konsa pale Senyè BONDYE a: ‘Malè a fanm ki koud braslè kon wanga sou tout ponyèt yo e fè vwal yo pou tèt moun tout wotè, pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2PE 2:14">II Pi 2:14</ref></char></note> fè lachas moun! Èske nou va chase nanm a pèp Mwen an, men konsève nanm a lòt yo pou nou menm? <verse eid="EZK 13:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 13:19"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 28:21">Pwov 28:21</ref></char></note>Pou yon men ki plen ak lòj ak kèk grenn pen, nou te degrade Mwen a pèp Mwen an, pou fè lantre nan lanmò kèk nanm ki pa ta dwe mouri, e kenbe vivan lòt ki pa ta dwe viv, nan fè manti ou a pèp Mwen an ki koute manti.’”<verse eid="EZK 13:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 13:20"/>Akoz sa, pale Senyè BONDYE a: “Gade byen, Mwen kont braslè wanga nou yo, avèk sila nou chache lavi moun, tankou se zwazo yo. Mwen va rache yo nan bra nou. Epi Mwen va lage nanm sa yo lib, menm nanm de sila ke nou kapte, tankou se zwazo yo. <verse eid="EZK 13:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 13:21"/>Anplis, Mwen va chire vwal nou yo, Mwen va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 91:3">Sòm 91:3</ref></char></note>delivre pèp Mwen an soti nan men nou, e yo p ap nan men nou ankò pou fè viktim lachas. Konsa, nou va konnen ke Mwen se SENYÈ a. <verse eid="EZK 13:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 13:22"/>Akoz nou te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="AMO 5:12">Am 5:12</ref></char></note>dekouraje moun ladwati a lè Mwen pa t fè yo trist; epi nou te ankouraje mechan an pou l pa kite mechanste li, pou l sove, <verse eid="EZK 13:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 13:23"/>pou sa, nou p ap fè fo vizyon ankò, ni pratike divinasyon. Mwen va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 13:21">Éz 13:21</ref></char></note>delivre pèp Mwen an sòti nan men nou. Konsa, nou va konnen ke Mwen se SENYÈ a.”<verse eid="EZK 13:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="EZK 14"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 14:1"/>Epi kèk nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 6:32">II Wa 6:32</ref></char></note>ansyen Israël yo te parèt kote mwen e te chita devan m. <verse eid="EZK 14:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 14:2"/>Pawòl SENYÈ a te rive kote mwen. Li te di: <verse eid="EZK 14:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 14:3"/>“Fis a lòm, mesye sila yo te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 20:16">Éz 20:16</ref></char></note>fin etabli zidòl pa yo nan kè yo. Yo te mete yo toudwat devan figi yo kon wòch k ap fè moun chite, a pou fè yo tonbe nan inikite yo. Èske Mwen ta menm dwe koute kesyon yo? <verse eid="EZK 14:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 14:4"/>Pou sa, pale ak yo e di yo: ‘Konsa pale Senyè BONDYE a: “Nenpòt moun lakay Israël ki pozisyone zidòl nan kè li, ki mete dwat devan figi l, wòch ki pou fè l tonbe nan inikite li a, e alò, ta vin jwenn pwofèt la, Mwen menm, SENYÈ a, va vin bay li repons sou sijè a, an akòd ak <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 21:20-24">I Wa 21:20-24</ref></char></note>fòs kantite zidòl li genyen yo, <verse eid="EZK 14:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 14:5"/>pou M ka kenbe <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 17:10">Jr 17:10</ref></char></note>kè lakay Israël la, tout ki byen lwen M akoz zidòl yo.”’”<verse eid="EZK 14:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 14:6"/>“Pou sa, di a tout lakay Israël la, ‘Konsa pale Senyè BONDYE a: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 7:3">I Sam 7:3</ref></char></note> “Repanti, vire kite zidòl nou yo, e vire figi nou lwen de tout abominasyon nou yo.”’”<verse eid="EZK 14:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 14:7"/>“Paske nenpòt moun lakay Israël, o menm <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 12:48">Egz 12:48</ref></char></note>etranje ki vin viv la, ki separe li de Mwen menm, pou l mete zidòl li yo nan kè l, ki vin mete dwat devan figi li, wòch ki pou fè l tonbe nan inikite li a, e alò apre ta rive kote pwofèt la pou mande koze pou pwòp tèt li, Mwen menm, SENYÈ a, Mwen va vin parèt pou bay li repons nan pwòp pèsonaj pa M. <verse eid="EZK 14:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 14:8"/>Mwen va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 44:11">Jr 44:11</ref></char></note>pozisyone figi M kont mesye sa a, fè li yon sign ak yon pwovèb, e Mwen va koupe retire li nèt de pèp Mwen an. Konsa, nou va konnen ke Mwen se SENYÈ a.<verse eid="EZK 14:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 14:9"/>“Men si pwofèt sila vin twonpe, epi pale yon pawòl, se Mwen menm, SENYÈ a, ki te fè pwofèt sa a vin twonpe. Konsa, Mwen va lonje men M kont li pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 6:14-15">Jr 6:14-15</ref></char></note>detwi li soti pami pèp Mwen an, Israël. <verse eid="EZK 14:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 14:10"/>Yo va pote frè inikite yo. Jan inikite a sila k ap mande l pale a, se konsa inikite a pwofèt la va ye, <verse eid="EZK 14:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 14:11"/>pou lakay Israël pa egare lwen Mwen ankò, e pou yo pa souye tèt yo ankò ak tout transgresyon yo. Konsa, yo va vin pèp mwen, e Mwen va Bondye yo,” deklare Senyè BONDYE a.”<verse eid="EZK 14:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 14:12"/>Ankò, pawòl SENYÈ a te vin kote mwen, e te di: <verse eid="EZK 14:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 14:13"/>“Fis a lòm, si yon peyi peche kont Mwen nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 15:8">Éz 15:8</ref></char></note>komèt enfidelite, Mwen va lonje men M kont li, detwi sous pen li, voye gwo grangou kont li, e koupe retire nèt de li, ni lòm, ni bèt. <verse eid="EZK 14:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 14:14"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 15:1">Jr 15:1</ref></char></note>Menmsi twa mesye sila yo, Noé, Daniel, ak Job te nan mitan yo, ladwati yo pa ta delivre plis ke pwop nanm pa yo”, deklare Senyè BONDYE a.<verse eid="EZK 14:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 14:15"/>“Si Mwen te fè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 26:22">Lev 26:22</ref></char></note>bèt sovaj pase nan peyi a, e li vin dezole jis pou pèsòn pa ta pase ladann akoz bèt yo, <verse eid="EZK 14:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 14:16"/>menmsi twa mesye sila yo te la nan mitan l, kon Mwen viv la”, deklare Senyè BONDYE a, “yo pa t ap ka delivre ni fis yo, ni fi yo. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 19:29">Jen 19:29</ref></char></note>Se yo sèl ki t ap delivre, men peyi a t ap vin dezole nèt.<verse eid="EZK 14:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 14:17"/>“Ni, si Mwen ta <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 26:25">Lev 26:25</ref></char></note>mennen yon nepe sou peyi sa a e di: ‘Kite nepe a pase nan tout peyi a pou koupe retire nèt ni lòm ni bèt ladann,’— <verse eid="EZK 14:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 14:18"/>menmsi, twa mesye sila yo te nan mitan l, kon Mwen viv la,” deklare Senyè BONDYE a, “yo pa t ap ka delivre ni fis yo, ni fi yo, men se sèl yo menm ki ta delivre.<verse eid="EZK 14:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 14:19"/>“Oswa, si M ta voye yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 14:12">Jr 14:12</ref></char></note>gwo grangou kont peyi sa, e vide kòlè Mwen an san sou li, pou koupe retire nèt ni lòm ni bèt ladann— <verse eid="EZK 14:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 14:20"/>menmsi Noé, Daniel ak Job te nan mitan l, kon Mwen viv la, deklare Senyè BONDYE a, “yo pa t ap ka delivre ni fis yo, ni fi yo. Yo ta delivre sèlman pwòp tèt yo, pa ladwati pa yo.”<verse eid="EZK 14:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 14:21"/>Paske konsa pale Senyè BONDYE a: “Konbyen ankò <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 5:17">Éz 5:17</ref></char></note>lè Mwen voye kat gwo jijman Mwen yo kont Jérusalem: nepe, gwo grangou, bèt sovaj ak epidemi pou koupe retire nèt ni lòm ni bèt sou li! <verse eid="EZK 14:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 14:22"/>Malgre sa, gade byen, gen yon retay ki va pote soti ladann, ni fis, ni fi. Gade byen, yo va vin parèt vè ou menm e ou va wè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 12:16">Éz 12:16</ref></char></note>kondwit ak zèv yo. Konsa ou va vin rekonfòte pou gwo malè ke M te mennen sou Jérusalem nan, pou tout bagay ke M te mennen sou li yo. <verse eid="EZK 14:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 14:23"/>Nan lè sa a, yo va rekonfòte ou lè ou wè kondwit ak aksyon yo, paske ou va konnen ke M pa t fè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 22:8-9">Jr 22:8-9</ref></char></note>anyen san koz,” deklare Senyè BONDYE a.<verse eid="EZK 14:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="EZK 15"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 15:1"/>Konsa, pawòl SENYÈ a te vin kote mwen. Li te di: <verse eid="EZK 15:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 15:2"/>Fis a lòm, kisa bwa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 80:8-16">Sòm 80:8-16</ref></char></note>chan rezen fè pou l pi bon pase nenpòt bwa branch lyann yo ki pami pyebwa forè yo? <verse eid="EZK 15:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 15:3"/>Èske ou ka retire bwa sou li pou fè yon bagay, oswa èske moun ka fè yon kwòk ak li pou pann veso? <verse eid="EZK 15:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 15:4"/>Si yo te mete li nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 27:11">És 27:11</ref></char></note>dife la pou brile, dife a fin manje de pwent li e mitan an fin boukannen tounwa. Konsa, èske li ka itil pou yon bagay? <verse eid="EZK 15:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 15:5"/>Gade byen, pandan li an bòn fòm nan, li pa itil anyen. Konbyen anmwens lè dife fin manje li e vin boukannen l tounwa a, pou l ka itil pou fè yon bagay!<verse eid="EZK 15:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 15:6"/>Pou sa, konsa pale Senyè BONDYE a: “Jan lyann yo pami tout pyebwa forè yo, ke m te bay nan dife pou brile a, se konsa mwen te bay moun ki rete Jérusalem yo. <verse eid="EZK 15:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 15:7"/>Mwen mete figi M kont yo. Byenke yo te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 19:17">I Wa 19:17</ref></char></note>sòti nan dife a, malgre sa, dife a va manje yo. Ou va konnen ke Mwen se SENYÈ a, lè Mwen mete figi M kont yo. <verse eid="EZK 15:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 15:8"/>Konsa, Mwen va fè tè a vin dezole, akoz yo te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 14:13">Éz 14:13</ref></char></note>aji ak enfidelite,” deklare Senyè BONDYE a.<verse eid="EZK 15:8"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="EZK 16"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 16:1"/>Ankò, pawòl SENYÈ a te vin kote mwen. Li te di: <verse eid="EZK 16:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 16:2"/>“Fis a lòm, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 58:1">És 58:1</ref></char></note>fè Jérusalem konnen abominasyon li yo. <verse eid="EZK 16:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 16:3"/>Di li: ‘Konsa pale Senyè BONDYE a a Jérusalem: “Orijin ou ak nesans ou se te nan peyi Canaan, papa ou se te yon Amoreyen e manman ou yon Etyèn. <verse eid="EZK 16:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 16:4"/>Pou nesans ou, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 2:3">Os 2:3</ref></char></note>nan jou ou te fèt la, kòd lonbrit ou pa t koupe, ni ou pa t lave ak dlo pou vin pwòp. Ou pa t fwote ak sèl, ni menm vlope nan rad. <verse eid="EZK 16:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 16:5"/>Pa t gen zye ki te gen pitye pou ou, ni ki te gen konpasyon pou ou. Pito ou te jete nan yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 32:10">Det 32:10</ref></char></note>chan ouvri, paske yo te twouve ou abominab depi jou ke ou te fèt la.<verse eid="EZK 16:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 16:6"/>“‘“Lè m te pase bò kote ou, e Mwen te wè ou t ap tòde nan san ou, Mwen te di ou pandan ou te nan san ou an: ‘Viv’! Wi, Mwen te di ou pandan ou te nan san ou an: ‘Viv’! <verse eid="EZK 16:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 16:7"/>Mwen te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 1:7">Egz 1:7</ref></char></note>fè ou vin anpil, tankou plant nan chan yo. Ou te vin grandi, ou te vin wo, e ou te vin rive nan laj pou bèl flè. Tete ou te fòme e cheve ou te grandi. Malgre sa, ou te toutouni e san rad.<verse eid="EZK 16:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 16:8"/>“‘“Mwen te pase bò kote ou pou te wè ou e gade byen, ou te vin nan lè pou fè renmen. Alò konsa, mwen te lonje jip Mwen sou ou pou te kouvri toutouni ou an. Anplis, Mwen te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 22:16-18">Jen 22:16-18</ref></char></note>sèmante a ou menm, e te antre nan yon akò avèk ou pou ou te vin pou Mwen,” deklare Senyè BONDYE a.<verse eid="EZK 16:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 16:9"/>“‘“Mwen te benyen ou ak dlo, lave fè san sòti sou ou e Mwen te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="RUT 3:3">Rt 3:3</ref></char></note>onksyone ou avèk lwil. <verse eid="EZK 16:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 16:10"/>Anplis, Mwen te abiye ou ak twal ak bèl <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 26:36">Egz 26:36</ref></char></note>bwodri, Mwen te mete sandal fèt ak po bazann nan pye ou. Mwen te vlope ou ak len fen e te kouvri ou ak swa. <verse eid="EZK 16:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 16:11"/>Mwen te fè ou bèl ak dekorasyon. Mwen te mete braslè nan men ou ak yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 41:42">Jen 41:42</ref></char></note>kolye nan kou ou. <verse eid="EZK 16:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 16:12"/>Anplis, mwen te mete yon zanno nan nen ou, zanno nan zòrèy ou ak yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 28:5">És 28:5</ref></char></note>bèl kouwòn nan tèt ou. <verse eid="EZK 16:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 16:13"/>Konsa, ou te anbeli ak lò ak ajan e wòb ou te fèt ak len fen, oswa ak twal bwodri. Ou te manje farin fen, siwo myèl, ak lwil. Konsa, ou te tèlman vin bèl, e vin avanse nan yon pozisyon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 10:1">I Sam 10:1</ref></char></note>wayal. <verse eid="EZK 16:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 16:14"/>Answit, rekonesans ou te ale toupatou pami nasyon yo akoz bèlte ou. Paske li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 50:2">Sòm 50:2</ref></char></note>pafè, akoz mayifisans ke Mwen te fè poze sou ou a,” deklare Senyè BONDYE a.<verse eid="EZK 16:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 16:15"/>“‘“Men ou te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 57:8">És 57:8</ref></char></note>mete konfyans nan bèlte ou; ou te jwe pwostitiye akoz tout rekonesans ou. Ou te vide pwostitisyon ou an nan tout moun ale vini ki te disponib. <verse eid="EZK 16:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 16:16"/>Ou te pran kèk nan rad ou yo, pou fè pou kont ou wo plas ak plizyè koulè, e te jwe pwostitiye ak yo. Sa a pa ta janm dwe rive, ni li pa p fèt. <verse eid="EZK 16:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 16:17"/>Anplis, ou te pran bèl <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 16:11-12">Éz 16:11-12</ref></char></note>bijou ou yo, fèt ak lò ak ajan pa M, ke M te bay ou. Ak yo ou te fè pou kont ou imaj a gason pou ou te ka jwe pwostitiye ak yo. <verse eid="EZK 16:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 16:18"/>Epi ou te pran twal bwodri ou a pou te kouvri yo, e te ofri lwil ak lansan Mwen an devan yo. <verse eid="EZK 16:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 16:19"/>Anplis, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 2:8">Os 2:8</ref></char></note>pen Mwen an, ke M te bay ou a, farin fen, lwil ak siwo myèl, avèk sila Mwen te konn bay ou manje yo, ou te ofri yo devan yo kon yon odè santi bon. Se konsa sa te rive,” deklare Senyè BONDYE a.<verse eid="EZK 16:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 16:20"/>“‘Anplis, ou te pran fis ak fi ke ou te fè pou Mwen yo, e ou te sèvi yo kon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 106:37-38">Sòm 106:37-38</ref></char></note>sakrifis a zidòl pou yo ta ka vin devore. Èske afè pwostitisyon ou an te yon ti bagay piti? <verse eid="EZK 16:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 16:21"/>Ou te fè labatwa ak pitit Mwen yo, e te ofri yo bay zidòl, lè ou koze yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 13:2">Egz 13:2</ref></char></note>pase nan dife. <verse eid="EZK 16:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 16:22"/>Anplis ke tout abominasyon ak pwostitisyon ou yo, ou pa t sonje jou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 2:2">Jr 2:2</ref></char></note>jenès ou yo, lè ou te toutouni, san rad e t ap tòde nan pwòp san ou an.<verse eid="EZK 16:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 16:23"/>“‘Konsa, li te vin rive apre tout mechanste ou yo—Malè, malè a ou menm!’, deklare Senyè BONDYE — <verse eid="EZK 16:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 16:24"/>“Ke ou te bati pou kont ou yon lotèl, e te fè yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 78:58">Sòm 78:58</ref></char></note>wo plas tout kote. <verse eid="EZK 16:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 16:25"/>Ou te bati pou kont ou yon wo plas nan pwent anwo nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 9:14">Pwov 9:14</ref></char></note>tout lari, ou te fè belte ou vin abominab e ou te ouvri janm ou pou tout ale vini pou ogmante pwostitisyon ou an. <verse eid="EZK 16:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 16:26"/>Anplis, ou te jwe pwostitiye ak Ejipsyen yo, vwazen ou yo ak gwo anvi lachè e ou te ogmante pwostitisyon ou an pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 7:18-19">Jr 7:18-19</ref></char></note>fè m vin fache. <verse eid="EZK 16:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZK 16:27"/>Gade byen, Mwen te lonje men M kont ou pou te diminye nan sa ki te pou ou yo. Epi Mwen te livre ou a volonte a sila ki rayi ou yo, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 9:12">És 9:12</ref></char></note>fi a Filisten yo, ki wont devan kondwit lèd ou a. <verse eid="EZK 16:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZK 16:28"/>Anplis, ou te jwe pwostitiye ak <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 16:7-18">II Wa 16:7-18</ref></char></note>Asiryen yo akoz ou pa t satisfè. Wi, ou te jwe pwostitiye ak yo e ou te toujou pa satisfè a. <verse eid="EZK 16:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EZK 16:29"/>Anplis, ou te ogmante pwostitisyon ou an ak peyi komèsan yo, Chaldée. Menm malgre sa, ou pa t satisfè.<verse eid="EZK 16:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="EZK 16:30"/>“‘“A la kè ou fèb!” deklare Senyè BONDYE a, “pandan w ap fè tout bagay sa yo, aksyon a yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 3:9">És 3:9</ref></char></note>pwostitiye ki san wont. <verse eid="EZK 16:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EZK 16:31"/>Lè ou te bati lotèl ou yo nan pwent a tout lari a, e te fè wo plas ou yo tout kote yo, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 52:3">És 52:3</ref></char></note>san menm mande kòb, ou pa t sanble a yon pwostitiye.<verse eid="EZK 16:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="EZK 16:32"/>“‘“Ou menm, fanm adiltè, ki pran etranje olye de mari li! <verse eid="EZK 16:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EZK 16:33"/>Mesye yo konn bay kado a tout pwostitiye, men ou te bay kado ou a tout moun ki renmen ou yo pou rale yo vin kote ou sòti nan tout direksyon pou zak pwostitisyon ou yo. <verse eid="EZK 16:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EZK 16:34"/>Konsa, ou apà de fanm sa yo nan fè pwostitisyon ou an. Nan sa, nanpwen moun ki jwe pwostitiye tankou ou. Ou menm konn vèse lajan olye resevwa lajan. Konsa, ou apà.”’<verse eid="EZK 16:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="EZK 16:35"/>“Pou sa, O pwostitiye, tande pawòl SENYÈ a. <verse eid="EZK 16:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="EZK 16:36"/>‘Konsa pale Senyè BONDYE a: “Akoz bagay lèd ou yo te vin vide nèt, toutouni ou a te fin dekouvri nèt atravè pwostitisyon ou ak moun ki renmen ou yo, e ak tout <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 19:5">Jr 19:5</ref></char></note>zidòl abominab ou yo, e akoz san a fis ou ke ou te bay a zidòl yo, <verse eid="EZK 16:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="EZK 16:37"/>akoz sa, gade byen, Mwen va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 13:22-26">Jr 13:22-26</ref></char></note>rasanble tout moun ki renmen ou yo avèk sila ou te pran plezi yo, menm tout sila ke ou te renmen yo, ak tout sila ou te rayi yo. Konsa, Mwen va rasanble yo kont ou soti nan tout direksyon e Mwen va fè toutouni ou an vin parèt a yo menm pou yo ka wè toutouni ou an nèt. <verse eid="EZK 16:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="EZK 16:38"/>Konsa, Mwen va jije ou kon fanm k ap komèt adiltè, oswa k ap vèse san moun ta jije. Epi Mwen va mennen sou ou san gwo kòlè a ak jalouzi. <verse eid="EZK 16:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="EZK 16:39"/>Anplis, Mwen va bay ou nan men a moun ki renmen ou yo, e yo va demoli tout lotèl ou yo, demoli wo plas ou yo, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:39 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 23:47">Éz 23:47</ref></char></note>retire tout rad sou ou, retire tout bijou ou yo e kite ou toutouni, san rad. <verse eid="EZK 16:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="EZK 16:40"/>Yo va pouse yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:40 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 23:47">Éz 23:47</ref></char></note>gwo foul kont ou, yo va lapide ou e rache ou an mòso ak nepe yo. <verse eid="EZK 16:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="EZK 16:41"/>Yo va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:41 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 25:9">II Wa 25:9</ref></char></note>brile lakay ou ak dife e egzekite jijman sou ou devan zye anpil fanm. Nan lè sa a, mwen va fè ou sispann jwe pwostitiye e ou p ap peye moun ou renmen yo ankò. <verse eid="EZK 16:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="EZK 16:42"/>Konsa, Mwen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:42 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 24:25">II Sam 24:25</ref></char></note>va kalme gwo chalè kòlè Mwen an kont ou. Jalouzi Mwen va kite ou, Mwen va vin satisfè e Mwen p ap fache ankò.<verse eid="EZK 16:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="EZK 16:43"/>“‘“Akoz ou pa t sonje jou jenès ou yo, men te fè m <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:43 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 63:10">És 63:10</ref></char></note>vin anraje akoz tout bagay sa yo; gade byen, Mwen, nan kou pa M nan, Mwen va desann tout kondwit ou a, sou pwòp tèt ou,” deklare Senyè BONDYE a, “pou ou pa komèt bagay lèd sa a pou mete sou tout lòt abominasyon ou yo.”<verse eid="EZK 16:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="EZK 16:44"/>“‘“Gade byen, tout moun ki site <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:44 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 24:13">I Sam 24:13</ref></char></note>pwovèb va site pwovèb sila a konsènan ou menm. Yo va di: ‘Jan manman an ye a, se konsa fi a ye.’ <verse eid="EZK 16:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="EZK 16:45"/>Ou se fi a manman ou, li te rayi mari li ak pitit li. Ou se, anplis, sè a sè ou yo, ki te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:45 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 1:4">És 1:4</ref></char></note>rayi mari yo ak pitit yo. Manman ou te yon Etyèn e papa ou te yon Amoreyen. <verse eid="EZK 16:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="EZK 16:46"/>Alò, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:46 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 3:8-11">Jr 3:8-11</ref></char></note>pi gran sè ou a se Samarie, ki viv sou kote nò ou, ak tout fi li yo; epi pi jèn sè ou a, ki rete nan kote sid ou a, se Sodome, ak tout fi li yo. <verse eid="EZK 16:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="EZK 16:47"/>Malgre sa, ou pa t sèlman mache nan chemen yo, oswa aji selon abominasyon yo; men konsi sa te twò piti, avan lontan, ou te aji <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:47 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 21:9">II Wa 21:9</ref></char></note>pi konwonpi nan kondwit ou ke yo menm. <verse eid="EZK 16:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="EZK 16:48"/>Kon Mwen viv la”, deklare Senyè BONDYE a: “Sodome, sè ou a, ak fi li yo pa t fè menm jan ak ou ak fi ou yo.<verse eid="EZK 16:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="EZK 16:49"/>“‘“Gade byen, sa se te koupabilite a sè ou a, Sodome: li menm ak fi li yo te gen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:49 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 19:9">Jen 19:9</ref></char></note>awogans, anpil manje ak lavi alèz, men li pa t ede endijan ak malere yo. <verse eid="EZK 16:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="EZK 16:50"/>Konsa, yo te plen ògèy e te komèt <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:50 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 13:13">Jen 13:13</ref></char></note>abominasyon devan M. Pou sa, Mwen te retire yo lè M te wè sa. <verse eid="EZK 16:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="EZK 16:51"/>Anplis, Samarie pa t komèt mwatye nan peche ou yo, paske ou te ogmante abominasyon ou yo plis pase yo. Konsa, ou te fè sè ou a parèt <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:51 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 3:8-11">Jr 3:8-11</ref></char></note>dwat akoz tout abominasyon ke ou te komèt yo. <verse eid="EZK 16:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="EZK 16:52"/>Anplis, sipòte wont ou paske ou te fè jijman an vin favorab pou sè ou yo. Akoz peche nan sila ou te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:52 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 16:47-51">Éz 16:47-51</ref></char></note>aji pi mal ke yo menm yo, yo vin pi dwat pase ou. Wi, anplis vin twouble nèt e sipòte wont ou an, akoz ou te fè sè ou yo parèt dwat.<verse eid="EZK 16:52"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="EZK 16:53"/>“‘“Malgre sa, Mwen va restore kaptivite yo, kaptivite Sodome ak fi li yo, kaptivite Samarie ak fi li yo, e ansanm avèk yo, kaptivite pa w, <verse eid="EZK 16:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="EZK 16:54"/>pou ou ka pote imilyasyon ou e sanse ou vin <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:54 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 2:26">Jr 2:26</ref></char></note>wont pou tout sa ou te fè lè ou te devni yon konsolasyon pou yo. <verse eid="EZK 16:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="EZK 16:55"/>Sè ou yo, Sodome ak fi li yo, e Samarie ak fi li yo, va retounen nan eta yo te ye a, e ou menm avèk fi ou yo va, anplis, retounen nan eta nou te ye a. <verse eid="EZK 16:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="EZK 16:56"/>Paske non a sè ou a, Sodome, pa t tande nan lèv ou nan jou ògèy ou a, <verse eid="EZK 16:56"/><verse number="57" style="v" sid="EZK 16:57"/>avan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:57 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 16:36-37">Éz 16:36-37</ref></char></note>mechanste ou te dekouvri a. Paske koulye a, ou devni repwòch a fi Syrie yo, e a tout sila ki antoure li yo, a fi a Filisten yo, sila ki antoure ou ki meprize ou yo. <verse eid="EZK 16:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="EZK 16:58"/>Ou te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:58 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 23:49">Éz 23:49</ref></char></note>pote pinisyon zak lèd ou te fè, ak tout abominasyon yo,” deklare SENYÈ a.<verse eid="EZK 16:58"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="EZK 16:59"/>“‘Paske konsa pale Senyè BONDYE a: “Mwen va, anplis, fè avèk ou jan ou te fè a, ou menm ki te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:59 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 24:5">És 24:5</ref></char></note>meprize sèman an, e ki te kraze akò a. <verse eid="EZK 16:59"/><verse number="60" style="v" sid="EZK 16:60"/>Malgre sa, Mwen va sonje akò Mwen an avèk ou nan jou jenès ou yo, e Mwen va etabli yon akò <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:60 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 55:3">És 55:3</ref></char></note>k ap dire pou tout tan avèk ou. <verse eid="EZK 16:60"/><verse number="61" style="v" sid="EZK 16:61"/>Epi ou va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:61 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 50:4-5">Jr 50:4-5</ref></char></note>sonje chemen ou yo, e ou va vin wont lè ou resevwa sè ou yo, ni pi gran, ni pi piti. Mwen va bay ou yo kon fi pa w, men pa selon akò ou a. <verse eid="EZK 16:61"/><verse number="62" style="v" sid="EZK 16:62"/>Konsa, Mwen va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:62 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 20:37">Éz 20:37</ref></char></note>etabli akò Mwen an avèk ou e ou va konnen ke Mwen se SENYÈ a, <verse eid="EZK 16:62"/><verse number="63" style="v" sid="EZK 16:63"/>pou ou ka <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:63 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 36:31-32">Éz 36:31-32</ref></char></note>sonje, vin wont, e pa janm ouvri bouch ou ankò akoz imilyasyon ou, pou lè M te padone ou pou tout sa ou te fè yo,” Senyè, BONDYE a deklare.’”<verse eid="EZK 16:63"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 16"/>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="EZK 17"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 17:1"/>Alò, pawòl SENYÈ a te vin kote mwen. Li te di: <verse eid="EZK 17:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 17:2"/>“Fis a lòm, pwopoze yon devinèt e pale yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 20:49">Éz 20:49</ref></char></note>parabòl a lakay Israël. <verse eid="EZK 17:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 17:3"/>Di yo: ‘Konsa pale Senyè BONDYE a: “Yon gwo èg ak <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 4:22">Dan 4:22</ref></char></note>gwo zèl, gwo zèl louvri ak anpil bèl plim de anpil koulè te vini Liban, e te rache pran tèt pye sèd la. <verse eid="EZK 17:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 17:4"/>Li te rache tout ti branch nan pi wo tèt li, e te pote li nan peyi komèsan yo. Li te plase li nan yon vil machann yo.<verse eid="EZK 17:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 17:5"/>“‘“Anplis, li te pran semans peyi a pou te plante li nan yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 8:7-9">Det 8:7-9</ref></char></note>tè fètil. Li te mete li akote gwo dlo. Li te plase li tankou yon pye sikren. <verse eid="EZK 17:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 17:6"/>Konsa, li te boujonnen e te vin yon lyann ba ki t ap kouvri toupatou ak branch li yo ki te tounen vè li menm, men rasin li yo te rete anba l. Konsa, li te vin yon plant, li te bay boujon e li te pwodwi anpil ti branch.<verse eid="EZK 17:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 17:7"/>“‘“Men te gen yon lòt gwo èg ak gwo zèl ak anpil plim. Epi gade byen, lyann sa a te koube rasin li yo vè li menm e te voye branch yo deyò vè li menm soti nan tè kote li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 31:4">Éz 31:4</ref></char></note>plante a, pou l te ka wouze li. <verse eid="EZK 17:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 17:8"/>Li te plante nan bon tè, akote anpil dlo, pou l te ka fè anpil branch ak bay fwi, e vin yon pye rezen byen bèl.”<verse eid="EZK 17:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 17:9"/>“Pale, ‘Konsa di Senyè BONDYE a: “Èske li va grandi byen? Èske li pa p rache rasin li yo, e koupe fwi li, pou li fennen nèt—pou tout fèy k ap pete yo ta fennen? Epi kit se pa gwo fòs, kit se pa anpil moun, li p ap ka leve sòti nan rasin li ankò. <verse eid="EZK 17:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 17:10"/>Gade byen, akoz li te plante, èske l ap grandi byen? Èske li p ap <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 19:14">Éz 19:14</ref></char></note>fennen nèt toutotan ke van lès ap frape li yo? Li va fennen sou tè a kote li te plante a?”’”<verse eid="EZK 17:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 17:11"/>Anplis, pawòl SENYÈ a te rive kote mwen e te di: <verse eid="EZK 17:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 17:12"/>“Di koulye a a kay rebèl la, ‘Èske ou pa konnen sa bagay sa yo vle di?’ Di yo: ‘Gade byen, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 24:11-15">II Wa 24:11-15</ref></char></note>wa Babylone nan te rive Jérusalem, te pran wa ak prens li yo e te mennen yo kote li Babylone. <verse eid="EZK 17:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 17:13"/>Li te pran youn nan fanmi wa a pou te fè yon akò avè l e te fè l sèmante. Anplis, li te retire pwisan yo nan peyi a, <verse eid="EZK 17:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 17:14"/>pou wayòm nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 29:14">Éz 29:14</ref></char></note>ta vin ba, pou l pa egzalte tèt li, men nan swiv akò L pou li ka kanpe ankò. <verse eid="EZK 17:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 17:15"/>Men li te fè rebèl kont li lè l te voye reprezantan li yo kote Égypte pou yo ta ka ba li cheval ak anpil sòlda. Èske li va reyisi? Èske sila ki fè kalite bagay sa yo va chape? Èske li, anverite, kapab kraze akò a e chape?<verse eid="EZK 17:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 17:16"/>“‘Jan Mwen viv la’, deklare Senyè BONDYE a, ‘Anverite, nan peyi wa ki te fè l wa, sèman a sila li te meprize a, e akò a sila li te kraze a; alò, avèk li menm,<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 52:11">Jr 52:11</ref></char></note>nan mitan Babylone, li va mouri. <verse eid="EZK 17:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 17:17"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 36:6">És 36:6</ref></char></note>Farawon ak lame pwisan li an, ak gran fòs pèp li a, p ap ede li nan lagè a, lè yo fè monte ran syèj e bati miray syèj pou koupe lavi anpil moun. <verse eid="EZK 17:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 17:18"/>‘Konsa, li te meprize sèman an lè l te kraze akò a e gade byen, li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 29:24">I Kwo 29:24</ref></char></note>fè sèman li an, men gade tout bagay li te fè. Li p ap chape.’”<verse eid="EZK 17:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 17:19"/>“Akoz sa, pale Senyè BONDYE a: ‘Jan Mwen viv la, anverite, sèman Mwen an ke li te meprize a, ak akò Mwen an ke li te kraze a, Mwen va koze malè sou tèt li. <verse eid="EZK 17:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 17:20"/>Filè Mwen an va kouvri li nèt e li va kenbe nan pèlen an. Epi Mwen va mennen li Babylone e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 2:35">Jr 2:35</ref></char></note>antre nan jijman avèk li selon zak enfidèl ke li te komèt kont Mwen an. <verse eid="EZK 17:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 17:21"/>Tout mesye byen chwazi pami sòlda li yo va tonbe pa nepe, e sila ki chape yo va gaye nan tout van. Konsa nou va konnen ke Mwen menm, SENYÈ a te pale.’<verse eid="EZK 17:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 17:22"/>“Senyè BONDYE a di: ‘Anplis, Mwen va pran yon ti branch piti soti anlè pye sèd la e Mwen va plante li. Mwen va rache nan pi wo pwent a jenn ti boujon li yo, youn ki piti e ki mou e Mwen va plante li sou yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 72:16">Sòm 72:16</ref></char></note>mòn ki byen wo. <verse eid="EZK 17:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 17:23"/>Sou mòn byen wo Israël la, Mwen va plante li, pou li kapab pwodwi gwo branch, bay fwi e devni yon gwo pye <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 72:16">Sòm 72:16</ref></char></note>sèd byen bèl. Epi zwazo de tout kalite yo va fè nich yo anba li. Yo va pran repo nan lonbraj branch li yo. <verse eid="EZK 17:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 17:24"/>Tout pyebwa nan chan yo va konnen ke Mwen se SENYÈ a. Mwen desann pyebwa ki byen wo a, egzalte pyebwa ki ba a, seche pyebwa ki vèt la e fè pyebwa ki sèch la fleri.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EZK 17:24">“‘Mwen, SENYÈ a, te pale e Mwen te akonpli sa.’”<verse eid="EZK 17:24"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 17"/>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="EZK 18"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 18:1"/>Pawòl SENYÈ a te vin kote mwen. Li te di: <verse eid="EZK 18:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 18:2"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 3:15">És 3:15</ref></char></note>“Kisa sa vle di lè ou sèvi pwovèb sa a konsènan peyi Israël e di:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 18:2">‘Papa yo manje rezen si yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 18:2">epi dan timoun yo va kanpe apik’?<verse eid="EZK 18:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 18:3"/>“Jan Mwen viv la”, deklare Senyè BONDYE a: “nou p ap itilize pwovèb sa a an Israël ankò. <verse eid="EZK 18:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 18:4"/>Gade byen, tout nanm yo se pa M yo ye. Nanm a papa a ansanm ak nanm a fis la se pa M. Nanm ki <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 18:20">Éz 18:20</ref></char></note>peche a, se li k ap mouri.<verse eid="EZK 18:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 18:5"/>“Men si yon nonm dwat</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 18:5">e li aji ak jistis ak ladwati,<verse eid="EZK 18:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 18:6"/>pou l pa manje nan lotèl mòn yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 18:6">ni <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 4:19">Det 4:19</ref></char></note>leve zye li vè zidòl lakay Israël yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 18:6">ni souye ak madanm vwazen li,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 18:6">ni pwoche yon fanm pandan lè règ li—<verse eid="EZK 18:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 18:7"/>Si yon nonm pa oprime okenn moun,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 18:7">men remèt a sila ki te prete li sa li te pwomèt,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 18:7">epi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 19:13">Lev 19:13</ref></char></note>pa fè vòl, men bay pen li a sila ki grangou</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 18:7">e kouvri moun toutouni ak rad,<verse eid="EZK 18:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 18:8"/>si li pa prete moun lajan ak <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 22:15">Egz 22:15</ref></char></note>enterè, ni pran plis,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 18:8">si li gade men l pou l pa fè inikite,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 18:8">e egzekite yon vrè jistis antre moun ak moun,<verse eid="EZK 18:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 18:9"/>si li mache nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 18:5">Lev 18:5</ref></char></note>règleman Mwen yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 18:9">ak lòd Mwen yo pou l aji ak fidelite;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 18:9">li se yon moun dwat,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 18:9">e anverite, li va viv,” deklare Senyè BONDYE a.<verse eid="EZK 18:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 18:10"/>“Alò, li kapab gen yon fis ki volè, ki vèse san, e ki fè nenpòt nan bagay sa yo,<verse eid="EZK 18:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 18:11"/>o malgre li pa t fè okenn nan bagay sa yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 18:11">men li konn manje kote lotèl mòn yo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 18:11">e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 6:9">I Kor 6:9</ref></char></note>souye ak madanm a vwazen li,<verse eid="EZK 18:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 18:12"/>Oprime malere ak endijan,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 18:12">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">18:12 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 59:6-7">És 59:6-7</ref>
      </char>
    </note> te fè vòl desepsyon an,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 18:12">pa remèt sa li pwomèt,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 18:12">epi te leve zye li a zidòl,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 18:12">te komèt abominasyon,<verse eid="EZK 18:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 18:13"/>te prete lajan sou enterè</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 18:13">pou l pran benefis sou malere;</para>
  <para style="m" vid="EZK 18:13">èske l ap viv? Li p ap viv! Li te komèt tout abominasyon sila yo; anverite, li va mouri. San li va tonbe sou pwòp tèt li.<verse eid="EZK 18:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 18:14"/>“Alò, gade byen, si li gen yon fis ki te wè tout peche papa l te komèt, e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 29:6-10">II Kwo 29:6-10</ref></char></note>lè l wè sa, li fè lakrent pou l pa fè menm jan.<verse eid="EZK 18:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 18:15"/>“Li pa manje nan lotèl mòn yo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 18:15">ni leve zye li a zidòl lakay Israël yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 18:15">ni souye ak madanm vwazen li,<verse eid="EZK 18:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 18:16"/>Ni oprime okenn moun,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 18:16">ni refize remèt sa li te pwomèt pou l te fè,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 18:16">ni pa vòlè, men li <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 31:16-20">Job 31:16-20</ref></char></note>bay pen li a moun grangou yo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 18:16">e kouvri sila ki toutouni yo ak rad,<verse eid="EZK 18:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 18:17"/>Li retire men li sou malere a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 18:17">li pa egzije enterè, ni pwofi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 18:17">men li fè règleman Mwen yo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 18:17">e mache nan lòd mwen yo;</para>
  <para style="m" vid="EZK 18:17">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">18:17 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ROM 2:6">Wo 2:6</ref>
      </char>
    </note>li p ap mouri pou inikite a papa li. Anverite, li va viv. <verse eid="EZK 18:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 18:18"/>Alò, pou papa li, akoz li te pratike opresyon, te vòlè frè li, e te fè sa ki pa t bon pami pèp li a, gade byen, li va mouri nan inikite li a.<verse eid="EZK 18:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 18:19"/>“Malgre sa, ou di: ‘Poukisa fis la pa pote pinisyon pou inikite a papa li? Lè fis la pratike <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 18:9">Éz 18:9</ref></char></note>jistis ak ladwati, swiv tout lòd Mwen yo e fè yo, anverite, li va viv. <verse eid="EZK 18:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 18:20"/>Moun ki fè peche a va mouri. Fis la p ap pote pinisyon pou linikite a papa li, ni papa a p ap chaje ak pinisyon pou peche a fis la. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 8:32">I Wa 8:32</ref></char></note>Ladwati a moun ki dwat va sou pwòp tèt pa li e mechanste a mechan an va sou pwòp tèt li.<verse eid="EZK 18:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 18:21"/>“Men si moun <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 18:27-28">Éz 18:27-28</ref></char></note>mechan an vire kite tout peche ke li te konn komèt yo pou vin swiv tout règleman Mwen yo, e pratike lajistis ak ladwati, anverite, li va viv, li p ap mouri. <verse eid="EZK 18:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 18:22"/>Tout transgresyon ke li te konn komèt yo, p ap sonje ankò kont li. Akoz <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 18:20-24">Sòm 18:20-24</ref></char></note>ladwati ke li te vin pratike a, li va viv. <verse eid="EZK 18:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 18:23"/>Èske Mwen pran plezi nan lanmò a mechan yo?” deklare Senyè BONDYE a: “pou M pa pito ke li ta <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 147:11">Sòm 147:11</ref></char></note>vire kite chemen li an pou viv?”<verse eid="EZK 18:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 18:24"/>“Men, lè yon nonm ladwati vire kite ladwati li a, komèt inikite e fè selon tout abominasyon ke yon nonm mechan konn fè, èske li va viv? <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 18:22">Éz 18:22</ref></char></note>Tout zèv ladwati ke li te konn fè yo, p ap sonje akoz trèt ke li te fè ak peche ke li te komèt la. Nan peche li ke li te peche a, li va mouri.<verse eid="EZK 18:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 18:25"/>“Men nou di: ‘Wout Senyè pa dwat.’ Koute koulye a, O lakay Israël! Èske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 18:25">Jen 18:25</ref></char></note>wout Mwen an pa dwat? Èske chemen Mwen pa nivo? Èske se pa chemen pa nou an ki pa nivo? <verse eid="EZK 18:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 18:26"/>Lè yon moun ladwati vire kite ladwati li, komèt inikite e mouri akoz li, pou inikite ke li te komèt la, li mouri nan inikite li te fè a. <verse eid="EZK 18:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZK 18:27"/>Ankò, lè yon nonm mechan vire <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 1:18">És 1:18</ref></char></note>kite mechanste ke li te komèt pou pratike lajistis ak ladwati, li va sove nanm li vivan. <verse eid="EZK 18:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZK 18:28"/>Akoz li te konsidere, e te vire kite tout transgresyon ke li te konn komèt yo, li va anverite viv. Li p ap mouri. <verse eid="EZK 18:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EZK 18:29"/>Men lakay Israël ap di: ‘Wout Senyè a pa dwat.’ Èske wout Mwen yo pa dwat, O lakay Israël? Èske se pa wout pa ou yo ki pa dwat?<verse eid="EZK 18:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="EZK 18:30"/>“Akoz sa a, Mwen va jije nou, O lakay Israël, chak moun selon kondwit li,” deklare Senyè BONDYE a. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 14:6">Éz 14:6</ref></char></note>“Repanti e vire kite tout transgresyon nou yo, pou inikite sa a pa devni yon wòch chite ki pou fè nou tonbe. <verse eid="EZK 18:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EZK 18:31"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 1:16-17">És 1:16-17</ref></char></note>Jete lwen nou tout transgresyon ke nou konn komèt yo, epi fè pou tèt nou yon kè tounèf avèk yon lespri tounèf! Paske poukisa ou ta mouri, O lakay Israël? <verse eid="EZK 18:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EZK 18:32"/>Paske Mwen pa pran <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 18:23">Éz 18:23</ref></char></note>plezi nan lanmò a okenn moun ki mouri,” deklare Senyè BONDYE a. “Akoz sa, repanti pou viv.”<verse eid="EZK 18:32"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 18"/>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="EZK 19"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 19:1"/>“Pou nou menm, komanse fè gwo lamantasyon pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 23:29-34">II Wa 23:29-34</ref></char></note>prens Israël yo, <verse eid="EZK 19:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 19:2"/>Epi di:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 19:2">‘Kisa manman ou te ye?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 19:2">Yon manman lyon pami lyon yo!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 19:2">Li te kouche pami jenn ti lyon yo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 19:2">pami jenn lyon yo, li te leve pitit li yo.<verse eid="EZK 19:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 19:3"/>Lè l te fin leve youn nan pitit li yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 19:3">pitit la te devni yon lyon.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 19:3">Li te vin aprann jan pou li dechire bèt pou li manje;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 19:3">li te devore moun.<verse eid="EZK 19:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 19:4"/>Alò, nasyon yo te tande de li;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 19:4">li te vin kaptire nan twou fòs pa yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 19:4">e yo te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 23:34">II Wa 23:34</ref></char></note>mennen li ak kwòk, rive nan peyi Égypte.<verse eid="EZK 19:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 19:5"/>“‘Lè manman lyon an te wè ke li te tann,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 19:5">men ke espwa li te vin pèdi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 19:5">li te pran yon lòt nan pitit li yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 19:5">e te fè l vin yon jenn ti lyon.<verse eid="EZK 19:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 19:6"/>Konsa, li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 24:9">II Wa 24:9</ref></char></note>mache toupatou pami lyon yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 19:6">Li te devni yon jenn ti lyon.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 19:6">Li te aprann jan pou kenbe viktim li.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 19:6">Li te devore moun.<verse eid="EZK 19:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 19:7"/>Li te konnen gran palè yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 19:7">e li te devaste vil yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 19:7">Peyi a ak tout bèlte li te vin gate nèt,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 19:7">akoz son a gwonde li.<verse eid="EZK 19:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 19:8"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19:8 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 24:11">II Wa 24:11</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Nasyon yo te atake li tout kote</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 19:8">soti nan pwovens yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 19:8">Yo te ouvri filè yo sou li.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 19:8">Li te vin kaptire nan twou fòs yo.<verse eid="EZK 19:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 19:9"/>Yo te mete li nan yon kalòj ak kwòk,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 19:9">e te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 24:15">II Wa 24:15</ref></char></note>mennen li kote wa Babylone nan.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 19:9">Yo te mennen li andedan fò yo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 19:9">pou vwa l pa tande menm ankò</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 19:9">sou mòn Israël yo.<verse eid="EZK 19:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 19:10"/>“‘Manman ou te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 80:8-11">Sòm 80:8-11</ref></char></note>tankou yon lyann</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 19:10">nan san ou an.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 19:10">Li te plante bò kote dlo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 19:10">Li te plen fwi ak anpil branch, akoz dlo an abondans.<verse eid="EZK 19:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 19:11"/>Li te gen branch ki dyanm,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 19:11">ki ta ka sèvi pou baton wa yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 19:11">Wotè li te leve pi wo nwaj yo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 19:11">pou moun ta ka wè l</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 19:11">nan tout wotè li ak tout branch li yo.<verse eid="EZK 19:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 19:12"/>Men li te vin <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 31:28">Jr 31:28</ref></char></note>rache ak kòlè.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 19:12">Li te jete atè nèt,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 19:12">epi van nan lès te seche fwi li yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 19:12">Gwo branch dyanm li yo te vin rache.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 19:12">Yo te fennen.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 19:12">Dife te manje yo nèt.<verse eid="EZK 19:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 19:13"/>Epi koulye a, li vin plante nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 24:12-16">II Wa 24:12-16</ref></char></note>dezè a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 19:13">nan yon peyi ki sèch e ki swaf.<verse eid="EZK 19:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 19:14"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19:14 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 15:4">Éz 15:4</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Dife a fin gaye nan tout branch li yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 19:14">Li te konsonmen boujon ak fwi li yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 19:14">jiskaske pa t gen ladann yon branch</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 19:14">ki dyanm, pou fè baton pou wa a.’</para>
  <para style="m" vid="EZK 19:14">Sa se yon lamantasyon. Konsa, li va sèvi kon yon lamantasyon.”<verse eid="EZK 19:14"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 19"/>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="EZK 20"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 20:1"/>Alò, nan setyèm ane, nan senkyèm mwa a, nan dizyèm jou nan mwa a, kèk nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 8:1-12">Éz 8:1-12</ref></char></note>ansyen Israël yo te vin mande SENYÈ a konsèy. Yo te chita devan m.<verse eid="EZK 20:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 20:2"/>Konsa, pawòl SENYÈ a te vin kote mwen. Li te di: <verse eid="EZK 20:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 20:3"/>“Fis a lòm, pale ak ansyen Israël yo pou di yo: ‘Konsa pale Senyè BONDYE a: “Èske nou vini la pou mande M konsèy? Jan Mwen viv la,” deklare Senyè BONDYE a: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 14:3">Éz 14:3</ref></char></note>“Nou p ap vin mande M konsèy.’”<verse eid="EZK 20:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 20:4"/>“Èske ou va jije yo, fis a lòm? Èske ou va jije yo? Fè yo konnen abominasyon a papa yo. <verse eid="EZK 20:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 20:5"/>Di yo: ‘Konsa pale Senyè BONDYE a: “Nan jou ke M te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 6:6-8">Egz 6:6-8</ref></char></note>chwazi Israël la, e te sèmante a desandan a lakay Jacob yo, pou te revele Mwen menm a yo menm nan peyi Égypte la, lè M te sèmante a yo menm, e te di: ‘Mwen se SENYÈ a, Bondye nou an,’ <verse eid="EZK 20:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 20:6"/>nan jou sa a, Mwen te sèmante a yo menm <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 32:22">Jr 32:22</ref></char></note>pou mennen fè yo sòti nan peyi Égypte, pou antre nan yon peyi ke M te chwazi pou yo, ki koule lèt avèk siwo myèl, ki se glwa a tout peyi yo. <verse eid="EZK 20:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 20:7"/>Mwen te di a yo menm: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:4">Egz 20:4</ref></char></note> ‘Voye jete, nou chak, bagay abominab a zye nou yo, e pa souye tèt nou ak zidòl Égypte yo. Mwen se SENYÈ a, Bondye nou an.’<verse eid="EZK 20:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 20:8"/>“‘“Men yo te fè rebèl kont Mwen, e yo pa t dakò koute Mwen. Yo pa t voye jete bagay abominab a zye yo, ni yo pa t abandone <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 32:1-9">Egz 32:1-9</ref></char></note>zidòl a Égypte yo. Konsa, Mwen te detèmine pou vide gwo chalè kòlè Mwen sou yo, pou akonpli kòlè Mwen sou yo nan mitan peyi Égypte la. <verse eid="EZK 20:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 20:9"/>Men Mwen te aji <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 32:11-14">Egz 32:11-14</ref></char></note>pou koz non Mwen, pou li pa ta vin degrade nan zye a nasyon pami sila yo te rete yo, nan zye a sila Mwen te fè Mwen menm rekonèt a yo, lè M te fè yo sòti nan peyi Égypte la. <verse eid="EZK 20:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 20:10"/>Konsa, Mwen te retire yo nan peyi Égypte pou te mennen yo nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 19:1">Egz 19:1</ref></char></note>dezè a. <verse eid="EZK 20:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 20:11"/>Mwen te bay yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:1-26">Egz 20:1-26</ref></char></note>lalwa Mwen yo, e te fè yo rekonèt règleman Mwen yo, pa sila, si yon nonm swiv yo, li va viv nan yo. <verse eid="EZK 20:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 20:12"/>Anplis, Mwen te bay yo Saba Mwen yo pou vin yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 31:13-17">Egz 31:13-17</ref></char></note>sign antre Mwen menm ak yo, pou yo ta ka konnen ke Mwen se SENYÈ ki sanktifye yo a.<verse eid="EZK 20:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 20:13"/>“‘“Men lakay Israël te fè rebèl kont Mwen, nan dezè a. Yo pa t mache nan lalwa Mwen yo, e yo te refize règleman Mwen yo, pa sila, si yon nonm swiv yo, li va viv nan yo. Epi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 56:6">És 56:6</ref></char></note>Saba Mwen yo, yo te vin pwofane nèt. Konsa, Mwen te pran desizyon pou vide chalè kòlè Mwen sou yo nan dezè a, pou manje yo nèt. <verse eid="EZK 20:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 20:14"/>Men Mwen te aji pou koz non Mwen, pou li pa ta degrade nan zye a nasyon yo, devan zye a sila Mwen te fè yo sòti yo. <verse eid="EZK 20:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 20:15"/>Anplis, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 14:30">Nonb 14:30</ref></char></note>Mwen te sèmante a yo nan dezè a pou Mwen pa ta mennen yo antre nan peyi ke M te bay a, yo menm nan, peyi ki t ap koule ak siwo myèl, ki se glwa a tout peyi yo, <verse eid="EZK 20:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 20:16"/>akoz yo te rejte règleman Mwen yo e pou lalwa Mwen yo, yo pa t mache ladan yo. Menm Saba Mwen yo, yo te pwofane yo, paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 11:21">Éz 11:21</ref></char></note>kè yo te tout tan ap mache dèyè zidòl yo. <verse eid="EZK 20:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 20:17"/>Malgre sa, zye M te epanye yo olye de detwi yo e Mwen pa t <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 4:27">Jr 4:27</ref></char></note>detwi yo nèt nan dezè a. <verse eid="EZK 20:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 20:18"/>Mwen te di a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 14:31">Nonb 14:31</ref></char></note>pitit yo nan dezè a: ‘Pa mache nan règleman a papa nou yo, ni swiv règleman yo oswa souye tèt nou ak zidòl yo. <verse eid="EZK 20:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 20:19"/>Mwen se SENYÈ a, Bondye nou an. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 5:32-33">Det 5:32-33</ref></char></note>Mache nan règleman Mwen yo e swiv òdonans Mwen yo pou fè yo. <verse eid="EZK 20:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 20:20"/>Sanktifye Saba Mwen yo. Konsa, yo va vin yon sign antre Mwen menm ak nou, pou nou ka konnen ke Mwen se SENYÈ Bondye nou an.’<verse eid="EZK 20:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 20:21"/>“‘“Men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 21:5">Nonb 21:5</ref></char></note>pitit yo te fè rebèl kont Mwen. Yo pa t mache nan règleman Mwen yo, ni yo pa t fè atansyon pou swiv òdonans Mwen yo, pa sila, si yon nonm swiv yo, li va viv la. Yo te pwofane Saba Mwen yo. Konsa, mwen te pran desizyon pou vide chalè kòlè Mwen sou yo, pou akonpli kòlè Mwen kont yo nan dezè a. <verse eid="EZK 20:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 20:22"/>Men Mwen te ralanti men M. Konsa, Mwen te aji <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 48:9-11">És 48:9-11</ref></char></note>pou koz non Mwen, pou li pa ta vin degrade devan zye a nasyon yo devan zye sila Mwen te fè yo sòti yo. <verse eid="EZK 20:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 20:23"/>Anplis, Mwen te sèmante a yo menm nan dezè a pou Mwen ta <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 26:33">Lev 26:33</ref></char></note>gaye yo pami nasyon yo, e dispèse yo nan tout peyi yo, <verse eid="EZK 20:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 20:24"/>akoz yo pa t swiv òdonans Mwen yo, men te refize tout règleman Mwen yo, te pwofane Saba Mwen yo, e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 6:9">Éz 6:9</ref></char></note>zye yo te sou zidòl a papa zansèt yo. <verse eid="EZK 20:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 20:25"/>Mwen te bay yo anplis, règleman ki <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 81:12">Sòm 81:12</ref></char></note>pa t bon ak òdonans yo sou sila yo pa t ka viv. <verse eid="EZK 20:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 20:26"/>Mwen te deklare yo pa pwòp akoz de sakrifis yo. Yo te koze tout premye ne yo pase nan dife, pou Mwen ta fè yo vin sanzespwa; konsa, pou yo ta konnen ke se Mwen menm ki SENYÈ a.”’<verse eid="EZK 20:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZK 20:27"/>“Pou sa, fis a lòm, pale ak lakay Israël pou di yo: ‘Konsa pale Senyè BONDYE a: “Malgre nan sa, papa zansèt nou yo te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 15:30">Nonb 15:30</ref></char></note>blasfeme Mwen lè yo te enfidel a lalwa M. <verse eid="EZK 20:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZK 20:28"/>Lè Mwen te mennen yo nan peyi ke M te sèmante pou bay yo a, yo te vin wè tout <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 14:23">I Wa 14:23</ref></char></note>kolin wo ak tout bwa ki plen fèy yo. La, yo te ofri sakrifis yo, e la, yo te prezante ofrann ki te fè M fache nèt. La, yo te fè monte odè santi bon, e la, yo te vide ofrann bwason yo. <verse eid="EZK 20:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EZK 20:29"/>Konsa, Mwen te di yo: ‘Kisa wo plas kote nou prale a ye?’ Pou sa, yo rele non plas sa a “Bama “jis rive jou sa a.”’<verse eid="EZK 20:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="EZK 20:30"/>“Akoz sa, pale ak lakay Israël: ‘Konsa pale Senyè BONDYE a: “Èske nou va souye tèt nou menm, swiv abitid <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 2:19">Jij 2:19</ref></char></note>papa zansèt nou yo e jwe pwostitiye apre bagay abominab yo? <verse eid="EZK 20:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EZK 20:31"/>Lè nou ofri ofrann nou yo, lè nou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 106:37-39">Sòm 106:37-39</ref></char></note>fè fis nou yo pase nan dife, nou ap souye tèt nou ak tout zidòl yo jis rive nan jou sa a. Epi èske nou ta dwe vin mande Mwen konsèy, O lakay Israël? Jan Mwen viv la,” deklare Senyè BONDYE a, Mwen p ap kite nou mande M anyen.<verse eid="EZK 20:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="EZK 20:32"/>“‘“Sa ki <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 11:5">Éz 11:5</ref></char></note>vini nan lespri nou an, se pa sa k ap rive vrè, lè nou di: ‘Nou va tankou lòt nasyon yo, tankou fanmi a peyi yo, k ap sèvi bwa ak wòch yo.’ <verse eid="EZK 20:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EZK 20:33"/>Jan Mwen viv la”, deklare Senyè BONDYE a: “Anverite, ak yon men pwisan, ak yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 21:5">Jr 21:5</ref></char></note>bra lonje e avèk chalè a kòlè Mwen vide deyò, Mwen va vin wa sou nou. <verse eid="EZK 20:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EZK 20:34"/>Mwen va mennen nou soti nan tout pèp yo, rasanble nou soti nan peyi kote nou gaye yo, ak yon men pwisan, ak yon bra lonje e ak <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 42:18">Jr 42:18</ref></char></note>chalè kòlè Mwen vide nèt. <verse eid="EZK 20:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EZK 20:35"/>Epi Mwen va mennen nou antre nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 19:13">Éz 19:13</ref></char></note>dezè a pèp yo, e la Mwen va antre nan jijman avèk nou fasafas. <verse eid="EZK 20:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="EZK 20:36"/>Jan Mwen te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 11:1-35">Nonb 11:1-35</ref></char></note>antre nan jijman ak papa zansèt nou yo nan dezè an Égypte la, konsa Mwen va antre nan jijman avèk nou”, deklare Senyè BONDYE a. <verse eid="EZK 20:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="EZK 20:37"/>“Mwen va fè nou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 27:32">Lev 27:32</ref></char></note>pase anba baton, e Mwen va mennen nou antre anba angajman akò a. <verse eid="EZK 20:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="EZK 20:38"/>Mwen va fè retire pami nou, rebèl ak sila ki transgrese kont Mwen yo. Mwen va mennen yo sòti nan peyi kote yo demere a, men yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 14:29-30">Nonb 14:29-30</ref></char></note>p ap antre nan peyi Israël. Konsa, nou va konnen ke Mwen se SENYÈ a.”<verse eid="EZK 20:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="EZK 20:39"/>“Pou nou menm, O lakay Israël,” deklare Senyè Bondye a: “Ale, nou chak sèvi zidòl pa nou; menm pi ta tou, si nou p ap koute M. Men nou p ap <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:39 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 1:3-15">És 1:3-15</ref></char></note>pwofane non sen M ankò ak ofrann ak zidòl nou yo. <verse eid="EZK 20:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="EZK 20:40"/>Paske sou mòn sen Mwen an, sou wotè mòn Israël la,” deklare Senyè BONDYE a: “la, tout lakay Israël, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:40 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 66:23">És 66:23</ref></char></note>yo tout, va sèvi Mwen nan peyi a. La Mwen va aksepte yo, e la, Mwen va egzije ofrann nou yo, avèk ofrann premyè fwi nou yo, ak tout bagay sen nou yo. <verse eid="EZK 20:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="EZK 20:41"/>Kon yon odè santi bon, Mwen va aksepte nou lè Mwen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:41 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 27:12-13">És 27:12-13</ref></char></note>mennen nou sòti nan pèp yo, e rasanble nou soti nan peyi kote nou te gaye yo. Epi Mwen va vin sen nan nou devan zye a tout nasyon yo. <verse eid="EZK 20:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="EZK 20:42"/>Konsa, nou va konnen ke Mwen se SENYÈ a, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:42 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 27:12-13">És 27:12-13</ref></char></note>lè mwen mennen nou fè nou antre nan peyi Israël la, nan peyi ke M te sèmante pou bay a papa zansèt nou yo. <verse eid="EZK 20:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="EZK 20:43"/>La, nou va sonje chemen nou yo ak tout zèv yo avèk sila nou te souye tèt nou yo. Epi nou va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:43 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 31:18">Jr 31:18</ref></char></note>rayi pwòp tèt nou nan pwòp zye nou pou tout bagay mal ke nou te fè yo. <verse eid="EZK 20:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="EZK 20:44"/>Konsa, nou va konnen ke se Mwen ki SENYÈ a, lè Mwen fin regle avèk nou pou koz non Mwen, pa selon chemen mechan nou yo, ni selon zak konwonpi nou yo, O lakay Israël,” deklare Senyè BONDYE a.’”<verse eid="EZK 20:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="EZK 20:45"/>Alò, pawòl SENYÈ a te rive kote mwen. Li te di: <verse eid="EZK 20:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="EZK 20:46"/>“Fis a lòm, mete figi ou vè Théman. Pale fò kont tout sid la, e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:46 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 21:2">Éz 21:2</ref></char></note> pwofetize kont peyi forè nan Negev la. <verse eid="EZK 20:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="EZK 20:47"/>Di a forè Negev la: ‘Koute pawòl SENYÈ a. Konsa pale Senyè BONDYE a: “Gade byen, Mwen prèt pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:47 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 9:18">És 9:18</ref></char></note>limen yon dife nan nou, e li va konsonmen tout bwa vèt nan nou menm ak tout bwa sèch. Flanm dife sa a p ap etenn e tout sifas latè soti nan sid jis rive nan nò va brile pa li menm. <verse eid="EZK 20:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="EZK 20:48"/>Tout chè va wè ke Mwen menm, SENYÈ a, te limen li. Li p ap etenn.”’”<verse eid="EZK 20:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="EZK 20:49"/>Epi mwen te di: “O Senyè BONDYE! Y ap di de mwen: ‘Èske se pa parabòl sèlman <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:49 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 17:2">Éz 17:2</ref></char></note>l ap pale?’”<verse eid="EZK 20:49"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 20"/>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="EZK 21"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 21:1"/>Konsa, pawòl SENYÈ a te vin kote Mwen. Li te di: <verse eid="EZK 21:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 21:2"/>“Fis a lòm, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 20:46">Éz 20:46</ref></char></note>ranje figi ou vè Jérusalem. Pale kont sanktyè yo e pwofetize kont peyi Israël: <verse eid="EZK 21:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 21:3"/>Di a peyi Israël la: ‘Konsa pale SENYÈ a: “Gade byen, Mwen vin kont nou. Mwen va rale nepe Mwen nan fouwo, e Mwen va koupe retire de nou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 31:13">Jr 31:13</ref></char></note>moun dwat yo ak mechan yo. <verse eid="EZK 21:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 21:4"/>Konsa, lè M ap koupe retire nèt de nou, moun dwat yo ansanm ak mechan yo, nan menm fwa, nepe M va rale soti nan fouwo li, kont tout chè soti nan sid jis rive nan nò. <verse eid="EZK 21:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 21:5"/>Konsa, tout chè va konnen ke Mwen, SENYÈ a, te rale nepe Mwen sòti nan fouwo. Li <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 3:12">I Sam 3:12</ref></char></note>p ap remete nan fouwo ankò.”’<verse eid="EZK 21:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 21:6"/>“Pou ou menm, fis a lòm, plenn fò nan gòj ou ak kè kase, ak doulè òrib. Plenn nan gòj devan zye yo, ak kè kase, byen amè. <verse eid="EZK 21:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 21:7"/>Konsa, lè yo mande ou, ‘Poukisa w ap plenn nan?’ ou va di: ‘Akoz <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 7:26">Éz 7:26</ref></char></note>nouvèl k ap vini an! Tout kè va fann, tout men va vin pèdi fòs, nanm a tout moun va vin fennen e tout jenou yo va vin fèb tankou dlo. Gade byen, sa ap vini e sa va fèt’, deklare Senyè BONDYE a.’”<verse eid="EZK 21:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 21:8"/>Ankò, pawòl SENYÈ a te rive kote mwen. Li te di: <verse eid="EZK 21:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 21:9"/>“Fis a lòm, pwofetize e di: ‘Konsa pale SENYÈ a:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 21:9">“Yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 32:41">Det 32:41</ref></char></note>nepe! Yon nepe!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 21:9">Li file e anplis, klere!<verse eid="EZK 21:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 21:10"/>File pou fè yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 34:5-6">És 34:5-6</ref></char></note>masak,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 21:10">klere pou tire kon kout loray!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 21:10">Èske se konsa nou dwe fè kè kontan?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 21:10">Baton fis Mwen an, kondannen denyè pyebwa a.<verse eid="EZK 21:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 21:11"/>Li fèt pou li ta poli,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 21:11">pou yo kab manyen li.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 21:11">Nepe a file e poli,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 21:11">pou plase nan men a sila k ap touye a.<verse eid="EZK 21:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 21:12"/>Kriye fò e rele anmwey, fis a lòm;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 21:12">paske li kont pèp Mwen an,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 21:12">li kont tout <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 21:25">Éz 21:25</ref></char></note>prens Israël yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 21:12">Yo vin livre a nepe a avèk pèp Mwen an.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 21:12">Akoz sa, frape kwis ou.<verse eid="EZK 21:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 21:13"/>“Paske gen yon tribinal. Kisa pou di si menm baton ki kondanen an pa la ankò?” deklare Senyè BONDYE a.<verse eid="EZK 21:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 21:14"/>“Pou sa, ou menm, fis a lòm,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 21:14">pwofetize e bat men ou ansanm.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 21:14">Kite nepe a vin <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 26:21-24">Lev 26:21-24</ref></char></note>double pou twazyèm fwa a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 21:14">nepe pou tout sila ak blesi fatal yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 21:14">Se nepe pou gran la ki pote yon blesi fatal.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 21:14">Nan chanm yo l ap antre.<verse eid="EZK 21:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 21:15"/>Pou kè yo ka fann, e anpil moun</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 21:15">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">21:15 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 59:10">És 59:10</ref>
      </char>
    </note>tonbe sou pòtay yo, Mwen te plase nepe klere a devan tout potay yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 21:15">Ah! Li fèt pou frape tankou loray;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 21:15">li byen pwenti ak lentansyon fè masak.<verse eid="EZK 21:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 21:16"/>Rasanble nou menm.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 21:16">Ale adwat!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 21:16">Pozisyone ou byen alinye!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 21:16">Ale agoch,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 21:16">nenpòt kote ou gade.<verse eid="EZK 21:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 21:17"/>Anplis, Mwen va bat men M ansanm;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 21:17">Mwen va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 5:13">Éz 5:13</ref></char></note>satisfè chalè kòlè Mwen.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 21:17">Mwen, SENYÈ a, Mwen te pale li.”<verse eid="EZK 21:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 21:18"/>Pawòl SENYÈ a te vin kote mwen. Li te di: <verse eid="EZK 21:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 21:19"/>“Pou ou menm, fis a lòm, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 1:10">Jr 1:10</ref></char></note>fè de wout pou nepe wa Babylone nan kapab vini. Toulède va sòti nan yon sèl peyi. Epi fè yon endikasyon sou poto bwa. Fè l nan tèt wout pou antre nan vil la. <verse eid="EZK 21:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 21:20"/>Ou va trase wout la pou nepe a vin rive nan Rabbath a fis a Ammon yo, e vè Juda, nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 48:12">Sòm 48:12</ref></char></note>Jérusalem fòtifye a. <verse eid="EZK 21:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 21:21"/>Paske wa Babylone nan te kanpe nan kote wout yo divize a, nan tèt a de wout yo, pou fè sèvis divinò. Li te souke flèch yo, li konsilte zidòl lakay yo, li egzamine fwa a. <verse eid="EZK 21:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 21:22"/>Sou men dwat li, oso a an te parèt; ‘Jérusalem,’ pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 4:2">Éz 4:2</ref></char></note>monte ak gwo moso bwa long pou kraze pòtay yo, pou ouvri bouch pou masak la, pou leve vwa gwo kri batay la, pou mete gwo bout bwa long yo kont pòtay yo, pou monte ran syèj yo, pou bati yon miray syèj. <verse eid="EZK 21:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 21:23"/>Epi sa va pou yo kon yon fo divinasyon nan zye yo. Yo te fè sèman solanèl, men li <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 5:15">Nonb 5:15</ref></char></note>mennen inikite nan memwa yo, pou yo ka vin sezi yo.<verse eid="EZK 21:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 21:24"/>“Akoz sa”, pale Senyè BONDYE a: ‘Akoz nou te mennen inikite nan memwa nou, nan sa, transgresyon nou yo vin dekouvri nèt. Konsa, pou tout zak nou yo, peche nou vin parèt—akoz nou vin sonje yo, men lan va vin sezi nou.<verse eid="EZK 21:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 21:25"/>“‘Epi ou menm, O nonm mechan an ak blesi fatal la, prens Israël la, ou menm ak <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 37:13">Sòm 37:13</ref></char></note>jou ki rive a, nan moman pinisyon final lan. <verse eid="EZK 21:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 21:26"/>Konsa pale Senyè BONDYE a: “Retire mouchwa sou tèt ou a, e retire kouwòn nan. Sa p ap menm ankò. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 75:7">Sòm 75:7</ref></char></note>Leve sa ki ba e bese sa ki wo. <verse eid="EZK 21:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZK 21:27"/>Mwen va boulvèse, boulvèse, boulvèse tout sa a. Sa tou p ap genyen li ankò jiskaske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 2:6">Sòm 2:6</ref></char></note>Sila ki gen dwa a, vini, e Mwen va bay li a Li menm.”’<verse eid="EZK 21:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZK 21:28"/>“Ou menm, fis a lòm, pwofetize e di: ‘Konsa pale Senyè BONDYE a konsènan fis a Ammon yo e konsènan ‘repwòch’ yo:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 21:28">“Yon nepe, yon nepe fin rale!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 21:28">Li klere pou masak la,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 21:28">pou fè l konsonmen nèt,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 21:28">pou li kapab tankou loray.<verse eid="EZK 21:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EZK 21:29"/>Pandan yo wè pou ou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 27:9">Jr 27:9</ref></char></note>fo vizyon yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 21:29">pandan yo devine manti pou ou,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 21:29">pou mete ou sou kou a mechan ki gen blesi fatal la,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 21:29">jou a sila ki fin rive a, nan lè pinisyon final la.<verse eid="EZK 21:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="EZK 21:30"/>Remete li nan fouwo a.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 21:30">Nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 25:5">Éz 25:5</ref></char></note>plas kote ou te kreye a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 21:30">nan pwòp peyi ou an, Mwen va jije ou.<verse eid="EZK 21:30"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="EZK 21:31"/>Mwen va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 14:9">Éz 14:9</ref></char></note>vide kòlè Mwen sou ou.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 21:31">Mwen va soufle sou ou ak dife kòlè Mwen</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 21:31">e Mwen va livre ou nan men a lezòm brital yo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 21:31">sila ak gran kapasite pou detwi.<verse eid="EZK 21:31"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="EZK 21:32"/>Ou va vin<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 20:47-48">Éz 20:47-48</ref></char></note>bwa sèch pou dife a;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 21:32">san ou va vide nan mitan peyi a.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 21:32">Yo p ap sonje ou ankò;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 21:32">paske Mwen menm, SENYÈ a, fin pale.”’”<verse eid="EZK 21:32"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 21"/>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="EZK 22"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 22:1"/>Alò, pawòl SENYÈ a te rive kote mwen. Li te di: <verse eid="EZK 22:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 22:2"/>“Epi ou menm, fis a lòm, èske ou va jije? Èske ou jije vil sanglan an? Alò, fè l konnen tout abominasyon li yo. <verse eid="EZK 22:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 22:3"/>Ou va di: ‘Konsa pale Senyè BONDYE a: “Yon vil k ap <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 22:6-27">Éz 22:6-27</ref></char></note>vèsè san nan mitan li, pou tan pa li ka vini e ki fè zidòl kont enterè li, pou l ka vin souye! <verse eid="EZK 22:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 22:4"/>Ou te vin koupab pa san ke ou te vèse yo e vin souye pa zidòl ke ou te fè yo. Konsa, ou te mennen jou ou a vin pre, e ou fin rive nan ane ou yo. Akoz sa a, Mwen te fè ou vin yon repwòch pou nasyon yo, e yon vye rizib pou tout peyi yo. <verse eid="EZK 22:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 22:5"/>Sila ki pre ak sila ki lwen ou yo va moke ou, ou menm ak move repitasyon, plen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 22:2">És 22:2</ref></char></note>twoub.<verse eid="EZK 22:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 22:6"/>“‘“Gade byen, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 1:23">És 1:23</ref></char></note>chèf Israël yo, yo chak selon fòs pouvwa yo, te nan ou ak bi pou vèse san an. <verse eid="EZK 22:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 22:7"/>Nan ou yo te trete papa ak manman a lejè. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 22:21">Egz 22:21</ref></char></note>Etranje yo te oprime nan mitan ou. Òfelen ak vèv yo te maltrete nan ou. <verse eid="EZK 22:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 22:8"/>Ou te meprize bagay sen Mwen yo, e ou pwofane <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 20:13-24">Éz 20:13-24</ref></char></note>Saba Mwen yo. <verse eid="EZK 22:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 22:9"/>Mesye medizan yo te anndan ou nan bi pou yo ta ka vèse san. Nan ou, yo te manje sou lotèl mòn yo. Nan mitan ou, yo te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 23:29">Éz 23:29</ref></char></note>komèt zak ki tèlman lèd. <verse eid="EZK 22:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 22:10"/>Nan ou, yo te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 18:8">Lev 18:8</ref></char></note>dekouvri nidite a papa yo. Nan ou, yo te imilye fanm ki pa t pwòp akoz règ yo. <verse eid="EZK 22:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 22:11"/>Youn te komèt abominasyon ak madanm a vwazen li, e yon lòt, nan yon zak byen lèd, te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 18:15">Lev 18:15</ref></char></note>souye bèlfi li. Epi yon lòt, nan ou, te imilye sè li, pitit a papa li. <verse eid="EZK 22:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 22:12"/>Nan ou, yo te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 19:13">Lev 19:13</ref></char></note>touche anba tab pou yo ta vèse san. Ou te pran enterè ak pwofi, ou te fè donmaj a vwazen ou yo pou ou kab vin genyen pa opresyon, e ou te bliye Mwen,” deklare Senyè BONDYE a.<verse eid="EZK 22:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 22:13"/>“‘“Alò, gade byen, Mwen frape men M kont pwofi malonèt ou, ke ou te vin genyen nan vèse san moun pami ou. <verse eid="EZK 22:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 22:14"/>Èske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 21:7">Éz 21:7</ref></char></note>kè ou kapab sipòte, oswa èske men ou kapab gen fòs nan jou ke Mwen va regle ou a? Mwen menm, SENYÈ a, te pale e Mwen va aji. <verse eid="EZK 22:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 22:15"/>Mwen va gaye ou pami nasyon yo, Mwen va dispèse ou nan tout peyi yo, e Mwen va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 23:27-48">Éz 23:27-48</ref></char></note>fè disparèt sa ki pa pwòp pami ou. <verse eid="EZK 22:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 22:16"/>Ou va pwofane tèt ou devan zye a tout nasyon yo, e ou va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 83:18">Sòm 83:18</ref></char></note>konnen ke Mwen se SENYÈ a.”’”<verse eid="EZK 22:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 22:17"/>Pawòl SENYÈ a te vin kote mwen. Li te di: <verse eid="EZK 22:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 22:18"/>“Fis a lòm, lakay Israël la te vin dechè pou Mwen. Yo tout se <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 6:23-30">Jr 6:23-30</ref></char></note>bwonz, fè blan, fè ak plon nan fou. Yo se dechè ajan. <verse eid="EZK 22:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 22:19"/>Pou sa, konsa pale Senyè BONDYE a: ‘Akoz nou tout te vin dechè, pou sa, gade byen, Mwen pral rasanble nou nan mitan Jérusalem. <verse eid="EZK 22:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 22:20"/>Jan yo rasanble ajan, bwonz, fè, plon, ak fè blan nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 1:25">És 1:25</ref></char></note>fou pou soufle dife sou li pou fann li, konsa, Mwen va rasanble nou nan mekontantman Mwen ak nan chalè kòlè Mwen, e la, Mwen va depoze nou pou fann nou. <verse eid="EZK 22:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 22:21"/>Mwen va rasanble nou pou soufle sou nou avèk dife kòlè Mwen, e nou va vin fann nèt nan mitan li. <verse eid="EZK 22:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 22:22"/>Tankou ajan fann nan founo, se konsa nou va fann nan mitan li. Konsa, nou va konnen ke Mwen menm, SENYÈ a, te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 20:8-33">Éz 20:8-33</ref></char></note>vide chalè kòlè Mwen sou nou.’”<verse eid="EZK 22:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 22:23"/>Ankò pawòl SENYÈ a te vin kote mwen. Li te di: <verse eid="EZK 22:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 22:24"/>“Fis a lòm, di a fi a: ‘Ou se peyi ki <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 9:13">És 9:13</ref></char></note>pa pwòp la, ki p ap gen lapli nan jou kòlè a.’ <verse eid="EZK 22:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 22:25"/>Gen konplo a pwofèt nan mitan li yo, kon yon lyon voras k ap dechire bèt pou li manje. Yo fin devore nanm moun. Yo te pran trezò presye ak tout bagay chè yo. Yo te fè anpil vèv nan mitan li. <verse eid="EZK 22:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 22:26"/>Prèt li yo te fè vyolans kont lalwa Mwen an, e te pwofane bagay sen Mwen yo. Yo pa t fè okenn <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 10:10">Lev 10:10</ref></char></note>separasyon antre sa ki sen ak sa ki pwofàn, ni yo pa t ansegne distenksyon antre sa ki pa pwòp ak sa ki pwòp. Yo kache zye yo devan Saba Mwen yo, e Mwen vin pwofane pami yo. <verse eid="EZK 22:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZK 22:27"/>Prens ki anndan li yo tankou lou k ap dechire bèt pou yo manje, k ap vèse san e detwi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 22:25">Éz 22:25</ref></char></note>lavi pou fè benefis malonèt. <verse eid="EZK 22:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZK 22:28"/>Pwofèt li yo blanchi tout bagay ak lacho pou yo, nan fè fo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 23:25-32">Jr 23:25-32</ref></char></note>vizyon ak divinasyon manti pou yo; divinasyon k ap di: ‘Konsa pale Senyè BONDYE a’, lè SENYÈ a pa t pale. <verse eid="EZK 22:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EZK 22:29"/>Pèp peyi a te pratike <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 5:7">És 5:7</ref></char></note>opresyon ak vòl, yo te vòlè malere ak endijan yo, e te oprime sila ki rete pami yo san jistis.<verse eid="EZK 22:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="EZK 22:30"/>“Mwen te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 59:16">És 59:16</ref></char></note>chache pami yo yon nonm ki pou ta bati miray la, e kanpe nan brèch la devan Mwen pou peyi a, pou M pa ta detwi li, men Mwen pa t jwenn pèsòn. <verse eid="EZK 22:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EZK 22:31"/>Pou sa, Mwen fin vide chalè a kòlè Mwen sou yo. Mwen te konsonmen yo nèt ak dife a chalè kòlè Mwen. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 7:3-9">Éz 7:3-9</ref></char></note>Chemen pa yo, Mwen te fè l desann sou tèt yo,” deklare Senyè BONDYE a.<verse eid="EZK 22:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 22"/>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="EZK 23"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 23:1"/>Pawòl SENYÈ a te vini kote Mwen ankò e te di: <verse eid="EZK 23:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 23:2"/>“Fis a lòm, te gen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 16:46">Éz 16:46</ref></char></note>de fanm, fi a yon sèl manman. <verse eid="EZK 23:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 23:3"/>Yo te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 17:7">Lev 17:7</ref></char></note>jwe pwostitiye an Égypte. Yo te jwe pwostitiye a nan jenès yo. Tete yo te peze e flè vyèj yo te touche. <verse eid="EZK 23:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 23:4"/>Non yo se te Ohola ak sè li, Oholiba. Konsa, yo te vin pou Mwen, epi yo te vin fè fis ak fi. Epi pou zafè non yo a, Samarie se Ohola e Jérusalem se Oholiba.<verse eid="EZK 23:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 23:5"/>“Ohola te jwe pwostitiye a pandan li te pou Mwen an. Li te kouri ak anvi dèyè moun ki renmen li yo, dèyè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 15:19">II Wa 15:19</ref></char></note>Asiryen yo, vwazen li yo. <verse eid="EZK 23:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 23:6"/>Sila yo te abiye an mov, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 23:12-13">Éz 23:12-13</ref></char></note>chèf ak ofisye yo. Yo tout te bèl jenn gason, chevalye k ap galope cheval. <verse eid="EZK 23:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 23:7"/>Li te pataje pwostitiye li ak yo; tout nan yo te dè mesye byen chwazi an Assyrie. Epi avèk yo tout, li te kouri ak anvi lachè a, ak tout zidòl yo, li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 20:7">Éz 20:7</ref></char></note>souye tèt li. <verse eid="EZK 23:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 23:8"/>Li pa t abandone zak pwostitisyon li yo ki te la <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 32:4">Egz 32:4</ref></char></note>depi nan tan Égypte la; paske nan jenès li, gason te kouche avèk li. Yo te manyen tete vyèj li e te vide dezi lachè sou li.<verse eid="EZK 23:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 23:9"/>“Akoz sa, Mwen te bay li nan men a moun ki <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 16:37">Éz 16:37</ref></char></note>renmen li yo, nan men Asiryen yo. Sou sila yo, li te pote anvi lachè yo. <verse eid="EZK 23:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 23:10"/>Yo te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 16:37-41">Éz 16:37-41</ref></char></note>dekouvri nidite li. Yo te pran fis ak fi li yo, men yo te touye li menm ak nepe. Konsa, li te vin yon pawòl avètisman pami fanm yo, e yo te egzekite jijman yo sou li.<verse eid="EZK 23:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 23:11"/>“Alò sè li, Oholiba, te wè sa, men li menm te vin <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 3:8-11">Jr 3:8-11</ref></char></note>pi konwonpi nan anvi pa li a ke sè li a, e pwostitiye li a te pi mal pase pwostitiye sè li. <verse eid="EZK 23:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 23:12"/>Li te gen anvi pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 16:7">II Wa 16:7</ref></char></note>Asiryen yo, chèf yo, ak ofisye yo, sila ki pre yo, sila ki abiye kon prens yo, chevalye k ap galope cheval yo, yo tout se bèl gason byen pòtan. <verse eid="EZK 23:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 23:13"/>Mwen te wè ke li te souye tèt li. Yo toulède te pran menm wout la.<verse eid="EZK 23:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 23:14"/>“Konsa, li te fè pwostitiye li a vin pi gwo. Epi li te wè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 8:10">Éz 8:10</ref></char></note>pòtre gason yo sou miray la, imaj a Kaldeyen yo fèt an penti wouj, <verse eid="EZK 23:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 23:15"/>abiye ak sentiwon nan ren yo, avèk mòso twal long nan tèt yo, yo tout te sanble ofisye, tankou Babilonyen ki Chaldée yo, peyi nesans yo. <verse eid="EZK 23:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 23:16"/>Lè li te wè yo, li te fè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 23:20">Éz 23:20</ref></char></note>gwo anvi lachè dèyè yo, e te voye mesaje kote yo Chaldée. <verse eid="EZK 23:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 23:17"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 24:17">II Wa 24:17</ref></char></note>Babilonyen yo te vin kote li sou kabann lanmou an e te souye li ak pwostitiye yo. Epi lè li te fin defile ak yo, li te bouke jis li about ak yo. <verse eid="EZK 23:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 23:18"/>Konsa, li te dekouvri zak pwostitisyon li an e li te dekouvri nidite li, epi Mwen te vin <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 78:59">Sòm 78:59</ref></char></note>about avèk li, menm jan Mwen te about ak sè li a. <verse eid="EZK 23:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 23:19"/>Malgre sa, li te miltipliye pwostitisyon li yo, lè l te sonje jou jenès li yo, lè l te konn jwe pwostitiye nan peyi Égypte la. <verse eid="EZK 23:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 23:20"/>Li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 16:26">Éz 16:26</ref></char></note>fè lanvi nan kouri dèyè tout moun ki gen chè tankou chè bourik ak ekoulman kon ekoulman cheval yo. <verse eid="EZK 23:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 23:21"/>Konsa, ou te fè lanvi pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 3:9">Jr 3:9</ref></char></note>bagay lèd jenès ou yo lè Ejipsyen yo te konn manyen lestonmak ou akoz tete jenès ou yo.<verse eid="EZK 23:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 23:22"/>“Akoz sa, Oholiba, konsa pale Senyè BONDYE a: ‘Gade byen, Mwen va fè moun ki renmen ou yo soulve kont ou, soti nan sila yo ki pa byen avè w, e Mwen va mennen yo kont ou sou tout kote: <verse eid="EZK 23:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 23:23"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 20:14-17">II Wa 20:14-17</ref></char></note>Babilonyen yo ak tout Kaldeyen yo, Pekod, Schoa, Koa, ak tout Asiryen ki avèk yo; yo tout, jenn gason byen pòtan yo, chèf yo ak tout ofisye yo, ofisye ak mesye ki gen bon renome yo, tout sila k ap galope cheval yo. <verse eid="EZK 23:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 23:24"/>Yo va vini kont ou ak zam, cha, ak charyo e avèk yon gwo twoup moun yo. Yo va mete yo menm kont ou avèk zam, cha e avèk gwo twoup moun. Yo va mete yo kont ou tout kote ak nepe, boukliye ak kas. Konsa, Mwen va angaje <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 39:5-6">Jr 39:5-6</ref></char></note>jijman a yo menm e yo va jije ou selon koutim yo. <verse eid="EZK 23:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 23:25"/>Mwen va pozisyone <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 34:14">Egz 34:14</ref></char></note>jalouzi Mwen kont ou, pou yo ka aji avèk ou nan kòlè a gwo chalè Mwen an. Yo va retire nen ou ak zòrèy ou. Sila ki chape yo va tonbe pa nepe. Yo va pran fis ou yo ak fi ou yo, e sila ki chape yo va manje nan dife. <verse eid="EZK 23:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 23:26"/>Anplis, yo va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 13:22">Jr 13:22</ref></char></note>retire tout rad sou ou e yo va pran bèl bijou ou yo. <verse eid="EZK 23:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZK 23:27"/>Konsa, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 16:41">Éz 16:41</ref></char></note>Mwen va fè zak lèd ak zak pwostitisyon ke ou mennen sòti an Égypte yo vin sispann nan ou, pou ou pa leve zye ou bay yo, ni sonje Égypte ankò.’<verse eid="EZK 23:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZK 23:28"/>“Paske konsa pale Senyè BONDYE a: ‘Gade byen, Mwen va livre ou nan men a sila ke ou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 21:7-10">Jr 21:7-10</ref></char></note>rayi yo, nan men a yo menm de sila ou te vin ekate yo. <verse eid="EZK 23:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EZK 23:29"/>Yo va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 28:48">Det 28:48</ref></char></note>aji avèk ou ak rayisman, pran tout sa ou posede e kite ou toutouni san anyen menm. Konsa, nidite a zak pwostitisyon ou yo va vin ekspoze, ni zak lèd ou yo, ni zak pwostitisyon ou yo. <verse eid="EZK 23:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EZK 23:30"/>Bagay sa yo ap fèt a ou menm akoz ou te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 6:9">Éz 6:9</ref></char></note>jwe pwostitiye ak nasyon yo, akoz ou te souye tèt ou ak zidòl yo. <verse eid="EZK 23:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EZK 23:31"/>Ou te mache nan chemen a sè ou a. Pou sa, Mwen va mete <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 21:13">II Wa 21:13</ref></char></note>tas pa li a nan men ou.’<verse eid="EZK 23:31"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="EZK 23:32"/>“Konsa pale Senyè BONDYE a:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 23:32">“Ou va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 60:3">Sòm 60:3</ref></char></note>bwè tas a sè ou a ki fon e ki laj.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 23:32">Yo va ri sou ou e fè rizib sou ou.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 23:32">Li byen gwo.<verse eid="EZK 23:32"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="EZK 23:33"/>Ou va vin plen ak <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 25:15-27">Jr 25:15-27</ref></char></note>soulay ak tristès,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 23:33">tas a gwo laperèz ak dezolasyon,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 23:33">tas a sè ou a, Samarie.<verse eid="EZK 23:33"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="EZK 23:34"/>Ou va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 75:8">Sòm 75:8</ref></char></note>bwè li e vide li nèt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 23:34">Epi ou va manje sou ti mòso chire yo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 23:34">e dechire tete ou;</para>
  <para style="m" vid="EZK 23:34">paske Mwen te pale sa a”, deklare Senyè BONDYE a.<verse eid="EZK 23:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="EZK 23:35"/>“Pou sa, pale Senyè BONDYE a: ‘Akoz ou te bliye Mwen e te jete Mwen dèyè do ou, se pou ou sipòte, koulye a, pinisyon zak lèd ak zak pwostitisyon ou yo.’” <verse eid="EZK 23:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="EZK 23:36"/>Anplis, SENYÈ a te di mwen: “Fis a lòm, èske ou va jije Ohola ak Oholiba? Alò, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 58:1">És 58:1</ref></char></note>deklare a yo menm abominasyon yo. <verse eid="EZK 23:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="EZK 23:37"/>Paske yo te komèt adiltè e yo gen san nan men yo. Konsa, yo te komèt adiltè ak zidòl yo e te menm fè fis yo, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 16:20">Éz 16:20</ref></char></note>ke yo te fè pou Mwen yo, pase nan dife pou sèvi kon manje zidòl. <verse eid="EZK 23:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="EZK 23:38"/>Ankò, yo te fè M sa: yo te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 21:4-7">II Wa 21:4-7</ref></char></note>souye sanktyè Mwen an nan menm jou a, e te pwofane Saba Mwen yo. <verse eid="EZK 23:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="EZK 23:39"/>Paske lè yo te fin masakre tout fis yo pou zidòl yo, yo te antre nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:39 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 7:9-11">Jr 7:9-11</ref></char></note>sanktyè Mwen an nan menm jou a pou pwofane li; epi konsa, yo te fè anndan lakay Mwen an.<verse eid="EZK 23:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="EZK 23:40"/>“Anplis, sè ou yo te menm voye pou mesye ki te sòti lwen yo, a sila yon mesaje te voye. Epi gade byen, yo te vini. Pou sa a, ou te benyen kò w, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:40 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 9:30">II Wa 9:30</ref></char></note>pentire zye ou, e dekore tèt ou ak bijou yo. <verse eid="EZK 23:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="EZK 23:41"/>Ou te chita sou yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:41 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EST 1:6">Est 1:6</ref></char></note>sofa byen bèl ak yon tab byen ranje devan l sou sila ou te mete lansan Mwen ak lwil Mwen an.<verse eid="EZK 23:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="EZK 23:42"/>“Bri a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:42 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 16:49">Éz 16:49</ref></char></note>yon fèt ki plen moun ki alèz te avèk li. Lezòm klas ba, ak moun banal yo te mennen soti nan dezè a. Yo te mete braslè nan men a fanm sa yo ak bèl kouwòn nan tèt yo. <verse eid="EZK 23:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="EZK 23:43"/>Epi Mwen te di a li menm ki te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:43 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 23:3">Éz 23:3</ref></char></note>epwize nèt akoz adiltè li yo: ‘Èske yo va jwe pwostitiye ak li, koulye a, pandan li konsa a? <verse eid="EZK 23:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="EZK 23:44"/>Men yo te antre ladann konsi yo t ap antre nan yon pwostitiye. Konsa, yo te antre nan Ohola ak Oholiba, fanm zak lèd yo. <verse eid="EZK 23:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="EZK 23:45"/>Men yo menm, moun ladwati yo, va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:45 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 16:38">Éz 16:38</ref></char></note>jije yo ak jijman a yon fanm adiltè, e avèk jijman a yon fanm ki te vèse san, akoz se fanm adiltè ke yo ye, epi yo gen san sou men yo.<verse eid="EZK 23:45"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="EZK 23:46"/>“Paske konsa pale Senyè BONDYE a: ‘Mennen yon twoup kont yo e livre yo a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:46 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 15:4">Jr 15:4</ref></char></note>gwo laperèz ak piyaj. <verse eid="EZK 23:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="EZK 23:47"/>Twoup sa a va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:47 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 20:10">Lev 20:10</ref> </char></note>lapide yo ak wòch e rache yo ak nepe yo. Yo va touye fis ak fi yo e brile lakay yo ak dife.<verse eid="EZK 23:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="EZK 23:48"/>“‘Konsa, Mwen va fè zak lèd yo kite peyi a, pou tout fanm yo kapab vin avèti e pa komèt zak lèd jan nou konn fè a. <verse eid="EZK 23:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="EZK 23:49"/>Zak lèd nou yo va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:49 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 59:18">És 59:18</ref> </char></note>vin rekonpanse sou nou e nou va pote pinisyon pou adorasyon zidòl nou yo. Konsa, nou va konnen ke Mwen se Senyè BONDYE a.’”<verse eid="EZK 23:49"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 23"/>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="EZK 24"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 24:1"/>Ankò pawòl SENYÈ a te vin kote mwen, nan nevyèm ane, nan dizyèm mwa a, nan dizyèm jou nan mwa a, e te di: <verse eid="EZK 24:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 24:2"/>“Fis a lòm, ekri non a jou a, jou sa a menm. Wa Babylone nan te vin <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 25:1">II Wa 25:1</ref> </char></note>mete syèj sou Jérusalem nan menm jou sa a. <verse eid="EZK 24:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 24:3"/>Pale yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 78:2">Sòm 78:2</ref> </char></note>parabòl a kay rebèl la pou di yo: ‘Konsa pale Senyè BONDYE a:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 24:3">“Mete chodyè a sou difè a.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 24:3">Mete l,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 24:3">e anplis, vide dlo ladann.<verse eid="EZK 24:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 24:4"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">24:4 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MIC 3:2-3">Mi 3:2-3</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Mete mòso yo ladann,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 24:4">tout bon mòso yo:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 24:4">kwis ak zepòl la.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 24:4">Plen li ak zo byen chwazi yo.<verse eid="EZK 24:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 24:5"/>Pran mouton ki pi byen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 39:6">Jr 39:6</ref></char></note>chwazi</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 24:5">nan bann nan,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 24:5">e anplis, mete pil bwa anba chodyè a.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 24:5">Fè l bouyi fò.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 24:5">Anplis, fè bouyi zo ki ladann yo nèt.”<verse eid="EZK 24:5"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 24:6"/>“‘Pou sa, pale Senyè BONDYE a:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 24:6">“Malè a peyi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 24:3-4">II Wa 24:3-4</ref></char></note>sanglan sila a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 24:6">a chodyè nan sila gen lawouy ladann l!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 24:6">Lawouy la ki pa sòti ladann l!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 24:6">Retire ladann mòso pa mòso,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 24:6">san menm tire oso.<verse eid="EZK 24:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 24:7"/>“‘“Paske san fanm nan vèse</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 24:7">se nan mitan l.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 24:7">Li te mete l sou wòch vid la.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 24:7">Li pa t <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 17:13">Lev 17:13</ref></char></note>vide li atè a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 24:7">pou kouvri li ak pousyè.<verse eid="EZK 24:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 24:8"/>Pou l kapab <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 26:21">És 26:21</ref></char></note>koze gwo chalè</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 24:8">ak kòlè k ap pran vanjans,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 24:8">Mwen te mete san li sou wòch vid la,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 24:8">pou li kab pa kouvri.”<verse eid="EZK 24:8"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 24:9"/>“‘Akoz sa, pale Senyè BONDYE a: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 24:6">Éz 24:6</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 24:9">“Malè a vil sanglan sila a!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 24:9">Anplis, Mwen menm, Mwen va fè pil la gwo.<verse eid="EZK 24:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 24:10"/>Ogmante bwa a.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 24:10">Byen ranje dife a.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 24:10">Bouyi chè vyann nan byen.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 24:10">Mele epis ladann e kite zo yo vin brile.<verse eid="EZK 24:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 24:11"/>Epi mete li vid sou chabon limen li an</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 24:11">pou li ka byen cho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 24:11">pou bwonz li an kapab</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 24:11">gen koulè wouj</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 24:11">pou tout <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 22:15">Éz 22:15</ref></char></note>salte li yo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 24:11">kapab vin fann ladann,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 24:11">jiskaske lawouy li a fin manje nèt.<verse eid="EZK 24:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 24:12"/>Fi a te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 9:5">Jr 9:5</ref></char></note>fè M fatige</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 24:12">ak travay di ke M fè;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 24:12">malgre sa, gwo lawouy li a pa t kite li.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 24:12">Kite lawouy li a rete nan dife a!<verse eid="EZK 24:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 24:13"/>“‘“Nan salte ou a se tout zak ki lèd yo. Akoz mwen ta netwaye ou, malgre sa, ou pa pwòp; ou p ap vin pwòp de salte ou yo jiskaske Mwen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 5:13">Éz 5:13</ref></char></note>fè chalè kòlè Mwen an sou ou poze.<verse eid="EZK 24:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 24:14"/>“‘“Mwen, SENYÈ a, Mwen te pale. Sa ap vini e Mwen va aji. Mwen p ap ralanti e Mwen p ap gen pitye ni mwen p ap gen regrè. Selon zak ou yo, Mwen va jije ou,” deklare Senyè BONDYE a.’”<verse eid="EZK 24:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 24:15"/>Konsa, pawòl SENYÈ a te rive kote mwen e te di: <verse eid="EZK 24:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 24:16"/>“Fis a lòm, gade byen, Mwen prèt pou retire sou ou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="SNG 7:10">Kan 7:10</ref></char></note>dezi zye ou yo ak yon sèl kou; men ou p ap plenyen, ni ou p ap kriye, ni dlo p ap vini nan zye ou. <verse eid="EZK 24:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 24:17"/>Plenn nan gòj san fè bri. Pa fè dèy pou mò. Mare moso twal long ou nan tèt ou, mete soulye nan pye ou. Pa kouvri bouch ou e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 16:7">Jr 16:7</ref></char></note>pa manje pen fè dèy a.”<verse eid="EZK 24:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 24:18"/>Konsa, mwen te pale ak pèp la nan maten an, e nan aswè, madanm mwen te mouri. Konsa, nan maten an, mwen te fè jan yo te kòmande mwen an.<verse eid="EZK 24:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 24:19"/>Pèp la te mande m: “Èske ou p ap di nou kisa sa vle di ke ou ap aji konsa?”<verse eid="EZK 24:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 24:20"/>Epi mwen te di yo: “Pawòl SENYÈ a te vin kote mwen. Li te di: <verse eid="EZK 24:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 24:21"/>‘Pale ak lakay Israël: “Konsa pale Senyè BONDYE a: ‘Gade byen, Mwen prèt pou pwofane sanktyè Mwen an, ògèy a pouvwa nou an, dezi a zye nou, e plezi a nanm nou. Epi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 6:11">Jr 6:11</ref></char></note>fis ak fi nou yo, ke nou te kite dèyè yo; yo va tonbe pa nepe. <verse eid="EZK 24:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 24:22"/>Nou va fè jan mwen te fè a. Nou p ap kouvri bouch nou, ni nou p ap manje pen fè dèy a. <verse eid="EZK 24:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 24:23"/>Tiban nou va sou tèt nou e soulye nou nan pye nou. Nou p ap fè dèy, ni nou p ap kriye; men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 26:39">Lev 26:39</ref></char></note>nou va plenyen nan inikite nou yo e nou va plenyen youn bay lòt. <verse eid="EZK 24:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 24:24"/>Konsa, Ézéchiel va vin yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 4:3">Éz 4:3</ref></char></note>sign pou nou, selon tout sa ke li menm te fè, nou va fè yo. Lè sa rive, alò nou va konnen ke Mwen se Senyè BONDYE a.’”’”<verse eid="EZK 24:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 24:25"/>“Pou ou menm, fis a lòm, èske sa p ap nan jou a, lè M ap retire <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 48:2">Sòm 48:2</ref></char></note>fòs yo nan men yo, lajwa fyète yo, dezi a zye yo e plezi a kè yo, fis ak fi pa yo, <verse eid="EZK 24:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 24:26"/>pou nan jou sila a, sila ki <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 4:12">I Sam 4:12</ref></char></note>chape a va vin kote ou ak enfòmasyon pou zòrèy ou? <verse eid="EZK 24:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZK 24:27"/>Nan jou sa a, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 3:26">Éz 3:26</ref></char></note>bouch ou va vin louvri a sila ki te chape a, ou va pale, e ou p ap bèbè ankò. Konsa, ou va vin yon sign pou yo, e yo va konnen ke Mwen se SENYÈ a.”<verse eid="EZK 24:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 24"/>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="EZK 25"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 25:1"/>Epi pawòl SENYÈ a te rive kote mwen. Li te di: <verse eid="EZK 25:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 25:2"/>Fis a lòm, mete figi ou vè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 49:1-6">Jr 49:1-6</ref></char></note>fis a Ammon yo e pwofetize kont yo, <verse eid="EZK 25:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 25:3"/>Di a fis a Ammon yo: ‘Tande pawòl Senyè BONDYE a! Konsa pale Senyè BONDYE a: “Akoz ou te di: ‘Ha ha!’ kont sanktyè Mwen an lè li te vin pwofane a, kont peyi Israël lè l te vin dezole nèt la, e kont lakay Juda lè l te antre an egzil la, <verse eid="EZK 25:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 25:4"/>pou sa, gade byen, Mwen va bay ou menm a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 6:3-33">Jij 6:3-33</ref></char></note>fis lès yo pou yo genyen ou nèt. Yo va mete kan yo pami ou e fè anplasman yo pami ou. Y ap manje fwi ou yo e bwè lèt ou yo. <verse eid="EZK 25:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 25:5"/>Mwen va fè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 3:11">Det 3:11</ref></char></note>Rabba vin yon patiraj pou chamo e fis a Ammon yo vin yon kote pou fè pak pou bann mouton. Konsa, nou va konnen ke Mwen se SENYÈ a.” <verse eid="EZK 25:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 25:6"/>Paske konsa pale Senyè BONDYE a: “Akoz nou te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 27:23">Job 27:23</ref></char></note>bat men nou, frape pye nou atè e te rejwi ak tout mepriz ki te nan kè nou kont peyi Israël, <verse eid="EZK 25:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 25:7"/>pou sa, gade byen, Mwen te lonje men M kont nou e Mwen va bay nou kon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 33:4">És 33:4</ref></char></note>piyaj a nasyon yo. Epi Mwen va koupe retire nou nèt de pèp yo, e fè nou peri soti nan peyi yo. Mwen va detwi nou. Konsa, nou va konnen ke Mwen se SENYÈ a.”<verse eid="EZK 25:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 25:8"/>“‘Konsa pale Senyè BONDYE a: “Akoz <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 15:1">És 15:1</ref></char></note>Moab ak Séir di: ‘Gade byen, lakay Juda a tankou tout nasyon yo,’ <verse eid="EZK 25:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 25:9"/>pou sa, gade byen, Mwen prive vil li yo de pòsyon bò kote yo, vil ki sou fwontyè li yo, ki se glwa a tout peyi a; <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 33:49">Nonb 33:49</ref></char></note>Beth-Jeschimoth Baal-Meon, ak Kirjathaïm, <verse eid="EZK 25:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 25:10"/>epi Mwen va bay li kon posesyon ansanm avèk <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 25:4">Éz 25:4</ref></char></note>fis a Ammon yo bay fis a lès yo, pou fis a Ammon pa vin sonje menm pami nasyon yo. <verse eid="EZK 25:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 25:11"/>Konsa, Mwen va egzekite jijman sou Moab, epi yo va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 9:16">Sòm 9:16</ref></char></note>konnen ke Mwen se SENYÈ a.”<verse eid="EZK 25:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 25:12"/>“‘Konsa pale Senyè BONDYE a: “Akoz <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 28:17">II Kwo 28:17</ref></char></note>Édom te aji kont lakay Juda lè l te pran vanjans, e te vin koupab anpil nan vanje tèt yo sou yo,” <verse eid="EZK 25:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 25:13"/>akoz sa, konsa pale Senyè BONDYE a: “Mwen va osi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 49:8">Jr 49:8</ref></char></note>lonje men M kont Édom e koupe retire nèt ni lòm ni bèt sou li. Mwen va fè dega ladann nèt. Soti nan Théman, jis rive nan Dedan, yo va tonbe pa nepe. <verse eid="EZK 25:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 25:14"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 11:14">És 11:14</ref></char></note>Mwen va poze vanjans Mwen sou Édom pa men a pèp Mwen an, Israël. Pou sa, yo va aji nan Édom selon mekontantman Mwen e selon chalè kòlè Mwen. Konsa, yo va vin konnen vanjans Mwen an,” deklare Senyè BONDYE a.<verse eid="EZK 25:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 25:15"/>“‘Konsa pale Senyè BONDYE a: “Akoz Filisten yo te aji ak <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 14:29-31">És 14:29-31</ref></char></note>vanjans e te pran vanjans yo avèk tout mepriz a nanm pou detwi ak yon rayisman etènèl,” <verse eid="EZK 25:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 25:16"/>akoz sa, konsa pale Senyè BONDYE a: “Gade byen, Mwen va lonje men M kont Filisten yo, menm koupe retire <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 30:14">I Sam 30:14</ref></char></note>Keretyen yo nèt, e detwi retay ki bò kot lanmè a. <verse eid="EZK 25:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 25:17"/>Mwen va egzekite gwo vanjans sou yo ak repwòch ki plen ak chalè kòlè Mwen. Epi yo va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 9:16">Sòm 9:16</ref></char></note>konnen ke Mwen se SENYÈ a lè Mwen poze vanjans Mwen sou yo a.”’”<verse eid="EZK 25:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 25"/>
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="EZK 26"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 26:1"/>Alò, nan onzyèm ane, nan premye nan mwa a, pawòl SENYÈ a te vin kote mwen. Li te di: <verse eid="EZK 26:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 26:2"/>“Fis a lòm, akoz Tyr te di konsènan Jérusalem: ‘Ha ha! Gade byen, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 62:10">És 62:10</ref></char></note>pòtay a pèp yo fin kraze; koulye a l ap remet nan men m. Mwen va vin ranpli koulye a akoz li devaste nèt;’ <verse eid="EZK 26:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 26:3"/>akoz sa, pale Senyè BONDYE a: ‘Gade byen, Mwen vin kont ou, O Tyr, e Mwen va mennen fè monte <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MIC 4:11">Mi 4:11</ref></char></note>anpil nasyon kont ou, tankou lanmè mennen lanm li. <verse eid="EZK 26:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 26:4"/>Yo va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 23:11">És 23:11</ref></char></note>detwi miray a Tyr e demoli tou wo li yo. Anplis, Mwen va grate retire ranblè li yo, e fè l vin yon wòch vid. <verse eid="EZK 26:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 26:5"/>Li va vin yon kote pou ouvri filè nan mitan lanmè a, paske Mwen te pale,’ deklare Senyè BONDYE a. ‘Konsa, li va vin <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 25:7">Éz 25:7</ref></char></note>piyaj pou nasyon yo. <verse eid="EZK 26:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 26:6"/>Anplis, fi li yo ki lòtbò pi gwo teren an va vin touye pa nepe e yo va konnen ke Mwen se SENYÈ a.’<verse eid="EZK 26:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 26:7"/>“Paske konsa pale Senyè BONDYE a: ‘Gade byen, Mwen va mennen sou Tyr soti nan nò Nebucadnetsar, wa Babylone nan, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 7:12">Éz 7:12</ref></char></note>wadèwa a, ak cheval, cha, kavalye ak yon gwo lame. <verse eid="EZK 26:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 26:8"/>Li va touye fi ou yo sou gwo chan an ak nepe. Li va fè miray syèj kont ou, fè monte yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 32:24">Jr 32:24</ref></char></note>ran kont ou e fè monte yon gwo boukliye kont ou. <verse eid="EZK 26:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 26:9"/>Ak gwo mòso bwa fèt pou kraze a, ke l ap dirije kont miray ou yo, e ak rach li yo li va demoli tou wo ou yo. <verse eid="EZK 26:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 26:10"/>Akoz gwo fòs kantite cheval li yo, pousyè leve la yo va kouvri ou. Miray ou yo va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 26:15">Éz 26:15</ref></char></note>souke ak bri kavalye, ak charyo ak cha yo lè l ap antre nan pòtay ou yo tankou lè moun ap antre nan yon vil lè yo fin fè brèch ladann. <verse eid="EZK 26:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 26:11"/>Ak zago <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 5:28">És 5:28</ref></char></note>cheval li yo, li va foule tout lari ou yo nèt. Li va touye moun ou yo ak nepe. Gwo pilye lafòs ou yo va tonbe atè. <verse eid="EZK 26:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 26:12"/>Anplis, yo va fè piyaj a tout richès ak machandiz ou yo. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 52:14">Jr 52:14</ref></char></note> Yo va kraze mi ou yo, detwi bèl kay ou yo, e jete wòch ak, poto bwa yo ak tout ranblè ou yo nan dlo. <verse eid="EZK 26:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 26:13"/>Konsa, Mwen va fè son a chante ou yo vin sispann, e son <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 5:12">És 5:12</ref></char></note>ap ou yo p ap tande ankò. <verse eid="EZK 26:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 26:14"/>Mwen va fè ou yon wòch vid. Ou va sèvi kon yon kote pou ouvri filè. Ou p ap <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 13:16">Det 13:16</ref></char></note>bati ankò, paske Mwen, SENYÈ a te pale’, deklare Senyè BONDYE a.<verse eid="EZK 26:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 26:15"/>“Konsa pale Senyè BONDYE a a Tyr: ‘Èske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 26:18">Éz 26:18</ref></char></note>peyi kot lanmè yo pa ta souke menm nan son chit ou a lè sila ki blese yo plenn nan gòj yo, lè masak fèt nan mitan nou? <verse eid="EZK 26:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 26:16"/>Nan lè sa a, tout prens lanmè yo va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JON 3:6">Jon 3:6</ref></char></note>desann soti nan twòn yo retire wòb yo, e menm retire bèl vètman bwodri yo. Yo va abiye tèt yo ak men yo k ap tranble; yo va chita atè, ap tranble tout tan e vin efreye akoz de ou. <verse eid="EZK 26:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 26:17"/>Yo va leve yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 19:1-14">Éz 19:1-14</ref></char></note>lamantasyon sou ou e di ou:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 26:17">“Gade kijan ou vin peri, O sila ki te plen moun nan,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 26:17">Soti sou lanmè yo, O gwo vil byen renome</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 26:17">ki te pwisan sou lanmè,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 26:17">li menm ak tout moun ki te rete ladann yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 26:17">ki te enpoze gwo laperèz li sou tout abitan li yo!”<verse eid="EZK 26:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 26:18"/>Koulye a, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 41:5">És 41:5</ref></char></note>peyi bò lanmè yo va tranble nan jou chit ou a.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 26:18">Wi, peyi kot ki bò lanmè yo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 26:18">va vin etone jiskaske yo tranble akoz ou vin disparèt.’<verse eid="EZK 26:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 26:19"/>“Paske konsa pale Senyè BONDYE a: “Lè Mwen fè ou vin yon vil dezole, kon vil ki pa gen moun yo, lè Mwen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 8:7-8">És 8:7-8</ref></char></note>mennen pwofondè a sou ou pou gwo dlo vin kouvri ou, <verse eid="EZK 26:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 26:20"/>konsa, Mwen va fè ou desann ak sila ki <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 14:9">És 14:9</ref></char></note>desann nan twou fòs la, al jwenn pèp ansyen yo. Mwen va fè ou rete nan pati ki piba sou tè a, tankou ansyen kote dezole yo, ak sila ki desann nan twou fòs la, pou ou pa menm gen moun ki abite nan ou. Men Mwen va mete laglwa nan peyi a vivan yo. <verse eid="EZK 26:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 26:21"/>Mwen va mennen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 26:15-16">Éz 26:15-16</ref></char></note>gwo laperèz sou ou e ou p ap egziste ankò. Malgre y ap chache ou, yo p ap janm jwenn ou ankò’, deklare Senyè BONDYE a.”<verse eid="EZK 26:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 26"/>
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="EZK 27"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 27:1"/>Anplis, pawòl SENYÈ a te rive kote mwen. Li te di: <verse eid="EZK 27:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 27:2"/>“Ou menm, fis a lòm, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 9:10">Jr 9:10</ref></char></note>leve yon lamantasyon sou Tyr. <verse eid="EZK 27:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 27:3"/>Di a Tyr, ‘Ou ki rete nan antre lanmè a, komèsan a pèp anpil peyi bò kot lanmè yo, Konsa pale Senyè BONDYE a:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:3">“O Tyr, ou te di ‘Mwen pafè nan bèlte.’<verse eid="EZK 27:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 27:4"/>Lizyè ou nan kè lanmè yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:4">Sila ki te bati ou yo te fè bèlte ou pafè.<verse eid="EZK 27:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 27:5"/>Yo te fè tout planch ou yo ak pye siprè Senir yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:5">Yo te chache pye sèd Liban yo pou fè ma pou ou.<verse eid="EZK 27:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 27:6"/>Ak chèn a Basan, yo te fè zaviwon ou yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:6">Ak ban ivwa, yo te koupe fè tras sou bwa siprè</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:6">ki te fèt ak pye sèd ki te mennen sòti jis rive Kittim.<verse eid="EZK 27:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 27:7"/>Vwal ou te fèt ak len fen ki te sòti an Égypte,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:7">ki te sèvi kon mak drapo ou.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:7">Anba pwotèj solay byen kolore an <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 25:4">Egz 25:4</ref></char></note>ble e mov,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:7">ki te sòti nan peyi kòt Élischa yo,<verse eid="EZK 27:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 27:8"/>mesye Sidon yo ak Arvad t ap bourade zaviwon ou yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:8">Mesye <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 9:27">I Wa 9:27</ref></char></note>saj ou yo, O Tyr, te nan ou.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:8">Se yo ki te pilòt yo.<verse eid="EZK 27:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 27:9"/>Ansyen a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 13:5">Jos 13:5</ref></char></note>Guebal yo ak mesye saj li yo te avèk nou,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:9">pou repare kote ki ouvri yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:9">Tout bato lanmè yo ak mèt bato yo te la pou</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:9">okipe machandiz ou yo.<verse eid="EZK 27:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 27:10"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">27:10 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 30:5">Éz 30:5</ref>
      </char>
    </note>“‘“Perse, Lud, ak Puth te nan lame ou,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:10">mesye lagè ou yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:10">Yo te pann boukliye ak kas nan ou.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:10">Yo te fè grandè ou parèt byen bèl.<verse eid="EZK 27:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 27:11"/>Fis a Avad yo ak lame ou a</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:11">te sou miray ou yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:11">e gèrye yo te pann boukliye yo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:11">sou miray ou yo toupatou.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:11">Yo te vin pèfeksone bèlte ou a.<verse eid="EZK 27:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 27:12"/>“‘“Tarsis te kliyan ou, akoz abondans tout kalite richès ou yo. Avèk ajan, fè, fè blan, ak plon, yo te achte machandiz ou yo.<verse eid="EZK 27:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 27:13"/>“‘“Javan, Tubal, ak Méschec te fè komès ak ou. Ak <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOL 3:3">Jl 3:3</ref></char></note>lavi a moun ak veso plen bwonz, yo te achte machandiz ou yo.”<verse eid="EZK 27:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 27:14"/>“‘“Sila nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 10:3">Jen 10:3</ref></char></note>Beth-Togarma yo te bay cheval ak cheval lagè ak milèt pou byen ou yo.”<verse eid="EZK 27:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 27:15"/>“‘“Fis a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 25:23">Jr 25:23</ref></char></note>Dedan yo te fè trafik avèk ou. Anpil peyi kot lanmè yo te vin fè mache ou. Kòn ivwa ak ebèn te pote pou fè twòk.<verse eid="EZK 27:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 27:16"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">27:16 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JDG 10:6">Jij 10:6</ref>
      </char>
    </note>“‘“Syrie te fè trafik avèk ou akoz abondans byen ou yo. Yo te peye pou bagay ou yo ak pyè presye, tenti mov, zèv bwodri, len fen, koray ak pyè woubi.”<verse eid="EZK 27:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 27:17"/>“‘“Juda ak peyi Israël te fè komès ak ou. Ak ble ki sòti <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 11:33">Jij 11:33</ref></char></note>Minnith, gato, siwo myèl, lwil ak bom, yo te peye pou machandiz ou.”<verse eid="EZK 27:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 27:18"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">27:18 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 14:15">Jen 14:15</ref>
      </char>
    </note>“‘“Damas te kliyan ou akoz gwo kantite byen ou yo, akoz gwo kantite a tout kalite richès ou yo, akoz diven Helbon an ak len blan an.”<verse eid="EZK 27:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 27:19"/>“‘“Vendan ak Javan te peye pou bagay ki sòti Uzal yo. Fè fòje, kasya, ak kann dous te pami machandiz ou yo.”<verse eid="EZK 27:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 27:20"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">27:20 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 25:3">Jen 25:3</ref>
      </char>
    </note>“‘“Dedan te fè komès ak ou nan sèl pou monte cheval.”<verse eid="EZK 27:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 27:21"/>“‘“Arabie ak tout prens a Kédar yo, te kliyan ou pou jenn mouton, belye ak kabrit yo. Nan tout sa yo, yo te kliyan ou.”<verse eid="EZK 27:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 27:22"/>“‘“Vandè a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 10:7">Jen 10:7</ref></char></note>Séba ak Raema yo te fè trafik ak ou. Yo te peye pou byen ou yo ak pi bon nan tout kalite epis, e ak tout bijou presye ak lò.”<verse eid="EZK 27:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 27:23"/>“‘“Charan, Canné, ak <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 19:12">II Wa 19:12</ref></char></note>Éden, machann a Séba, Assyrie, ak Kilmad yo te fè komès ak ou.” <verse eid="EZK 27:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 27:24"/>Yo te fè komès ak ou nan bèl abiman, nan vètman an ble ak bwodri fen, nan tapi a tout koulè, ak kòd trese byen sere, ki te pami machandiz ou yo.<verse eid="EZK 27:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 27:25"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">27:25 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 2:16">És 2:16</ref>
      </char>
    </note>“‘“Bato a Tarsis yo te transpòte machandiz ou yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:25">Epi ou te vin ranpli,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:25">te tèlman vin bèl nan kè lanmè yo.<verse eid="EZK 27:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 27:26"/>Mèt zaviwon yo te mennen ou nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 26:19">Éz 26:19</ref></char></note>gwo dlo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:26">Van lès la te vin kraze ou nan kè lanmè yo.<verse eid="EZK 27:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZK 27:27"/>Richès ou yo, byen ou yo, machandiz ou yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:27">maren ak pilòt ou yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:27">Gwo bòs pou ranje bato yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:27">vandè ki fè komès machandiz,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:27">Ak tout mesye lagè ki nan ou yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:27">ak tout twoup ki pami ou a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:27">va tonbe antre nan kè lanmè yo nan jou</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:27">boulvèsman ou an.<verse eid="EZK 27:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZK 27:28"/>Nan son kri a pilòt ou yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:28">tè patiraj yo va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 26:10-18">Éz 26:10-18</ref></char></note>souke.<verse eid="EZK 27:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EZK 27:29"/>Tout moun ki konn manyen zaviwon,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:29">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">27:29 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="REV 18:17-19">Rev 18:17-19</ref>
      </char>
    </note>mesye maren ak tout pilòt lanmè yo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:29">va desann kite bato yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:29">Yo va kanpe atè,<verse eid="EZK 27:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="EZK 27:30"/>epi yo va fè vwa yo vin tande sou ou,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:30">e yo va kriye anmè.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:30">Yo va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 4:12">I Sam 4:12</ref></char></note>jete pousyè sou tèt yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:30">Yo va vire tounen nan mitan sann yo.<verse eid="EZK 27:30"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="EZK 27:31"/>Anplis, yo va fè tèt yo vin chòv pou ou,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:31">e mare senti yo ak twal sak.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:31">Yo va kriye pou ou nan amètim nanm yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:31">ak yon plenyen byen anmè.<verse eid="EZK 27:31"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="EZK 27:32"/>Anplis, nan gwo kri yo fè, yo va fè leve yon</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:32">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">27:32 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 26:17">Éz 26:17</ref>
      </char>
    </note>lamantasyon pou ou, e menm kriye pou ou:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:32">‘Se kilès ki tankou Tyr, tankou sila ki</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:32">rete an silans nan mitan lanmè a?’<verse eid="EZK 27:32"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="EZK 27:33"/>Lè tout byen ou yo te sòti toupatou sou lanmè yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:33">ou te fè kè anpil pèp kontan.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:33">Ak <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 27:12-18">Éz 27:12-18</ref></char></note>fòs kantite richès ak machandiz ou yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:33">ou te fè wa latè yo vin rich.<verse eid="EZK 27:33"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="EZK 27:34"/>Alò, nan moman an, lè ou vin kraze nèt pa lanmè yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:34">nan fon dlo yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:34">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">27:34 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ZEC 9:3-4">Za 9:3-4</ref>
      </char>
    </note>machandiz ou ak tout twoup ou yo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:34">te tonbe pami ou.<verse eid="EZK 27:34"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="EZK 27:35"/>Tout <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 23:6">És 23:6</ref></char></note>sila ki rete nan peyi kot lanmè yo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:35">te vin efreye de ou,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:35">e wa yo vin plen ak gwo laperèz.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:35">Vizaj yo vin twouble.<verse eid="EZK 27:35"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="EZK 27:36"/>Komèsan pami pèp yo vin sifle anlè kon koulèv sou ou.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:36">Lafèn ou te vreman etonnan,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:36">e ou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 37:10-36">Sòm 37:10-36</ref></char></note>p ap la ankò, jis pou tout tan.”’”<verse eid="EZK 27:36"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 27"/>
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="EZK 28"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 28:1"/>Pawòl SENYÈ a te vin kote M ankò e te di: <verse eid="EZK 28:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 28:2"/>“Fis a lòm, pale ak chèf Tyr la: ‘Konsa pale Senyè BONDYE a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:2">“Akoz kè ou vin leve,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:2">e ou te di: ‘Mwen se yon dye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:2">Mwen chita sou chèz Bondye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:2">nan kè lanmè yo’;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:2">malgre, ou se yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 9:20">Sòm 9:20</ref></char></note>nonm</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:2">e ou pa yon dye;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:2">sepandan, ou ta fè kè ou tankou kè Bondye—<verse eid="EZK 28:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 28:3"/>gade byen, ou pi saj ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 1:20">Dan 1:20</ref></char></note>Daniel.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:3">Nanpwen sekrè ki twò difisil pou ou.<verse eid="EZK 28:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 28:4"/>Ak sajès ou ak bon konprann ou,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:4">ou te vin genyen richès pou tèt ou,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:4">e ou te vin gen lò ak ajan pou kès trezò ou yo.<verse eid="EZK 28:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 28:5"/>Ak gwo sajès ou, ak komès ou, ou te vin ogmante richès ou</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:5">e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 31:24-25">Job 31:24-25</ref></char></note>kè ou vin leve akoz richès ou yo—”<verse eid="EZK 28:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 28:6"/>“‘Akoz sa, konsa pale Senyè BONDYE a:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:6">“Akoz ou te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 9:17">Egz 9:17</ref></char></note>fè kè ou tankou kè Bondye,<verse eid="EZK 28:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 28:7"/>akoz sa, gade byen,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:7">Mwen va mennen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 26:7">Éz 26:7</ref></char></note>etranje yo sou ou,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:7">sila ki pi sovaj pami nasyon yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:7">Konsa, yo va rale nepe yo kont bèlte a sajès ou,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:7">e yo va souye gwo bèlte ou a.<verse eid="EZK 28:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 28:8"/>Yo va mennen ou desann nan twou fòs la,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:8">e ou va mouri <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 27:26-34">Éz 27:26-34</ref></char></note>lanmò a sila ki touye</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:8">nan kè lanmè yo.<verse eid="EZK 28:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 28:9"/>Èske ou va di: ‘Mwen se yon dye’,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:9">nan prezans a sila ki te touye ou a?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:9">Donk, ou se yon nonm e ou pa Bondye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:9">nan men a sila ki blese ou yo.<verse eid="EZK 28:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 28:10"/>Ou va mouri lanmò a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 17:26-36">I Sam 17:26-36</ref></char></note>ensikonsi yo, nan men etranje yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:10">paske Mwen te pale,” deklare Senyè BONDYE a!’”<verse eid="EZK 28:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 28:11"/>Ankò pawòl SENYÈ a te vin kote mwen. Li te di: <verse eid="EZK 28:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 28:12"/>“Fis a lòm, reprann lamantasyon sou wa Tyr la e di l: ‘Konsa pale Senyè BONDYE a:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:12">“Ou te genyen so pèfeksyon an,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:12">plen sajès e pafè an bèlte.<verse eid="EZK 28:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 28:13"/>Ou te nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 2:8">Jen 2:8</ref></char></note>Éden, jaden Bondye a.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:13">Tout pyè presye yo te sèvi pou kouvri ou:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:13">Ribi, topaz, dyaman; krizolit, oniks, ak jasp,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:13">Safi, malachi, emwòd,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:13">epi lò. Baz kalite travay</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:13">pou tout prezantasyon te nan ou.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:13">Nan jou ou te kreye a, yo te prepare.<verse eid="EZK 28:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 28:14"/>Ou te cheriben onksyone ki kouvri a</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:14">e Mwen te plase ou la.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:14">Ou te sou mòn sen Bondye a.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:14">Ou te mache nan mitan a pyè dife yo.<verse eid="EZK 28:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 28:15"/>Ou te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 27:3-4">Éz 27:3-4</ref></char></note>san fot nan tout chemen</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:15">ou yo depi jou ou te kreye a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:15">jis rive nan lè inikite te vin twouve nan ou a.<verse eid="EZK 28:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 28:16"/>Akoz <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 27:12">Éz 27:12</ref></char></note>gwo fòs kantite komès ou a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:16">ou te vin ranpli anndan ou ak vyolans</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:16">e ou te peche.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:16">Akoz sa, Mwen te jete ou kon pwofane</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:16">sòti nan mòn Bondye a.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:16">Mwen te detwi ou, O cheriben ki kouvri a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:16">soti nan mitan wòch dife a.<verse eid="EZK 28:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 28:17"/>Kè ou te vin leve wo akoz <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 27:3-4">Éz 27:3-4</ref></char></note>bèlte ou.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:17">Ou te fè sajès ou vin konwonpi</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:17">akoz gwo bèlte ou a.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:17">Mwen te jete ou atè.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:17">Mwen te mete ou devan wa yo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:17">pou yo wè ou.<verse eid="EZK 28:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 28:18"/>Akoz gwo fòs kantite inikite ou yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:18">nan enjistis de komès ou a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:18">ou te pwofane sanktyè ou yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:18">Akoz sa, Mwen te mennen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="AMO 1:9-10">Am 1:9-10</ref></char></note>dife soti nan mitan ou.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:18">Li fin manje ou nèt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:18">Mwen te fè ou vin tounen sann sou tè a</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:18">devan zye a tout moun ki wè ou yo.<verse eid="EZK 28:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 28:19"/>Tout moun ki rekonèt ou pami pèp yo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:19">vin etone jiskaske yo vin sezi de ou.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:19">Ou te vin yon gwo etonman laperèz,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:19">e ou va sispann egziste jis <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 51:64">Jr 51:64</ref></char></note>pou tout tan.”’”<verse eid="EZK 28:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 28:20"/>Pawòl SENYÈ a te rive kote mwen. Li te di: <verse eid="EZK 28:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 28:21"/>“Fis a lòm, mete figi ou vè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 10:15-19">Jen 10:15-19</ref></char></note>Sidon. Pwofetize kont li, <verse eid="EZK 28:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 28:22"/>epi di: ‘Konsa pale Senyè BONDYE a:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:22">“Gade byen, Mwen kont ou, O Sidon,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:22">e Mwen va vin glorifye nan mitan ou.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:22">Nan lè sa a, yo va konnen ke Mwen se SENYÈ a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:22">lè Mwen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 28:26">Éz 28:26</ref></char></note>egzekite jijman ladann li,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:22">e nan li, Mwen vin sen.<verse eid="EZK 28:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 28:23"/>Paske Mwen va voye epidemi ak bèt pou ravaje chan l.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:23">San ap koule nan ri li yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:23">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">28:23 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 51:52">Jr 51:52</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Sila ki blese yo va tonbe nan mitan li,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:23">e nepe va antoure l tout kote.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:23">Konsa, yo va konnen ke Mwen se SENYÈ a.<verse eid="EZK 28:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 28:24"/>“‘“P ap gen pou lakay Israël ankò <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 33:55">Nonb 33:55</ref></char></note>rakbwa pikan ni yon grenn pikan plen doulè k ap sòti nan sila ki te moke yo. Epi yo va konnen ke Mwen se Senyè BONDYE a.”<verse eid="EZK 28:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 28:25"/>“‘Konsa pale Senyè BONDYE a: “Lè M <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 106:47">Sòm 106:47</ref></char></note>rasanble lakay Israël soti nan pèp kote yo gaye yo, e fè sentete Mwen vin parèt nan yo devan zye a tout nasyon yo, nan lè sa a, yo va viv nan peyi ke M te bay a sèvitè Mwen an, Jacob. <verse eid="EZK 28:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 28:26"/>Yo va viv an sekirite ladann. Wi, yo va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 32:15-44">Jr 32:15-44</ref></char></note>bati kay, plante chan rezen e viv ansekirite lè Mwen egzekite jijman sou tout sila ki moke de yo. Epi yo va konnen ke Mwen se SENYÈ a, Bondye yo a.”’”<verse eid="EZK 28:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 28"/>
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="EZK 29"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 29:1"/>Nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 6:1">Éz 6:1</ref></char></note>dizyèm ane, nan dizyèm mwa, nan douz nan mwa a, pawòl SENYÈ a te vin kote mwen. Li te di: <verse eid="EZK 29:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 29:2"/>Fis a lòm, mete figi ou kont Farawon, wa Égypte la, e pwofetize kont li ak tout Égypte. <verse eid="EZK 29:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 29:3"/>Pale e di: ‘Konsa pale Senyè BONDYE a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 29:3">“Gade byen, Mwen kont ou, Farawon, wa Égypte,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 29:3">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">29:3 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 27:1">És 27:1</ref>
      </char>
    </note>gwo mons la ki kouche nan mitan</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 29:3">rivyè li yo, k ap di:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 29:3">‘Rivyè Nil lan se pou mwen</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 29:3">e se mwen menm ki te fè li.’<verse eid="EZK 29:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 29:4"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">29:4 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 19:28">II Wa 19:28</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Mwen va mete gwo kwòk nan machwè ou e</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 29:4">fè pwason larivyè ou yo vin kole sou kal ou yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 29:4">Konsa, Mwen va rale fè ou sòti nan mitan rivyè ou yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 29:4">ansanm ak tout pwason larivyè ou yo k ap kole sou kal ou yo.<verse eid="EZK 29:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 29:5"/>Mwen va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 32:4-6">Éz 32:4-6</ref></char></note>jete ou lwen nan dezè a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 29:5">ou menm ak tout pwason rivyè ou yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 29:5">Ou va tonbe nan chan ouvri.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 29:5">Ou p ap rasanble ni reyini ankò.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 29:5">Mwen te bay ou kon manje bèt latè</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 29:5">ak zwazo syèl yo.<verse eid="EZK 29:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 29:6"/>“‘“Konsa, tout moun ki rete an Égypte va konnen ke Mwen se SENYÈ a. Paske yo te sèlman yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 18:21">II Wa 18:21</ref></char></note>gòl fèt ak wozo pou lakay Israël. <verse eid="EZK 29:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 29:7"/>Lè yo te kenbe ou nan men yo, ou te kraze e chire tout men ak zepòl yo, Epi lè yo te apiye sou ou, ou te kraze kwis yo.”<verse eid="EZK 29:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 29:8"/>“‘Akoz sa, pale Senyè BONDYE a: “Gade byen, Mwen va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 46:13">Jr 46:13</ref></char></note>mennen sou ou nepe a, e Mwen va koupe retire nèt de ou ni moun, ni bèt. <verse eid="EZK 29:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 29:9"/>Peyi Égypte va devni yon dezolasyon ak yon savann dezole. Konsa, yo va konnen ke Mwen se SENYÈ a.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EZK 29:9">“‘“Paske ou te di: ‘Larivyè Nil lan se pou mwen e mwen te fè l.’ <verse eid="EZK 29:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 29:10"/>Pou sa, gade byen, Mwen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 13:8">Éz 13:8</ref></char></note>kont ou, e Mwen kont rivyè ou yo. Mwen va fè peyi Égypte vin yon savann dezole ak yon dezolasyon, soti Migdol jis rive Syène, menm pou rive nan lizyè Éthiopie. <verse eid="EZK 29:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 29:11"/>Pye a moun <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 43:11-12">Jr 43:11-12</ref></char></note>p ap pase ladann, pye a bèt p ap pase ladann, e l ap rete san moun pandan karantan. <verse eid="EZK 29:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 29:12"/>Konsa, Mwen va fè peyi Égypte vin yon dezolasyon nan mitan peyi ki dezole yo. Vil li yo, nan mitan a vil ki fin devaste nèt yo, yo va dezole pandan karantan. Mwen va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 46:19">Jr 46:19</ref></char></note>gaye Ejipsyen yo pami nasyon yo, e lage yo toupatou pami peyi yo.”<verse eid="EZK 29:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 29:13"/>“‘Paske konsa pale Senyè BONDYE a: “Nan fen karantan an, Mwen va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 19:22">És 19:22</ref></char></note>rasanble Ejipsyen yo soti nan pèp kote yo te gaye yo. <verse eid="EZK 29:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 29:14"/>Mwen va ranvèse fòtin li yo, e fè yo retounen nan peyi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 11:11">És 11:11</ref></char></note>Pathros, nan peyi orijin yo. La, yo va rete yon wayòm ki fèb. <verse eid="EZK 29:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 29:15"/>Li va pi fèb pami wayòm yo e li p ap janm leve tèt li ankò kon chèf lòt nasyon yo. Mwen va fè yo tèlman vin piti ke yo p ap <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 31:2">Éz 31:2</ref></char></note>renye sou lòt nasyon yo. <verse eid="EZK 29:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 29:16"/>Konsa, li p ap janm sèvi ankò kon konfyans pou lakay Israël la, pou l pa kontinye<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 64:9">És 64:9</ref></char></note>pote nan tèt yo, inikite lè yo te vire kote Égypte la. Epi yo va konnen ke Mwen se Senyè BONDYE a.”’”<verse eid="EZK 29:16"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 29:17"/>Alò, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 24:1">Éz 24:1</ref></char></note>nan venn-setyèm ane, nan premye mwa, nan premye jou nan mwa a, pawòl SENYÈ a te vin kote mwen. Li te di: <verse eid="EZK 29:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 29:18"/>“Fis a lòm, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 25:9">Jr 25:9</ref></char></note>Nebucadnetsar, wa Babylone nan, te fè lame li a travay di kont Tyr; tout tèt te vin chòv e tout epòl te fwote vin fè maleng. Men li menm ak lame li pa t reyisi salè soti nan Tyre pou travay li te fè kont li an. <verse eid="EZK 29:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 29:19"/>Akoz sa, pale Senyè BONDYE a: ‘Gade byen, Mwen va bay peyi Égypte a Nebucadnetsar, wa Babylone nan. Epi li va pote fè ale tout <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 43:10-13">Jr 43:10-13</ref></char></note>pèp li yo, kaptire donmaj li yo, e sezi li kon piyaj. Sa a va sèvi kon salè pou lame li a. <verse eid="EZK 29:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 29:20"/>Mwen te bay li peyi Égypte pou travay ke li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 10:6-7">És 10:6-7</ref></char></note>fè a, paske yo te aji pou Mwen,’ deklare Senyè BONDYE a.<verse eid="EZK 29:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 29:21"/>“Nan jou sa a, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 2:10">I Sam 2:10</ref></char></note>Mwen va fè yon kòn vin pouse pou lakay Israël, e Mwen va ouvri bouch ou nan mitan yo. Epi konsa, yo va konnen ke Mwen se SENYÈ a.”<verse eid="EZK 29:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 29"/>
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="EZK 30"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 30:1"/>Pawòl SENYÈ a te vin kote m ankò e te di:<verse eid="EZK 30:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 30:2"/>“Fis a lòm, pwofetize e di:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 30:2">‘Konsa pale Senyè BONDYE a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 30:2">“Rele <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">30:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 13:6">És 13:6</ref></char></note>‘Anmwey! Elas pou jou a!’<verse eid="EZK 30:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 30:3"/>Paske jou a pwòch.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 30:3">Menm <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">30:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 7:19">Éz 7:19</ref></char></note>jou SENYÈ a pwòch.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 30:3">Li va yon jou nwaj,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 30:3">yon tan fènwa pou nasyon yo.<verse eid="EZK 30:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 30:4"/>Yon nepe va rive sou Égypte</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 30:4">e gwo doulè va rive Ethiopie,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 30:4">lè sila yo touye yo tonbe an Égypte.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 30:4">Yo va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">30:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 29:19">Éz 29:19</ref></char></note>retire tout richès li yo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 30:4">e fondasyon li yo va fin demoli nèt.<verse eid="EZK 30:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 30:5"/>“‘“Ethiopie, Puth, Lud, tout <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">30:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 25:20-24">Jr 25:20-24</ref></char></note>Arabie, Cub, ak tout moun peyi ki nan gwoup aliyans yo va tonbe ak yo pa nepe.”<verse eid="EZK 30:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 30:6"/>“‘Konsa pale SENYÈ a:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 30:6">“Anverite, sila ki sipòte <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">30:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 20:3-6">És 20:3-6</ref></char></note>Égypte yo va tonbe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 30:6">Ògèy a pouvwa li a va tonbe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 30:6">Soti nan Migdol jis rive Syène,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 30:6">yo va tonbe pa nepe,”</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 30:6">deklare Senyè BONDYE a.<verse eid="EZK 30:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 30:7"/>Yo va vin dezole nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">30:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 25:18-26">Jr 25:18-26</ref></char></note>mitan peyi ki dezole yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 30:7">Konsa, vil li yo va nan mitan vil k ap devaste yo.<verse eid="EZK 30:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 30:8"/>Yo va konnen ke Mwen se SENYÈ a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 30:8">lè M limen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">30:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 22:31">Éz 22:31</ref></char></note>dife an Égypte la,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 30:8">e tout sila ki te ede l yo vin kraze nèt.<verse eid="EZK 30:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 30:9"/>“‘“Nan jou sa a, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">30:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 18:1-2">És 18:1-2</ref></char></note>mesaje yo va ale soti devan Mwen sou bato pou entimide Ethiopie akoz lenpridans. Gwo doulè va vin sou yo menm jan ak jou Égypte la; paske gade byen, l ap vini!”<verse eid="EZK 30:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 30:10"/>“‘Konsa pale Senyè BONDYE a:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 30:10">“Anplis <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">30:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 29:19">Éz 29:19</ref></char></note>Mwen va fè gwo foul lame Égypte la vin sispann</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 30:10">pa men Nebucadnetsar, wa Babylone nan.<verse eid="EZK 30:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 30:11"/>Li menm ak pèp li a avè l,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 30:11">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">30:11 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 28:7">Éz 28:7</ref>
      </char>
    </note>pi mechan pami nasyon yo va antre</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 30:11">pou detwi peyi a.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 30:11">Yo va rale nepe yo kont Égypte,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 30:11">e plen peyi a ak mò yo.<verse eid="EZK 30:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 30:12"/>Anplis, Mwen va seche kanal larivyè Nil yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 30:12">e vann <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">30:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 19:4">És 19:4</ref></char></note>peyi a pou antre nan men moun mechan yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 30:12">Mwen va fè peyi a vin dezole</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 30:12">ak tout sa ki ladann</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 30:12">pa men etranje yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 30:12">Mwen, SENYÈ a, fin pale.”<verse eid="EZK 30:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 30:13"/>“‘Konsa pale Senyè Bondye a:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 30:13">“Anplis, Mwen va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">30:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 2:18">És 2:18</ref></char></note>detwi zidòl yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 30:13">e fè imaj yo sispann nan Noph.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 30:13">P ap gen prens ankò nan peyi Égypte.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 30:13">Mwen va mete laperèz nan peyi Égypte.<verse eid="EZK 30:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 30:14"/>Mwen va fè Pathros vin dezole,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 30:14">mete dife nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">30:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 78:12-43">Sòm 78:12-43</ref></char></note>Tsoan,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 30:14">e egzekite jijman sou Nò.<verse eid="EZK 30:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 30:15"/>Mwen va vide chalè kòlè Mwen</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 30:15">sou Sin, sitadèl a Égypte la.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 30:15">Anplis, Mwen va koupe retire nèt gwo foul Nò yo.<verse eid="EZK 30:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 30:16"/>Mwen va mete dife an Égypte.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 30:16">Sin va vin tòde ak gwo doulè.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 30:16">No va kraze an mòso, separe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 30:16">Noph va gen brèch nèt ak gwo twoub chak jou.<verse eid="EZK 30:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 30:17"/>Jenn mesye a On ak Pi Béseth yo va tonbe pa nepe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 30:17">Y ap antre an kaptivite.<verse eid="EZK 30:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 30:18"/>Nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">30:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 43:8">Jr 43:8</ref></char></note>Tachpanès, jounen an va vin fènwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 30:18">lè M kraze jouk an fè Égypte la.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 30:18">Nan lè sa a, ògèy pouvwa li va sispann nan li.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 30:18">Yon nwaj va kouvri li,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 30:18">e fi li yo va antre an kaptivite.<verse eid="EZK 30:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 30:19"/>Konsa Mwen va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">30:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 9:16">Sòm 9:16</ref></char></note>egzekite jijman sou Égypte.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 30:19">Konsa, yo va konnen ke Mwen se SENYÈ a.”’”<verse eid="EZK 30:19"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 30:20"/>Nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">30:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 26:1">Éz 26:1</ref></char></note>onzyèm ane, nan premye mwa, nan setyèm jou nan mwa a, pawòl SENYÈ a te vin kote mwen. Li te di: <verse eid="EZK 30:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 30:21"/>“Fis a lòm, Mwen te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">30:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 10:5">Sòm 10:5</ref></char></note>kase bra Farawon an, wa Égypte la. Gade byen, li pa t velope ak pansman pou l ta geri, ni ak bandaj pou l ta ka vin gen fòs pou kenbe nepe. <verse eid="EZK 30:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 30:22"/>Konsa, pale Senyè BONDYE a: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">30:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 24:7">II Wa 24:7</ref></char></note>‘Gade byen, Mwen kont Farawon, wa Égypte la, e Mwen va kase bra li, ni sa ki gen fòs la ni sa ki kase deja a. Epi Mwen va fè nepe a tonbe kite men li. <verse eid="EZK 30:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 30:23"/>Mwen va gaye Ejipsyen yo pami nasyon yo e dispèse yo pami peyi yo. <verse eid="EZK 30:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 30:24"/>Paske Mwen va ranfòse men a wa Babylone nan, e mete nepe Mwen nan men l. Men Mwen va kase bra a Farawon, pou li ka vin plenyen nan gòj devan wa Babylone nan, ak plent a yon nonm ki blese jis a lamò. <verse eid="EZK 30:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 30:25"/>Konsa, Mwen va ranfòse bra a wa Babylone nan, men bra a Farawon yo va tonbe. Nan lè sa a, yo va konnen ke Mwen se SENYÈ a, lè M mete nepe M nan men a wa Babylone nan, e lè li <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">30:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 8:18">Jos 8:18</ref></char></note>lonje li kont peyi Égypte la. <verse eid="EZK 30:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 30:26"/>Lè Mwen gaye Ejipsyen yo pami nasyon yo, e dispèse yo pami peyi yo, alò, yo va konnen ke Mwen se SENYÈ a.’”<verse eid="EZK 30:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 30"/>
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="EZK 31"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 31:1"/>Nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 52:5-6">Jr 52:5-6</ref></char></note>onzyèm ane, nan twazyèm mwa, nan premye nan mwa a, pawòl SENYÈ a te vin kote mwen. Li te di: <verse eid="EZK 31:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 31:2"/>“Fis a lòm, pale a Farawon, wa Égypte la, ak gwo foul lame li yo:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 31:2">‘Ak kilès ou sanble nan grandè ou?<verse eid="EZK 31:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 31:3"/>Gade byen, Assyrie te yon pye <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 10:33-34">És 10:33-34</ref></char></note>sèd nan Liban.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 31:3">Branch li yo te bèl nan lonbraj forè a, e byen wo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 31:3">Tèt li te rive pami nwaj yo.<verse eid="EZK 31:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 31:4"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">31:4 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 17:5-8">Éz 17:5-8</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Dlo te fè l grandi, pwofondè te fè li wo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 31:4">Ak rivyè li yo, li te tout tan ap vin elaji lizyè li toupatou.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 31:4">Li te voye kanal li yo nan tout pyebwa chan yo.<verse eid="EZK 31:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 31:5"/>Akoz sa, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 4:11">Dan 4:11</ref></char></note>wotè li te piwo ke tout pyebwa chan yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 31:5">e branch li yo te vin anpil e byen long</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 31:5">akoz anpil dlo ki te fè l gaye yo.<verse eid="EZK 31:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 31:6"/>Tout <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 17:23">Éz 17:23</ref></char></note>zwazo syèl yo te fè nich nan branch li yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 31:6">Anba branch sila yo, tout bèt chan yo te vin fè pitit.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 31:6">Tout gran nasyon yo te vin rete anba lonbraj li.<verse eid="EZK 31:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 31:7"/>Konsa, li te bèl nan grandè li, nan longè branch li yo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 31:7">paske rasin li te lonje rive kote anpil dlo.<verse eid="EZK 31:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 31:8"/>Pye sèd nan jaden <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 2:8-9">Jen 2:8-9</ref></char></note>Bondye yo pa t ka egal ak li.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 31:8">Pye sipre yo pa t ka gen branch tankou l,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 31:8">ni pa t gen lòt bwa ki konpare ak branch li yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 31:8">Menm bwa pen an pa t gen branch kon li.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 31:8">Pa t gen pyebwa nan jaden Bondye yo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 31:8">ki ta ka parèy li nan bèlte.<verse eid="EZK 31:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 31:9"/>Mwen te fè l bèl ak fòs kantite branch li yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 31:9">e tout pyebwa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 2:8-9">Jen 2:8-9</ref></char></note>Éden yo te jalou devan l.’<verse eid="EZK 31:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 31:10"/>“Akoz sa, pale Senyè BONDYE a: ‘Akoz li byenwo nan wotè l, te mete tèt li rive pami nwaj yo, e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 32:25">II Kwo 32:25</ref></char></note>kè l te awogan nan wotè li, <verse eid="EZK 31:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 31:11"/>pou sa, Mwen va livre li nan men a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 30:10-11">Éz 30:10-11</ref></char></note>pi pwisan an a nasyon yo. Li va regle sa nèt. Selon mechanste li, konsa Mwen te chase li. <verse eid="EZK 31:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 31:12"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 7:21">Éz 7:21</ref></char></note>Etranje yo, pi pwisan a nasyon yo, te koupe li a tè e te kite li. Sou mòn yo e nan tout vale yo, branch li yo te vin tonbe, e gwo branch li yo te vin kase nan tout ravin peyi yo. Konsa, tout pèp sou latè yo te desann kite lonbraj li e te menm kite li. <verse eid="EZK 31:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 31:13"/>Nan gwo dega li yo, tout <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 18:6">És 18:6</ref></char></note>zwazo syèl yo va vin demere e tout bèt chan yo va sou branch pa l ki tonbe, <verse eid="EZK 31:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 31:14"/>pou tout pyebwa akote dlo yo pa ka vin leve tèt yo wo nan wotè yo. Pwisan pa yo p ap mete tèt yo pami nwaj yo, menm sa yo akote sous dlo yo pa ka kanpe dwat nan wotè yo. Paske yo tout te livre a lanmò, pou rive <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 16:30-33">Nonb 16:30-33</ref></char></note>anba tè pami fis a lòm yo, ak sila ki desann nan twou fòs yo.’<verse eid="EZK 31:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 31:15"/>“Konsa pale Senyè BONDYE a: ‘Nan jou ke li te desann nan sejou mò yo, Mwen te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 32:7">Éz 32:7</ref></char></note>koze lamantasyon. Mwen te fèmen pwofondè a sou li epi te bouche rivyè li yo. Epi anpil dlo li yo Mwen te vin bouche nèt. Mwen te fè Liban kriye ak gwo doulè pou li e tout pyebwa nan chan yo te vin fennen akoz li. <verse eid="EZK 31:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 31:16"/>Mwen te fè tout nasyon yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 26:15">Éz 26:15</ref></char></note>tranble nan son a chit li a, lè M t ap fè l desann nan sejou mò yo ak sila ki desann nan twou fòs yo. Tout pyebwa byen wouze Liban yo, pi byen chwazi ak pi meyè a Liban yo, te vin rekonfòte anba tè. <verse eid="EZK 31:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 31:17"/>Yo menm tou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 9:17">Sòm 9:17</ref></char></note>te desann avè l nan sejou mò yo akote sila ki te touye pa nepe yo. Epi sila ki te fòs li yo, te rete anba lonbraj li pami nasyon yo.<verse eid="EZK 31:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 31:18"/>“‘A kilès nan pyebwa Éden yo ou egal konsa nan glwa ak grandè? Malgre sa, ou va vin desann ak pyebwa Éden yo jis rive anba tè. Ou va vin kouche nan mitan ensikonsi yo, avèk sila ki te touye pa nepe yo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EZK 31:18">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">31:18 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 52:7">Sòm 52:7</ref>
      </char>
    </note>“‘Se konsa Farawon va ye ak tout gwo foul lame li yo!” deklare Senyè BONDYE a.”<verse eid="EZK 31:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 31"/>
  <chapter number="32" style="c" sid="EZK 32"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 32:1"/>Nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 30:20">Éz 30:20</ref></char></note>douzyèm ane, nan douzyèm mwa, nan premye nan mwa a, “pawòl SENYÈ a te vin kote mwen. Li te di: <verse eid="EZK 32:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 32:2"/>‘Fis a lòm, leve fè lamantasyon sou Farawon, wa Égypte la. Di li:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 32:2">“Ou te konpare tèt ou ak yon jenn <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 4:7">Jr 4:7</ref></char></note>lyon nasyon yo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 32:2">sepandan, ou tankou yon gwo bèt sovaj lanmè a.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 32:2">Ou pete vin parèt nan rivyè ou yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 32:2">Ou te fè labou vin leve ak pye ou yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 32:2">e te fè larivyè pa yo vin sal nèt.”<verse eid="EZK 32:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 32:3"/>Konsa pale Senyè BONDYE a:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 32:3">“Koulye a, Mwen va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 12:13">Éz 12:13</ref></char></note>ouvri filè Mwen sou ou</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 32:3">avèk konpanyen a anpil moun,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 32:3">e nan filè Mwen an, yo va fè ou leve.<verse eid="EZK 32:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 32:4"/>Mwen va kite ou sou latè.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 32:4">Mwen va jete ou sou chan ouvri,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 32:4">epi Mwen va fè tout <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 18:6">És 18:6</ref></char></note>zwazo syèl yo poze sou ou.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 32:4">Mwen va fè tout bèt sou latè yo vin satisfè sou ou.<verse eid="EZK 32:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 32:5"/>Mwen va lage chè ou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 31:12">Éz 31:12</ref></char></note>sou mòn yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 32:5">e Mwen va plen vale yo ak kadav ou yo.<verse eid="EZK 32:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 32:6"/>Anplis, Mwen va fè tè a bwè san ou.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 32:6">L ap rive jis nan mòn yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 32:6">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">32:6 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 7:17">Egz 7:17</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Kous dlo yo va vin plen ak ou.<verse eid="EZK 32:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 32:7"/>Konsa, lè M <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 18:5-6">Job 18:5-6</ref></char></note>etenn ou, Mwen va kouvri syèl yo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 32:7">e fè zetwal yo fènwa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 32:7">Mwen va kouvri solèy la ak yon nwaj,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 32:7">e lalin nan p ap bay limyè.<verse eid="EZK 32:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 32:8"/>Tout <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 1:14">Jen 1:14</ref></char></note>limyè k ap briye nan syèl la,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 32:8">Mwen va fè yo vin nwa sou ou, e</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 32:8">va mete fènwa sou peyi ou a,”</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 32:8">deklare Senyè BONDYE a.<verse eid="EZK 32:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 32:9"/>“Anplis, Mwen va twouble kè a anpil nasyon,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 32:9">lè Mwen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 15:14-16">Egz 15:14-16</ref></char></note>mennen destriksyon ou pami nasyon yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 32:9">jis rive nan peyi ke ou pa t janm konnen.<verse eid="EZK 32:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 32:10"/>Mwen va fè anpil pèp vin <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 27:35">Éz 27:35</ref></char></note>etone sezi de ou,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 32:10">e wa yo va tèlman gen gwo laperèz pou ou,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 32:10">lè M fè nepe M parèt devan yo akoz ou menm.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 32:10">Yo va tranble tout tan,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 32:10">chak moun pou pwòp lavi li,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 32:10">nan jou ke ou tonbe a.”<verse eid="EZK 32:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 32:11"/>Paske konsa pale Senyè BONDYE a:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 32:11">“Nepe a wa Babylone nan va vini sou ou.<verse eid="EZK 32:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 32:12"/>Pa nepe a pwisan yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 32:12">Mwen va fè gwo foul lame ou yo tonbe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 32:12">Yo tout se <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 28:7">Éz 28:7</ref></char></note>chèf sovaj pami nasyon yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 32:12">Yo va devaste ògèy Égypte la,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 32:12">e tout gwo foul lame li yo va detwi.<verse eid="EZK 32:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 32:13"/>Anplis, Mwen va detwi tout bèt</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 32:13">ki rete bò kote anpil dlo li yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 32:13">Pye moun p ap gaye labou ankò,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 32:13">ni zago a bèt p ap gaye labou ankò.<verse eid="EZK 32:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 32:14"/>Konsa, Mwen va fè dlo yo vin kalm</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 32:14">e fè rivyè yo vin kouri kon lwil,”</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 32:14">deklare Senyè BONDYE a.<verse eid="EZK 32:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 32:15"/>“Lè Mwen fè peyi Égypte vin yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 107:33-34">Sòm 107:33-34</ref></char></note>dezolasyon,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 32:15">e peyi a vin pèdi tout sa ki te fè l plen yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 32:15">lè M frape tout sila ki rete ladann yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 32:15">alò, yo va konnen ke Mwen se SENYÈ a.<verse eid="EZK 32:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 32:16"/>“‘“Sa se yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 1:17">II Sam 1:17</ref></char></note>lamantasyon. Ak li menm, y ap fè dèy. Fi a nasyon yo va chante li. Sou Égypte ak sou tout gwo foul lame li yo, yo va chante li”, deklare Senyè BONDYE a.’”<verse eid="EZK 32:16"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 32:17"/>Nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 31:1">Éz 31:1</ref></char></note>douzyèm ane, nan kenz nan mwa a, pawòl SENYÈ a te vin kote mwen. Li te di: <verse eid="EZK 32:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 32:18"/>“Fis a lòm, rele anmwey pou gwo foul a Égypte yo. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 1:10">Jr 1:10</ref></char></note>Desann yo menm ak fi a nasyon pwisan yo, jis rive nan pwofondè tè a, ansanm avèk sila ki desann nan twou fòs yo. <verse eid="EZK 32:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 32:19"/>‘Se ki moun ou depase nan bèlte? Desann, fè kabann ou ak <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 9:25-26">Jr 9:25-26</ref></char></note>ensikonsi yo.’ <verse eid="EZK 32:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 32:20"/>Yo va tonbe nan mitan sila ki touye pa nepe yo. Fi a vin livre pou nepe a. Fè l <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 28:3">Sòm 28:3</ref></char></note>rale soti ak tout gwo foul li yo. <verse eid="EZK 32:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 32:21"/>Pi gran pami pwisan yo va pale ak li nan mitan sejou mò yo ansanm ak sila ki t ap ede li yo. ‘Yo fin desann, yo kouche san fè mouvman, ensikonsi yo, touye pa nepe yo.’<verse eid="EZK 32:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 32:22"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">32:22 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 27:23">Éz 27:23</ref>
      </char>
    </note>“Assyrie, li la, ak tout konpanyen li yo. Tonbo li yo antoure li. Yo tout touye, tonbe pa nepe, <verse eid="EZK 32:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 32:23"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 14:15">És 14:15</ref></char></note>tonbo a sila ki plase nan pati pi izole twou fòs la. Epi konpanyen li yo antoure tonbo li. Yo tout te touye, tonbe akoz nepe a; tout sila ki te fè gwo laperèz gaye nan peyi moun vivan yo.<verse eid="EZK 32:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 32:24"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">32:24 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 10:22">Jen 10:22</ref>
      </char>
    </note>“Élam la ak tout gwo foul li yo ki antoure tonbo li a. Yo tout mouri, tonbe pa nepe, e te desann ensikonsi nan pati piba latè yo; sila ki te kreye gwo laperèz nan tout peyi moun vivan yo, e te pote wont yo, ansanm avèk sila ki te desann nan twou fòs yo. <verse eid="EZK 32:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 32:25"/>Yo fè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 139:8">Sòm 139:8</ref></char></note>kabann Elam nan pami sila ki touye ak tout gwo foul li yo. Tonbo yo antoure li. Yo tout se ensikonsi, touye pa nepe. Paske se gwo laperèz yo te kreye nan peyi moun vivan yo, e konsa,yo te pote wont yo avèk sila ki desann nan twou fòs yo. Yo rive nan mitan sila ki te touye yo.<verse eid="EZK 32:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 32:26"/>“Méschec <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 10:2">Jen 10:2</ref></char></note>Tubal, ak tout gwo foul yo la. Tonbo yo antoure yo. Yo tout se ensikonsi, touye pa nepe. Paske se gwo laperèz yo te kreye nan peyi moun vivan yo. <verse eid="EZK 32:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZK 32:27"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 14:18-19">És 14:18-19</ref></char></note>Ni yo pa p kouche akote chèf pwisan a ensikonsi yo, sila ki te desann nan sejou mò yo ak zam lagè yo, ak nepe yo byen plase anba tèt yo. Men inikite yo te rete menm sou zo yo; sepandan, se pi pwisan yo te teworize nan peyi moun vivan yo.<verse eid="EZK 32:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZK 32:28"/>“Men nan mitan ensikonsi a, ou va vin kraze, e kouche avèk sila ki te touye pa nepe yo.<verse eid="EZK 32:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EZK 32:29"/>“La tou, gen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 34:5-15">És 34:5-15</ref></char></note>Édom, wa li ak tout prens li yo, ki malgre tout pwisans yo, vin kouche avèk sila ki te touye pa nepe yo. Yo va kouche avèk ensikonsi yo e avèk sila ki desann nan twou fòs yo.<verse eid="EZK 32:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="EZK 32:30"/>“La tou, gen chèf <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 1:15">Jr 1:15</ref></char></note>lanò yo, yo tout ak tout Sidonyen yo. Malgre tout gwo laperèz yo te kreye akoz pwisans yo, nan wont, yo te desann avèk sila ki te touye yo. Konsa, yo te kouche ensikonsi avèk sila ki te touye pa nepe yo, e te pote gwo wont yo avèk lòt yo ki desann nan twou fòs yo.<verse eid="EZK 32:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="EZK 32:31"/>“Sa yo, Farawon va wè e li va twouve <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 14:22">Éz 14:22</ref></char></note>konsolasyon pou tout gwo foul li yo ki te touye pa nepe yo, menm Farawon ak tout lame li a,” deklare Senyè BONDYE a. <verse eid="EZK 32:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EZK 32:32"/>Sepandan, Mwen te mete gwo laperèz li nan peyi moun vivan yo. Malgre sa, li va kouche ak ensikonsi yo, avèk sila ki te touye pa nepe yo, menm Farawon ak tout gwo lame li yo”, deklare Senyè BONDYE a.<verse eid="EZK 32:32"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 32"/>
  <chapter number="33" style="c" sid="EZK 33"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 33:1"/>Konsa, pawòl SENYÈ a te rive kote mwen. Li te di: <verse eid="EZK 33:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 33:2"/>“Fis a lòm, pale a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 3:11">Éz 3:11</ref></char></note>fis a pèp ou yo pou di yo: ‘Si Mwen mennen nepe sou yon peyi, e pèp peyi a pran yon nonm soti pami yo pou fè li gadyen yo, <verse eid="EZK 33:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 33:3"/>epi lè li wè nepe a ap vini sou peyi a, li <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 4:18-20">Né 4:18-20</ref></char></note>soufle sou twonpèt pou avèti moun yo, <verse eid="EZK 33:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 33:4"/>men sila ki tande son twonpèt la <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 25:16">II Kwo 25:16</ref></char></note>pa okipe l, e nepe a rive pran l, mennen l ale, san li ap tonbe sou pwòp tèt li. <verse eid="EZK 33:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 33:5"/>Li te tande son twonpèt la men li pa t okipe l. San li va sou tèt li. Men si li te okipe sa a, li t ap sove lavi li. <verse eid="EZK 33:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 33:6"/>Men si gadyen an wè nepe a ap vini, e li pa sonnen twonpèt la, moun yo pa avèti, e nepe a rive retire nenpòt moun pami yo, moun nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 18:20-24">Éz 18:20-24</ref></char></note>soti nan inikite li. Men san li, Mwen va egzije sa a nan men gadyen an.’<verse eid="EZK 33:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 33:7"/>“Alò, pou ou menm, fis a lòm, Mwen te chwazi ou kon gadyen pou lakay Israël. Konsa, ou va tande yon mesaj soti nan bouch Mwen pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 1:17">Jr 1:17</ref></char></note>avèti yo pou Mwen. <verse eid="EZK 33:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 33:8"/>Lè M di a mechan an: ‘O nonm mechan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 3:11">És 3:11</ref></char></note>anverite ou va mouri’, men ou pa pale pou avèti e detounen mechan an pou l ka kite chemen mechan li an, nonm mechan sa a va mouri nan inikite li, men san li, Mwen va egzije sa nan men ou. <verse eid="EZK 33:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 33:9"/>Men si ou, bò kote pa ou, ou avèti yon nonm mechan pou vire kite chemen li, e li <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 13:40-46">Trav 13:40-46</ref></char></note>pa vire kite chemen li an, li va mouri nan inikite li, men ou delivre lavi ou.<verse eid="EZK 33:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 33:10"/>“Alò, pou ou, fis a lòm, pale ak lakay Israël: ‘Pale konsa e di: “Anverite, transgresyon nou yo ak peche nou yo, sou nou, e nou ap <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 26:39">Lev 26:39</ref></char></note>pouri ladan yo. Donk kòman nou ka viv?”’ <verse eid="EZK 33:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 33:11"/>Pale ak yo: ‘“Jan Mwen viv la,” deklare Senyè BONDYE a: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 18:23-32">Éz 18:23-32</ref></char></note>“Mwen pa pran plezi nan lanmò a mechan yo, men pito pou mechan an vire kite chemen li an pou li viv. Retounen, retounen kite chemen mechan nou yo! Poukisa konsa ou ta mouri, O lakay Israël?”’<verse eid="EZK 33:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 33:12"/>“Epi ou menm, fis a lòm, di a sitwayen parèy ou yo: ‘Ladwati a yon nonm dwat p ap ka delivre li nan jou transgresyon li. E mechanste a mechan an, li <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 7:14">II Kwo 7:14</ref></char></note>p ap tonbe akoz li, si li vire kite mechanste a. Ni yon nonm dwati p ap ka viv sou ladwati li nan jou ke li vin fè peche a.’ <verse eid="EZK 33:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 33:13"/>Lè Mwen di a nonm dwat la ke, anverite, li va viv la, e li tèlman kwè nan ladwati li pou li komèt inikite, okenn nan zèv dwat li yo p ap vin sonje; men nan menm inikite sa ke li te fè a, li va mouri. <verse eid="EZK 33:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 33:14"/>Men lè Mwen di a mechan an: “Anverite, ou va mouri,” e li <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 55:7">És 55:7</ref></char></note>vire kite peche li, pou vin pratike lajistis ak ladwati, <verse eid="EZK 33:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 33:15"/>si yon nonm mechan vin remèt sa li te pwomèt pou bay, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 22:1-4">Egz 22:1-4</ref></char></note>remèt sa li te pran nan vòlè, mache nan règleman ki bay lavi san ke li pa komèt inikite, li va anverite viv. Li p ap mouri. <verse eid="EZK 33:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 33:16"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 1:18">És 1:18</ref></char></note>Okenn nan peche ke li te komèt yo p ap vin sonje kont li. Li pratike lajistis ak ladwati. Anverite, li va viv.<verse eid="EZK 33:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 33:17"/>“‘Malgre sa, sitwayen parèy ou yo di: “Chemen Senyè a pa dwat,” men se pwòp chemen pa yo ki pa dwat la. <verse eid="EZK 33:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 33:18"/>Lè moun ladwati a kite ladwati pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 3:20">Éz 3:20</ref></char></note>komèt inikite, alò, li va mouri ladann. <verse eid="EZK 33:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 33:19"/>Men lè mechan an vire kite mechanste li an pou vin pratike lajistis ak ladwati, li va viv ladan yo. <verse eid="EZK 33:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 33:20"/>Men nou di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 18:25">Éz 18:25</ref></char></note>“Chemen SENYÈ a pa jis”. O lakay Israël, Mwen va jije nou chak selon chemen nou.’”<verse eid="EZK 33:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 33:21"/>Alò, nan douzyèm ane egzil nou an, nan senkyèm jou nan dizyèm mwa a, yon moun ki te chape Jérusalem te vin kote mwen. Li te di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 25:10">II Wa 25:10</ref></char></note>“Yo fin pran vil la.” <verse eid="EZK 33:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 33:22"/>Alò, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 1:3">Éz 1:3</ref></char></note>men SENYÈ a te sou mwen pandan nwit lan avan moun chape a te vin parèt la. Epi konsa, Li te louvri bouch mwen avan lè li te vin kote mwen nan maten an. Donk, bouch mwen te louvri e mwen pa t ankò bèbè.<verse eid="EZK 33:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 33:23"/>Epi pawòl SENYÈ a te vin kote mwen. Li te di: <verse eid="EZK 33:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 33:24"/>“Fis a lòm, sila ki<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 39:10">Jr 39:10</ref></char></note>rete kote dezole sa yo nan peyi Israël ap di: ‘Abraham se te yon sèl, malgre sa, li te posede tè a. Men nou menm anpil. Peyi a te donnen a nou.’ <verse eid="EZK 33:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 33:25"/>Pou sa, pale yo: ‘Konsa pale Senyè BONDYE a: “Nou manje vyann ak <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 17:10-14">Lev 17:10-14</ref></char></note>san ladann; nou leve zye nou vè zidòl yo pandan n ap vèse san. Èske konsa, nou ta dwe vin posede peyi a? <verse eid="EZK 33:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 33:26"/>Nou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MIC 2:1-2">Mi 2:1-2</ref></char></note>mete konfyans nou nan nepe nou, nou komèt zak abominab, e nou tout souye madanm a vwazen nou. Èske konsa, nou ta dwe posede peyi a?”’<verse eid="EZK 33:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZK 33:27"/>“Konsa ou va pale ak yo: ‘Konsa pale Senyè BONDYE a: “Jan Mwen viv la, anverite, sila ki nan savann yo va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 15:2-3">Jr 15:2-3</ref></char></note>tonbe pa nepe. Nenpòt moun ki nan chan ouvri a, Mwen va bay li a bèt sovaj pou devore li, e sila ki nan sitadèl ak nan kav yo, yo va mouri akoz ensèk ak gwo maladi. <verse eid="EZK 33:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZK 33:28"/>Mwen va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 5:14">Éz 5:14</ref></char></note>fè tè a vin dezole jis pou l etonnen moun. Ògèy a pouvwa li a va sispann. Mòn Israël yo va vin dezole jiskaske pèsòn p ap travèse yo. <verse eid="EZK 33:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EZK 33:29"/>Konsa yo va konnen ke Mwen se SENYÈ a, lè M fè peyi a vin yon dezolasyon ak yon dezè akoz tout zak abominab ke yo te komèt yo.”’<verse eid="EZK 33:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="EZK 33:30"/>“Men pou ou menm, fis a lòm, sitwayen parèy ou yo ap pale de ou. Akote miray yo ak nan pòtay kay yo, y ap pale youn a lòt, yo chak a frè yo pou di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 29:13">És 29:13</ref></char></note>‘Vini koulye a pou tande mesaj sila ki sòti nan SENYÈ a.’ <verse eid="EZK 33:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EZK 33:31"/>Yo vin kote ou jan moun konn vini. Yo chita devan ou tankou pèp Mwen an pou yo tande pawòl ou. Men yo pa fè yo. Paske nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 78:36-37">Sòm 78:36-37</ref></char></note>bouch, yo renmen, men kè yo ap kouri dèyè pwòp benifis pa yo. <verse eid="EZK 33:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EZK 33:32"/>Gade byen, ou vin pou yo tankou yon chan sansyèl ki chante pa yon moun ak yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 6:20">Mc 6:20</ref></char></note>bèl vwa, byen jwe sou enstriman. Paske yo tande pawòl ou yo, men yo pa pratike yo.<verse eid="EZK 33:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="EZK 33:33"/>“Pou sa, lè a rive—gade byen, li va rive—alò, yo va konnen ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 28:9">Jr 28:9</ref></char></note>yon pwofèt te la nan mitan yo.”<verse eid="EZK 33:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 33"/>
  <chapter number="34" style="c" sid="EZK 34"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 34:1"/>Pawòl SENYÈ a te vin kote mwen. Li te di: <verse eid="EZK 34:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 34:2"/>“Fis a lòm, pwofetize kont <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 2:8">Jr 2:8</ref></char></note>bèje Israël yo. Pwofetize e di a bèje sila yo: ‘Konsa pale Senyè BONDYE a: “Malè, bèje Israël yo k ap nouri pwòp tèt yo! Èske bèje yo pa dwe bay manje a bann mouton an? <verse eid="EZK 34:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 34:3"/>Nou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 11:16">Za 11:16</ref></char></note>manje grès e fè abiman ak len an. Nou kòche mouton gra a, san bay manje a bann mouton an. <verse eid="EZK 34:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 34:4"/>Sila ki manke lasante yo, nou pa t ranfòse yo. Sa ki malad yo, nou pa t geri yo. Sa ki brize yo nou pa t panse yo. Sa ki gaye yo, nou pa t mennen yo retounen, ni nou pa t chache sa ki pèdi yo. Men ak opresyon e ak severite, nou te domine sou yo. <verse eid="EZK 34:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 34:5"/>Yo te gaye akoz yo te manke yon bèje. Yo te devni <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 34:8-28">Éz 34:8-28</ref></char></note>manje pou tout bèt sovaj nan chan a, e yo te vin gaye nèt. <verse eid="EZK 34:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 34:6"/>Bann mouton Mwen an te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 40:11-12">Jr 40:11-12</ref></char></note>mache egare nan tout mòn yo, ak sou tout wo kolin yo. Bann mouton Mwen an te gaye sou tout sifas tè a, e pa t gen moun pou ale jwenn yo, ni chache yo.”<verse eid="EZK 34:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 34:7"/>“‘Pou sa, nou menm ki bèje yo, tande pawòl SENYÈ a: <verse eid="EZK 34:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 34:8"/>“Jan Mwen viv la,” deklare Senyè BONDYE a: “anverite, akoz bann mouton Mwen an te vin <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 20:29">Trav 20:29</ref></char></note>viktim, bann mouton Mwen an te menm vin manje pa tout bèt chan yo, akoz yo te manke yon bèje. Bèje Mwen yo pa t chache bann mouton Mwen an, men bèje Mwen yo te nouri pwòp tèt pa yo. Konsa, yo pa t bay manje a bann mouton Mwen an. <verse eid="EZK 34:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 34:9"/>Akoz sa, nou menm ki bèje yo, tande pawòl SENYÈ a:” <verse eid="EZK 34:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 34:10"/>Konsa pale Senyè BONDYE a: “Gade byen, Mwen kont bèje yo, Mwen va egzije mouton Mwen yo nan men yo, e fè yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 2:29-30">I Sam 2:29-30</ref></char></note>sispann bay manje a mouton yo. Konsa bèje yo p ap bay pwòp tèt yo manje ankò, men Mwen va delivre bann mouton Mwen an soti nan bouch yo, pou yo ka pa sèvi kon manje pou yo ankò.”<verse eid="EZK 34:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 34:11"/>“‘Paske konsa pale Senyè BONDYE a: “Gade byen, Mwen va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 11:17">Éz 11:17</ref></char></note>chache mouton Mwen yo pou kont Mwen, e Mwen va chache jwenn yo. <verse eid="EZK 34:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 34:12"/>Kon yon bèje konn pran swen bann mouton li nan jou ke li pami mouton ki gaye yo, konsa Mwen va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 40:11">És 40:11</ref></char></note>pran swen mouton Mwen yo. Epi Mwen va delivre yo soti de tout peyi ke yo te gaye yo nan jou gwo nwaj ki te plen tristès la. <verse eid="EZK 34:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 34:13"/>Mwen va mennen yo sòti pami pèp yo, rasanble yo soti nan peyi yo, e mennen yo nan pwòp peyi yo. Konsa, Mwen va bay yo manje sou mòn Israël yo, akote <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 30:25">És 30:25</ref></char></note>sous dlo yo ak tout kote ki abite nan peyi a. <verse eid="EZK 34:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 34:14"/>Mwen va bay yo manje nan yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 23:2">Sòm 23:2</ref></char></note>bon patiraj e pak kote yo manje a, va sou wotè mòn Israël yo. Nan yon bon pak yo va kouche. Yo va manje sou patiraj rich nan mòn Israël yo. <verse eid="EZK 34:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 34:15"/>Mwen va bay manje a bann mouton pa M nan e Mwen va mennen yo nan repo,” deklare Senyè BONDYE a. <verse eid="EZK 34:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 34:16"/>“Mwen va chache sila ki pèdi yo, mennen fè retounen sila ki gaye yo, panse sila ki blese yo, e ranfòse sa ki te malad. Men sila ki <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 10:16">És 10:16</ref></char></note>gra ak gwo fòs yo, Mwen va detwi yo. Mwen va bay yo manje nan jistis.”’<verse eid="EZK 34:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 34:17"/>“Epi pou nou menm, bann Mwen an, konsa pale Senyè BONDYE a: ‘Gade byen, Mwen va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 20:38">Éz 20:38</ref></char></note>jije antre yon mouton ak yon lòt, antre belye ak mal kabrit. <verse eid="EZK 34:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 34:18"/>Èske se yon bagay ki <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 16:9-13">Nonb 16:9-13</ref></char></note>twò piti pou nou, pou nou ta manje nan bon patiraj, pou nou oblije foule anba pye nou rès patiraj nou yo? Oswa pou ou ta bwè nan dlo ki pwòp yo, pou ou oblije foule tout lòt yo ak pye nou? <verse eid="EZK 34:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 34:19"/>Pou bann mouton Mwen yo, oblije manje sa ke ou foule ak pye, e bwè sa ke ou fè vin sal ak pye ou!’<verse eid="EZK 34:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 34:20"/>“Akoz sa, konsa pale Senyè BONDYE a a yo menm: ‘Gade byen, Mwen menm, Mwen va fè jijman antre mouton gra ak mouton mèg yo. <verse eid="EZK 34:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 34:21"/>Akoz nou pouse ak bò kote e ak zepòl la, e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 33:17">Det 33:17</ref></char></note>lanse kòn sou tout sila ki fèb yo, jiskaske nou fin gaye yo a letranje, <verse eid="EZK 34:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 34:22"/>pou sa, Mwen va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 72:12-14">Sòm 72:12-14</ref></char></note>delivre bann mouton Mwen an e yo p ap viktim ankò. Epi Mwen va jije antre yon mouton ak yon lòt. <verse eid="EZK 34:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 34:23"/>Konsa, Mwen va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 7:17">Rev 7:17</ref></char></note>plase sou yo yon sèl bèje, sèvitè Mwen an, David e li va bay yo manje. Li va bay yo manje li menm e li va vin bèje yo. <verse eid="EZK 34:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 34:24"/>Epi Mwen menm, SENYÈ a, va vin Bondye yo, e sèvitè Mwen an, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 55:3">És 55:3</ref></char></note>David, va prens pami yo. Mwen menm, SENYÈ a, fin pale.<verse eid="EZK 34:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 34:25"/>“‘Mwen va fè yon akò lapè ak yo e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 5:22-23">Job 5:22-23</ref></char></note>retire bèt sovaj sou peyi a pou yo ka viv ansekirite nan dezè a, e dòmi byen nan forè a. <verse eid="EZK 34:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 34:26"/>Mwen va fè yo menm ak tout kote ki antoure kolin Mwen yo vin yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 12:2">Jen 12:2</ref></char></note>benediksyon. Epi Mwen va fè bèl lapli tonbe, e lapli sa a va yon lapli ki pote benediksyon. <verse eid="EZK 34:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZK 34:27"/>Anplis, pyebwa nan chan yo va donnen fwi yo. Latè a va donnen pwodwi li, e yo va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 38:8-11">Éz 38:8-11</ref></char></note>ansekirite nan peyi yo. Konsa, yo va konnen ke Mwen se SENYÈ a, lè M fin kase fè jouk yo a, e delivre yo soti nan men a sila ki te fè yo esklav yo. <verse eid="EZK 34:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZK 34:28"/>Yo p ap viktim a nasyon yo ankò, e bèt latè yo p ap devore yo ankò. Men yo va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 30:10">Jr 30:10</ref></char></note>viv ansekirite e pèsòn p ap fè yo pè. <verse eid="EZK 34:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EZK 34:29"/>Mwen va etabli pou yo yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 4:2">És 4:2</ref></char></note>plantasyon ki plen rekonesans. Yo p ap viktim a gwo grangou ankò, ni yo p ap sipòte ensilt a nasyon yo ankò. <verse eid="EZK 34:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EZK 34:30"/>Nan lè sa a, yo va konnen ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 46:7-11">Sòm 46:7-11</ref></char></note>Mwen menm, SENYÈ a, Bondye pa yo avèk yo e ke yo menm, lakay Israël la, se pèp Mwen, deklare Senyè BONDYE a. <verse eid="EZK 34:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EZK 34:31"/>Pou nou menm, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 78:52">Sòm 78:52</ref></char></note>mouton Mwen yo, mouton a patiraj pa Mwen yo, nou se lòm e Mwen se Bondye nou,’ deklare Senyè BONDYE a.”<verse eid="EZK 34:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 34"/>
  <chapter number="35" style="c" sid="EZK 35"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 35:1"/>Anplis, pawòl SENYÈ a te vin kote Mwen. Li te di: <verse eid="EZK 35:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 35:2"/>“Fis a lòm, mete figi ou kont <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 36:8">Jen 36:8</ref></char></note>Mòn Séir e pwofetize kont li. <verse eid="EZK 35:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 35:3"/>Di li:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 35:3">‘Konsa pale Senyè BONDYE a:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 35:3">“Gade byen, Mwen kont ou, Mòn Séir,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 35:3">Mwen va lonje men M kont ou</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 35:3">pou fè ou vin yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 49:13-18">Jr 49:13-18</ref></char></note>dezolasyon ak yon dezè.<verse eid="EZK 35:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 35:4"/>Mwen va fè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 6:6">Éz 6:6</ref></char></note>devaste vil ou yo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 35:4">e ou va vin Yon dezolasyon.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 35:4">Konsa, ou va konnen ke Mwen se SENYÈ a.<verse eid="EZK 35:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 35:5"/>“‘“Paske ou te gen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 137:7">Sòm 137:7</ref></char></note>rayisman san rete, e ou te livre fis Israël yo anba pouvwa nepe a nan lè malè yo, nan lè gwo pinisyon lafen an. <verse eid="EZK 35:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 35:6"/>Akoz sa, jan Mwen viv la”, deklare Senyè BONDYE a: “Mwen va livre ou a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 63:2-6">És 63:2-6</ref></char></note>san vèse, san vèse va swiv ou. Akoz ou pa t rayi san vèse, pou sa, san vèse va swiv ou. <verse eid="EZK 35:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 35:7"/>Mwen va fè Mòn Séir vin yon dezè ak yon kote dezole. Mwen va dekoupe retire nèt sou li sila k ap pase antre retou ladann li. <verse eid="EZK 35:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 35:8"/>Mwen va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 34:5-6">És 34:5-6</ref></char></note>plen mòn li yo ak kadav li yo. Sou kolin ou yo, nan vale ou yo ak nan tout ravin ou yo, sila ki mouri pa nepe yo va tonbe. <verse eid="EZK 35:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 35:9"/>Mwen va fè ou vin yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 49:13">Jr 49:13</ref></char></note>dezolasyon jis pou tout tan e vil ou yo p ap gen moun menm. Konsa ou va konnen ke Mwen se SENYÈ a.<verse eid="EZK 35:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 35:10"/>“‘“Akoz ou te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 83:4-12">Sòm 83:4-12</ref></char></note>di: ‘ De(2) Nasyon sila yo ak de(2) peyi sa yo va pou mwen e nou va posede yo,’ sepandan, SENYÈ a te la, <verse eid="EZK 35:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 35:11"/>Jan Mwen viv la”, deklare Senyè Bondye a: “Mwen va regle ou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 137:7">Sòm 137:7</ref></char></note>selon kòlè ou ak selon jalouzi ke ou te montre, akoz rayisman ou kont yo. Konsa, Mwen va fè Mwen menm vin rekonèt pami yo lè M jije ou. <verse eid="EZK 35:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 35:12"/>Nan lè sa a, ou va konnen ke Mwen menm, SENYÈ a, te tande tout vye mo ou yo; sa ke ou te pale kont mòn Israël yo lè ou te di: ‘Yo fin dezole nèt. Yo fin <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 50:7">Jr 50:7</ref></char></note>livre nan men nou pou manje nèt.’ <verse eid="EZK 35:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 35:13"/>Konsa, ou te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 10:13-14">És 10:13-14</ref></char></note>pale ak awogans kont Mwen e ou te miltipliye pawòl ou yo kont Mwen. Mwen te tande sa.” <verse eid="EZK 35:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 35:14"/>Konsa pale Senyè BONDYE a: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 44:23">És 44:23</ref></char></note>“Pandan tout tè a ap rejwi, Mwen va fè ou vin yon dezolasyon. <verse eid="EZK 35:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 35:15"/>Jan ou te rejwi sou eritaj lakay Israël akoz li te dezole a, se <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="OBA 1:15">Ab 15</ref></char></note>konsa Mwen va fè ou menm. Ou va vin yon dezolasyon, O Mòn Séir! Ak tout Édom, yo tout ladann. Nan lè sa a, yo va konnen ke Mwen se SENYÈ a.’”<verse eid="EZK 35:15"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 35"/>
  <chapter number="36" style="c" sid="EZK 36"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 36:1"/>Epi ou menm, fis a lòm, pwofetize a mòn Israël yo e di: “O mòn Israël yo, tande pawòl SENYÈ a. <verse eid="EZK 36:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 36:2"/>Konsa pale Senyè BONDYE a: ‘Akoz lènmi an te pale kont nou, “Ah, ah!”, ak <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 32:13">Det 32:13</ref></char></note>“Wo plas yo vin devni posesyon nou,”’ <verse eid="EZK 36:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 36:3"/>akoz sa, pwofetize e di: ‘Konsa pale Senyè Bondye a: “Se ak bon rezon yo te fè nou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 2:15">Jr 2:15</ref></char></note>dezole, e te kraze nou tout kote a, pou nou te vin yon posesyon a rès nasyon yo, epi nou te vin retire nan pawòl ak ti soufle nan zòrèy a pèp la.” <verse eid="EZK 36:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 36:4"/>Akoz sa, O, mòn Israël yo, tande pawòl a Senyè BONDYE a. Konsa pale Senyè BONDYE a mòn yo ak kolin yo, a ravin yo ak vale yo, a vil dezole ki te vin <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 34:8-28">Éz 34:8-28</ref></char></note>viktim ak yon rizib pou rès nasyon ki antoure l yo, <verse eid="EZK 36:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 36:5"/>akoz sa, pale Senyè BONDYE a: “Anverite nan dife a jalouzi Mwen, Mwen te pale kont tout <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 25:9">Jr 25:9</ref></char></note>rès nasyon yo e kont tout Édom, ki te konfiske peyi Mwen an pou yo menm tankou yon posesyon ak yon kè ki plen ak jwa e yon nanm ki plen ak mepriz, pou yo ta ka sezi chan li yo kon piyaj.”’ <verse eid="EZK 36:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 36:6"/>Akoz sa, pwofetize konsènan peyi Israël la, e di a mòn e a kolin yo, a ravin yo e a vale yo: ‘konsa pale Senyè Bondye a: “Gade byen, Mwen te pale nan jalouzi Mwen ak nan chalè kòlè Mwen, akoz nou te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 74:10">Sòm 74:10</ref></char></note>andire ensilt a nasyon yo.”’ <verse eid="EZK 36:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 36:7"/>Akoz sa, pale Senyè Bondye a: “Mwen te sèmante, ‘Anverite, nasyon ki antoure nou yo va yo menm andire wont pa yo.’<verse eid="EZK 36:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 36:8"/>“‘“Men nou menm, O mòn Israël yo, nou va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 4:2">És 4:2</ref></char></note>lonje fè branch nou yo vin parèt pou pote fwi pou pèp Mwen an, Israël; paske avan anpil tan, y ap vini. <verse eid="EZK 36:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 36:9"/>Paske gade byen, Mwen pou nou, Mwen va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 26:9">Lev 26:9</ref></char></note>vire kote nou, e nou va vin kiltive e plante. <verse eid="EZK 36:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 36:10"/>Mwen va fè moun miltipliye sou nou, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 27:6">És 27:6</ref></char></note>tout lakay Israël la, tout moun ladann. Konsa, vil yo va abite e dezè yo va vin rebati. <verse eid="EZK 36:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 36:11"/>Mwen va miltipliye sou nou, ni moun, ni bèt. Yo va vin ogmante e yo va bay fwi, epi Mwen va fè nou peple teren an jan nou te ye avan an, e Mwen va trete nou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 42:12">Job 42:12</ref></char></note>pi byen ke avan. Konsa, nou va konnen ke Mwen se SENYÈ a. <verse eid="EZK 36:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 36:12"/>Wi, Mwen va fè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 34:13-14">Éz 34:13-14</ref></char></note>mesye yo—pèp Mwen an, Israël— mache sou ou e posede ou, pou ou kapab vin eritaj pa yo pou yo pa janm retire pitit yo nan men yo ankò.”<verse eid="EZK 36:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 36:13"/>“‘Konsa pale Senyè BONDYE a: “Akoz lòt nasyon yo di nou: ‘Ou se yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 13:22">Nonb 13:22</ref></char></note>pèp ki manje moun e ou te fè peye ou pèdi pitit li yo,’ <verse eid="EZK 36:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 36:14"/>Akoz sa, ou p ap manje moun ankò e ou p ap responsab pèt pitit peye ou yo,” deklare Senyè BONDYE a. <verse eid="EZK 36:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 36:15"/>“Mwen p ap kite nou koute ensilt a nasyon yo ankò, ni nou p ap pote mepriz a nasyon yo ankò, ni ou p ap fè nasyon pa w <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 63:13">És 63:13</ref></char></note>vin chite ankò”, deklare Senyè BONDYE a.’”<verse eid="EZK 36:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 36:16"/>Epi pawòl SENYÈ a te rive kote mwen e te di: <verse eid="EZK 36:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 36:17"/>“Fis a lòm, lè lakay Israël t ap viv nan pwòp peyi yo, yo te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 2:7">Jr 2:7</ref></char></note>souye li ak chemen pa yo ak zak yo. Chemen yo devan M pa t pwòp tankou yon fanm nan lè règ li. <verse eid="EZK 36:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 36:18"/>Akoz sa, Mwen te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 34:21-25">II Kwo 34:21-25</ref></char></note>vide chalè kòlè Mwen sou yo pou san ke yo te vèse sou peyi a, akoz yo te souye li ak zidòl yo. <verse eid="EZK 36:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 36:19"/>Anplis, Mwen te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 28:64">Det 28:64</ref></char></note>gaye yo pami nasyon yo, e yo te vin dispèse toupatou nan peyi yo. Selon chemen yo ak zak yo, Mwen te jije yo. <verse eid="EZK 36:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 36:20"/>Lè yo te rive nan nasyon kote yo te ale yo, yo te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 52:5">És 52:5</ref></char></note>pwofane non Mwen. Paske yo te di a yo menm: ‘Sila yo se pèp SENYÈ a; malgre, yo te vin sòti kite peyi Li a.’ <verse eid="EZK 36:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 36:21"/>Men Mwen te vle konsève onè a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 74:18">Sòm 74:18</ref></char></note>non sen Mwen an, ke lakay Israël te pwofane pami nasyon kote yo te ale yo.<verse eid="EZK 36:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 36:22"/>“Akoz sa, pale ak lakay Israël: ‘Konsa pale Senyè BONDYE a: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 7:7-8">Det 7:7-8</ref></char></note>“Se pa pou koz nou, O lakay Israël, ke Mwen prèt pou aji a, men pou non sen Mwen an, ke ou te pwofane pami nasyon kote nou te ale yo. <verse eid="EZK 36:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 36:23"/>Mwen va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 5:16">És 5:16</ref></char></note>fè valè sentete a gwo non Mwen an ki te pwofane pami nasyon yo, ke nou te pwofane nan mitan yo. Nan lè sa a nasyon yo va konnen ke Mwen se SENYÈ a,” deklare Senyè BONDYE a: “lè M fè prèv sentete Mwen pami nou devan zye yo.<verse eid="EZK 36:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 36:24"/>“‘“Paske Mwen va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 43:5-6">És 43:5-6</ref></char></note>retire nou soti nan nasyon yo, rasanble nou soti nan tout peyi yo pou mennen nou antre nan pwòp peyi pa nou an. <verse eid="EZK 36:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 36:25"/>Epi Mwen va flite yon dlo pwòp sou nou e nou va vin pwòp. Mwen va netwaye nou de <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 4:4">És 4:4</ref></char></note>tout sa ki malpwòp nan nou, e de tout zidòl nou yo. <verse eid="EZK 36:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 36:26"/>Anplis, Mwen va bay nou yon kè tounèf e Mwen va mete yon lespri tounèf anndan nou. Epi Mwen va retire <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 11:19">Éz 11:19</ref></char></note>kè wòch la soti nan chè nou pou bay nou yon kè ki fèt ak chè. <verse eid="EZK 36:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZK 36:27"/>Mwen va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 44:3">És 44:3</ref></char></note>mete Lespri M anndan nou, fè nou mache nan règleman Mwen yo e nou va fè atansyon pou swiv tout lwa Mwen yo. <verse eid="EZK 36:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZK 36:28"/>Nou va rete nan peyi ke M te bay a papa zansèt nou yo. Konsa, nou va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 14:11">Éz 14:11</ref></char></note>pèp Mwen yo e Mwen va Bondye pa nou. <verse eid="EZK 36:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EZK 36:29"/>Anplis, Mwen va sove nou de tout sa ki pa pwòp nan nou. Epi Mwen va rele pou sereyal miltipliye li e mwen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 34:27-29">Éz 34:27-29</ref></char></note>p ap mennen gwo grangou rive sou nou. <verse eid="EZK 36:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EZK 36:30"/>Mwen va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 26:4">Lev 26:4</ref></char></note>miltipliye fwi sou pyebwa ak pwodwi chan an, pou nou pa resevwa mepriz a gwo grangou pami nasyon yo ankò.”<verse eid="EZK 36:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="EZK 36:31"/>“‘“Nan lè sa a, nou va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 16:61-63">Éz 16:61-63</ref></char></note>sonje chemen mechan nou yo, zak nou ki pa t bon yo, e nou va rayi tèt nou nan pwòp zye nou, akoz inikite ak abominasyon nou yo. <verse eid="EZK 36:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EZK 36:32"/>Se pa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 9:5">Det 9:5</ref></char></note>pou koz nou ke m ap fè sa,” deklare Senyè BONDYE a: “Ke nou byen konprann sa a. Rete wont e twouble akoz chemen nou yo, O lakay Israël!”<verse eid="EZK 36:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="EZK 36:33"/>“‘Konsa pale Senyè BONDYE a: “Nan jou ke M netwaye nou soti nan tout inikite nou yo, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 36:10">Éz 36:10</ref></char></note>Mwen va fè vil la vin peple ak moun e kote dezole yo vin rebati. <verse eid="EZK 36:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EZK 36:34"/>Tèren dezole a va kiltive olye de vin yon dezolasyon devan zye a tout moun ki pase yo. <verse eid="EZK 36:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EZK 36:35"/>Yo va di: ‘Tè dezole sa a te vin tankou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36:35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 51:3">És 51:3</ref></char></note>jaden Éden. Epi dezè a, vil ranblè yo vin ranfòse e vin gen moun.’ <verse eid="EZK 36:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="EZK 36:36"/>Nan lè sa a, nasyon ki rete antoure nou yo va konnen ke Mwen menm, SENYÈ a, te rebati pil mazi yo, e te plante sa ki te vin dezè a. Mwen menm, SENYÈ a, fin pale e Mwen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36:36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 17:24">Éz 17:24</ref></char></note>va fè sa.”<verse eid="EZK 36:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="EZK 36:37"/>“‘Konsa pale Senyè BONDYE a: “Konsa anplis, men sa lakay Israël va mande M fè pou yo: Mwen va fè pèp pa yo a vin anpil tankou bann mouton. <verse eid="EZK 36:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="EZK 36:38"/>Tankou bann mouton ki pou fè sakrifis, tankou bann mouton Jérusalem nan lè fèt li yo, konsa vil dezole yo va vin plen ak yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36:38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 74:1">Sòm 74:1</ref></char></note>bann moun. Konsa, yo va konnen ke Mwen se SENYÈ a.”’”<verse eid="EZK 36:38"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 36"/>
  <chapter number="37" style="c" sid="EZK 37"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 37:1"/>Men SENYÈ a te sou mwen, Li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">37:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 8:3">Éz 8:3</ref></char></note>mennen mwen sòti pa Lespri SENYÈ a, e te depoze m nan mitan vale a. Konsa, vale a te plen ak zo. <verse eid="EZK 37:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 37:2"/>Li te fè m pase toutotou nan yo, e gade byen, te gen anpil sou sifas vale a. Epi gade byen, yo te byen sèch. <verse eid="EZK 37:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 37:3"/>Li te di mwen: “Fis a lòm, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">37:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 26:19">Éz 26:19</ref></char></note>èske zo sila yo kapab viv?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EZK 37:3">Konsa, mwen te reponn: “O Senyè BONDYE! Ou menm ki konnen.”<verse eid="EZK 37:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 37:4"/>Ankò li te di mwen: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">37:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 37:9-12">Éz 37:9-12</ref></char></note> “Pwofetize sou zo sila yo pou di yo: ‘O zo sèch yo, tande pawòl SENYÈ a. <verse eid="EZK 37:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 37:5"/>Konsa pale Senyè BONDYE a a zo sila yo: “Gade byen, Mwen va fè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">37:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 2:7">Jen 2:7</ref></char></note>souf lavi antre nan nou pou nou kapab vin vivan. <verse eid="EZK 37:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 37:6"/>Mwen va mete venn sou nou, kite chè vin grandi sou nou ankò, e mete souf nan nou pou nou ka vin vivan. Epi nou va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">37:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 49:23">És 49:23</ref></char></note>konnen ke Mwen se SENYÈ a.”’” <verse eid="EZK 37:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 37:7"/>Konsa, mwen te pwofetize <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">37:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 13:5-7">Jr 13:5-7</ref></char></note>jan mwen te kòmande a. Epi pandan mwen t ap pwofetize a, te gen yon bri e, gade byen, yon son tankou yon bagay k ap souke. Konsa, zo yo te vin rive ansanm, zo ak zo parèy yo. <verse eid="EZK 37:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 37:8"/>Mwen te gade e vwala, venn te vin sou yo, chè te vin grandi, e po yo te vin kouvri. Men pa t gen souf nan yo.<verse eid="EZK 37:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 37:9"/>Epi li te di mwen: “Pwofetize a souf lavi a! Pwofetize, fis a lòm, e di a souf lavi a: ‘Konsa pale Senyè BONDYÈ a: “Vin sòti nan kat van yo, O souf lavi, e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">37:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 104:30">Sòm 104:30</ref></char></note>soufle sou sila ke yo te touye yo, pou yo ka vin vivan.”’”<verse eid="EZK 37:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 37:10"/>Konsa, mwen te pwofetize jan Li te kòmande mwen an. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">37:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 11:11">Rev 11:11</ref></char></note>Souf lavi a te antre nan yo. Yo te vin vivan e te kanpe sou pye yo, yon lame gran depase.<verse eid="EZK 37:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 37:11"/>Konsa li te di mwen: “Fis a lòm, zo sila yo se <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">37:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 33:24">Jr 33:24</ref></char></note>tout lakay Israël. Gade byen, yo di: ‘Zo nou yo vin sèch e espwa nou fin peri. Nou fin koupe retire nèt.’ <verse eid="EZK 37:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 37:12"/>Pou sa, pwofetize e di yo: ‘Konsa pale Senyè BONDYE a: “Gade byen, Mwen va ouvri tonm nou yo pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">37:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 32:39">Det 32:39</ref></char></note>fè nou monte sòti nan tonm nou yo, pèp Mwen an; epi Mwen va mennen nou antre nan peyi Israël. <verse eid="EZK 37:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 37:13"/>Nan lè sa a, nou va konnen ke Mwen se SENYÈ a, lè M fin ouvri tonm nou yo e fè nou monte sòti nan tonm nou yo, pèp Mwen an. <verse eid="EZK 37:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 37:14"/>Mwen va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">37:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 32:15">És 32:15</ref></char></note>mete Lespri M anndan nou, nou va vin vivan e Mwen va mete nou sou pwòp teren pa nou. Nan lè sa a, nou va konnen ke Mwen, SENYÈ a, te fin pale, e te fè sa,” deklare SENYÈ a.’”<verse eid="EZK 37:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 37:15"/>Pawòl SENYÈ a te vin kote mwen ankò. Li te di: <verse eid="EZK 37:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 37:16"/>“Ou menm, fis a lòm, pran pou kont ou yon mòso bwa e ekri sou li: ‘Pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">37:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 10:17">II Kwo 10:17</ref></char></note>Juda e pou fis a Israël parèy li yo’. Epi pran yon lòt mòso bwa e ekri sou li: ‘Pou Joseph, bwa Éphraïm nan, ak tout lakay Israël parèy li yo.’ <verse eid="EZK 37:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 37:17"/>Konsa, pou kont ou, fè yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">37:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 11:13">És 11:13</ref></char></note>vin jwenn youn ak lòt pou vin fè yon sèl bwa, pou yo ka vin youn nan men ou.”<verse eid="EZK 37:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 37:18"/>“Lè fis a pèp ou yo mande ou e di: ‘Èske ou p ap deklare a nou menm <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">37:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 12:9">Éz 12:9</ref></char></note>sa ou vle di ak sa yo?’ <verse eid="EZK 37:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 37:19"/>Di yo: ‘Konsa pale Senyè BONDYE a: “Gade byen, Mwen va pran bwa Joseph la, ki nan men Éphraïm nan, ak tribi Israël parèy li yo, epi Mwen va mete yo avèk li, avèk bwa a Juda a. Konsa, yo va fè yon sèl bwa. Yo va vin youn nan men M. <verse eid="EZK 37:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 37:20"/>Bwa sou sila ou ekri yo, va nan men ou devan zye yo.”’ <verse eid="EZK 37:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 37:21"/>Pale ak yo: ‘Konsa pale Senyè BONDYE a: “Gade byen, Mwen va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">37:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 43:5-6">És 43:5-6</ref></char></note>pran fis Israël yo soti nan nasyon kote yo te ale yo. Epi Mwen va rasanble yo soti tout kote pou mennen yo antre nan pwòp peyi pa yo. <verse eid="EZK 37:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 37:22"/>Konsa, Mwen va fè yo vin <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">37:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 3:18">Jr 3:18</ref></char></note>yon nasyon nan peyi a, sou mòn Israël yo, epi yon wa va wa pou yo tout. Konsa, yo p ap fè de nasyon ankò e yo p ap divize an de wayòm ankò. <verse eid="EZK 37:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 37:23"/>Yo p ap souye tèt yo ak zidòl yo ankò, ni ak bagay abominab yo, ni ak okenn nan transgresyon yo. Konsa, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">37:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 36:28-29">Éz 36:28-29</ref></char></note>Mwen va delivre yo de tout abitasyon kote yo te fè peche yo e Mwen va netwaye yo. Yo va pèp Mwen e Mwen va Bondye yo.”<verse eid="EZK 37:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 37:24"/>“‘“Sèvitè Mwen an, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">37:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 30:9">Jr 30:9</ref></char></note>David va wa sou yo e yo tout va gen yon sèl bèje. Yo va mache nan règleman Mwen yo, e yo va kenbe lalwa M yo, e yo va swiv yo. <verse eid="EZK 37:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 37:25"/>Yo va viv sou tè ke M te bay a Jacob la, sèvitè Mwen an, nan sila papa zansèt nou yo te rete a. Yo va viv sou li, yo menm, fis yo ak fis a fis yo, jis pou tout tan, epi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">37:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 11:1">És 11:1</ref></char></note>David, sèvitè Mwen an, va prens yo jis pou tout tan. <verse eid="EZK 37:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 37:26"/>Mwen va fè yon akò lapè avèk yo. Li va yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">37:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 89:3-4">Sòm 89:3-4</ref></char></note>akò k ap dire pou tout tan avèk yo. Mwen va etabli yo, fè yo vin miltipliye e Mwen va mete sanktyè Mwen nan mitan yo jis pou tout tan. <verse eid="EZK 37:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZK 37:27"/>Anplis, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">37:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 1:14">Jn 1:14</ref></char></note>abitasyon Mwen an va avèk yo, epi Mwen va Bondye yo, e yo va pèp Mwen. <verse eid="EZK 37:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZK 37:28"/>Konsa, nasyon yo va konnen ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">37:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 31:13">Egz 31:13</ref></char></note>Mwen se SENYÈ ki sanktifye Israël la, lè sanktyè Mwen an nan mitan yo jis pou tout tan.”’”<verse eid="EZK 37:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 37"/>
  <chapter number="38" style="c" sid="EZK 38"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 38:1"/>Epi pawòl Bondye te vin kote mwen. Li te di: <verse eid="EZK 38:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 38:2"/>“Fis a lòm, mete figi ou vè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">38:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 38:3-18">Éz 38:3-18</ref></char></note>Gog nan peyi Magog, prens a Rosch la, Méschec, ak Tubal e pwofetize kont li. <verse eid="EZK 38:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 38:3"/>Di l: ‘Konsa pale Senyè BONDYE a: “Gade byen, Mwen kont ou, O Gog, prens a Rosch la, Méschec ak Tubal. <verse eid="EZK 38:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 38:4"/>Mwen va fè ou detounen. Mwen va mete yon kwòk nan machwè ou, e Mwen va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">38:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 43:17">És 43:17</ref></char></note>rale ou deyò ak tout lame ou a; cheval ak chevalye yo, yo tout byen abiye, yon gran twoup moun, boukliye ak pwotèj, tout k ap manyen nepe; <verse eid="EZK 38:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 38:5"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">38:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 36:20">II Kwo 36:20</ref></char></note>Perse Ethiopie e Put avèk yo, yo tout ak boukliye ak kas; <verse eid="EZK 38:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 38:6"/>Gomer ak tout twoup li yo; <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">38:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 10:3">Jen 10:3</ref></char></note>Beth-Togarma soti kote ki pi lwen nan nò a avèk tout twoup li yo—anpil moun avèk ou.”<verse eid="EZK 38:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 38:7"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">38:7 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 8:9">És 8:9</ref>
      </char>
    </note>“‘“Prepare ou e rete prepare, ou menm ak tout twoup ki rasanble antoure ou yo. Veye byen sou yo. <verse eid="EZK 38:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 38:8"/>Apre anpil jou, ou va vizite. Nan dènye ane yo, ou va vin antre nan teren ki vin restore soti anba nepe a. Moun ki <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">38:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 11:11">És 11:11</ref></char></note>rasanble va soti anpil nasyon pou rive sou mòn Israël yo. Yon kote ki te devni san vale, va soti nan men nasyon yo, e la, y ap viv ansekirite, yo tout. <verse eid="EZK 38:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 38:9"/>Ou va monte. Ou va vini <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">38:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 5:28">És 5:28</ref></char></note>tankou yon tanpèt. Ou va tankou yon nwaj k ap kouvri peyi a, ou menm ak tout twoup ou yo, ansanm ak anpil lòt nasyon yo.”<verse eid="EZK 38:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 38:10"/>“‘Konsa pale Senyè BONDYE a: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">38:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 36:4">Sòm 36:4</ref></char></note>“Li va rive nan jou sa a, ke kèk panse va vin antre nan lespri ou e ou va anvizaje yon move plan. <verse eid="EZK 38:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 38:11"/>Konsa ou va di: ‘Mwen va monte kont peyi a ak <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">38:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 2:4">Za 2:4</ref></char></note>vil san miray yo. Mwen va ale kont sila ki an repo yo, ki viv ansekirite yo, yo tout k ap viv san miray yo, san fè fòje ni pòtay yo, <verse eid="EZK 38:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 38:12"/>pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">38:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 10:6">És 10:6</ref></char></note>kaptire e sezi piyaj la, pou vire men ou kont kote dezè ki, koulye a, gen moun yo, e kont pèp ki vin rasanble soti nan nasyon yo, ki te vin genyen byen ak bèt, ki viv nan mitan mond lan.’ <verse eid="EZK 38:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 38:13"/>Séba, Dedan, komèsan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">38:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 27:12">Éz 27:12</ref></char></note>Tarsis yo ak tout ti vil li yo va di ou: ‘Èske ou vini pou kaptire piyaj la? Èske ou te rasanble twoup ou yo ou pou sezi piyaj la, pou pote ale ajan ak lò, pou pote ale bèt ak anpil byen, pou sezi gwo piyaj la?’”’<verse eid="EZK 38:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 38:14"/>“Pou sa, pwofetize, fis a lòm e di a Gog: ‘Konsa pale Senyè BONDYE a: “Nan jou ke pèp Mwen an ap <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">38:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 23:6">Jr 23:6</ref></char></note>viv ansekirite a, èske ou p ap konnen sa? <verse eid="EZK 38:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 38:15"/>Ou va sòti nan plas kote ki pi lwen yo nan nò a, ou menm ak anpil pèp avèk ou, yo tout ap galope cheval, yon gwo asanble e yon lame pwisan. <verse eid="EZK 38:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 38:16"/>Epi ou va vini kont pèp Mwen an, Israël, tankou yon gran nwaj k ap kouvri tout tè a. Li va vin rive nan dènye jou ke Mwen va mennen ou vini kont peyi Mwen, pou nasyon yo ka konnen Mwen lè M fin <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">38:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 5:16">És 5:16</ref></char></note>sanktifye atravè ou menm, O Gog, devan zye yo.”<verse eid="EZK 38:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 38:17"/>“‘Konsa pale Senyè BONDYE a: “Èske ou se moun sou sila ke M te pale nan ansyen jou yo pa sèvitè Mwen yo, pwofèt Israël yo? Sila ki te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">38:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 5:26-29">És 5:26-29</ref></char></note>pwofetize nan jou sa yo pandan anpil ane pou M ta mennen ou kont yo? <verse eid="EZK 38:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 38:18"/>Li va vin rive nan jou sila a, lè Gog monte kont peyi Israël”, deklare Senyè BONDYE a: “ke gwo chalè mekontantman Mwen va monte nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">38:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 18:8-15">Sòm 18:8-15</ref></char></note>kòlè Mwen. <verse eid="EZK 38:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 38:19"/>Nan devouman Mwen ak nan chalè kòlè Mwen, Mwen deklare ke nan jou sa a, va anverite gen yon gwo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">38:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOL 3:16">Jl 3:16</ref></char></note>tranbleman detè nan peyi Israël. <verse eid="EZK 38:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 38:20"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">38:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 4:24-25">Jr 4:24-25</ref></char></note>Pwason lanmè yo, zwazo syèl yo, bèt nan chan yo, tout bèt sila k ap kouri atè yo ak tout moun sou sifas tè a va souke devan prezans Mwen. Mòn yo tou va jete anba, ti wout apik yo va vin bouche e tout miray va tonbe atè. <verse eid="EZK 38:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 38:21"/>Mwen va rele yon nepe kont li sou tout mòn Mwen yo”, deklare Senyè BONDYE a. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">38:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 7:22">Jij 7:22</ref></char></note>“Nepe a tout moun va kont frè yo. <verse eid="EZK 38:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 38:22"/>Ak ensèk ak maladi, e ak san, Mwen va antre an <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">38:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 66:16">És 66:16</ref></char></note>jijman ak li. Mwen va voye lapli sou li ak twoup li yo e sou kantite moun ki vini avèk li yo, yon gwo lapli ak gwo wòch lagrèl, ak dife, ak souf. <verse eid="EZK 38:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 38:23"/>Mwen va egzalte tèt Mwen, sanktifye tèt Mwen e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">38:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 9:16">Sòm 9:16</ref></char></note>fè tèt Mwen menm vin rekonèt nan zye a anpil nasyon. Konsa, yo va konnen ke Mwen se SENYÈ a.’”<verse eid="EZK 38:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 38"/>
  <chapter number="39" style="c" sid="EZK 39"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 39:1"/>“Epi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">39:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 38:2">Éz 38:2</ref></char></note>ou menm, fis a lòm, pwofetize kont Gog pou di: ‘Konsa pale Senyè BONDYE a: “Gade byen, Mwen kont ou, O Gog! Prens a Rosch, Méschec ak Tubal la. <verse eid="EZK 39:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 39:2"/>Epi Mwen va detounen ou, kontinye wout la, pran ou soti nan kote nò ki pi izole a pou mennen ou kont mòn Israël yo. <verse eid="EZK 39:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 39:3"/>Mwen va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">39:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 76:3">Sòm 76:3</ref></char></note>frape banza ou jis li kite men goch ou, e fè flèch yo tonbe kite men dwat ou. <verse eid="EZK 39:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 39:4"/>Ou va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">39:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 14:24-25">És 14:24-25</ref></char></note>tonbe sou mòn Israël yo, ou menm, tout sòlda ou yo ak moun ki avèk ou yo. Mwen va bay ou kon manje a tout kalite zwazo kanivò ak bèt nan chan. <verse eid="EZK 39:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 39:5"/>Ou va tonbe nan chan ouvri, paske se Mwen menm ki fin pale sa,” deklare Senyè BONDYE a. <verse eid="EZK 39:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 39:6"/>“Epi Mwen va voye dife sou Magog ak sila ki rete ansekirite nan il <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">39:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 72:10">Sòm 72:10</ref></char></note>kot lanmè yo, epi yo va konnen ke Mwen se SENYÈ a.<verse eid="EZK 39:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 39:7"/>“‘“Non sen Mwen an, Mwen va fè Li vin rekonèt nan mitan pèp Mwen an, Israël. Konsa, Mwen p ap kite non Mwen vin <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">39:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:7">Egz 20:7</ref></char></note>pwofane ankò. Nasyon yo va konnen ke Mwen se Senyè a, Sila Ki Sen an Israël la. <verse eid="EZK 39:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 39:8"/>Gade byen, sa ap vini e sa va fèt,” deklare Senyè BONDYE a. “Sa se jou nan sila Mwen te pale a.”<verse eid="EZK 39:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 39:9"/>“‘“Nan lè sa a, sila ki rete nan vil Israël yo va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">39:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 66:24">És 66:24</ref></char></note>sòti deyò pou limen dife ak zam yo pou brile yo, ni pwotèj yo, ni boukliye yo, banza ak flèch yo, baton lagè ak nepe yo e pandan sèt ane, yo va fè dife ak yo. <verse eid="EZK 39:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 39:10"/>Yo p ap pran bwa nan chan, a ni sanble bwa dife ki soti nan forè yo, paske yo va fè dife ak zam yo. Epi yo va pran piyaj a sila ki te piyaje moun yo, e sezi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">39:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 14:2">És 14:2</ref></char></note>piyaj a sila ki te fè piyaj yo,” deklare Senyè BONDYE a.<verse eid="EZK 39:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 39:11"/>“‘“Nan jou sa a, Mwen va bay Gog yon simityè la an Israël, nan vale kote moun yo pase sou kote lès lanmè a, e li va bloke sila ki ta pase ladan. Konsa, yo va antere Gog ak tout foul li a, e yo va rele la, ‘Vale Moun Gog la’.<verse eid="EZK 39:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 39:12"/>“‘“Pandan sèt mwa, lakay Israël va fè antèman yo, pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">39:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 21:23">Det 21:23</ref></char></note>netwaye peyi a. <verse eid="EZK 39:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 39:13"/>Menm tout pèp peyi a, va fè antèman yo. Epi sa va fè yo renome pàtou nan jou sa a, pou pwop tèt Mwen ka resevwa glwa,” deklare Senyè BONDYE a.”<verse eid="EZK 39:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 39:14"/>“Yo va mete apa moun ki anplwaye nèt k ap pase nan peyi a. Sila yo k ap pase ap rive kote y ap <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">39:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 14:16">Jr 14:16</ref></char></note>antere sa yo ki rete sou sifas tè a, pou yo ka netwaye li. Nan fen sèt mwa yo, yo va fè yon rechèch pou twouve yo. <verse eid="EZK 39:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 39:15"/>Pandan sila k ap fè rechèch nan peyi yo ap pase, e nenpòt moun wè zo a yon moun, alò, li va mete yon makè akote l jiskaske ekip antèman an vin antere li nan Vale Moun Gog la. <verse eid="EZK 39:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 39:16"/>Pou sa, non vil la menm va Hamona. Konsa yo va netwaye peyi a.”<verse eid="EZK 39:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 39:17"/>“Pou ou menm, fis a lòm, konsa pale Senyè BONDYE a: ‘Pale a tout kalite <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">39:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 56:9">És 56:9</ref></char></note>zwazo, ak tout bèt nan chan: “Rasanble nou e vini. Rasanble soti tout kote anvè sakrifis Mwen, ke M ap pral fè pou nou an, yon gwo sakrifis sou mòn Israël yo, pou nou ka manje chè ak bwè san. <verse eid="EZK 39:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 39:18"/>Nou va manje chè a mesye pwisan yo, e bwè san a prens latè yo, konsi se te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">39:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 51:40">Jr 51:40</ref></char></note>belye, jenn mouton, kabrit, ak towo, tout bèt gra a Basan yo. <verse eid="EZK 39:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 39:19"/>Akoz sa, nou va manje grès jiskaske nou vin toufe nèt ak sakrifis Mwen, ke M fin fè pou nou an. <verse eid="EZK 39:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 39:20"/>Nou va toufe nèt sou tab Mwen an ak <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">39:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 76:5-6">Sòm 76:5-6</ref></char></note>cheval yo, ak mesye mèt cha yo, mesye pwisan yo ak tout gwo mesye lagè yo”, deklare Senyè BONDYE a.’<verse eid="EZK 39:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 39:21"/>“Konsa, Mwen va mete <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">39:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 9:16">Egz 9:16</ref></char></note>glwa Mwen pami nasyon yo. Tout nasyon yo va wè jijman ke Mwen te egzekite ak men M, ke M te fè poze sou yo a. <verse eid="EZK 39:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 39:22"/>Epi lakay Israël va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">39:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 24:7">Jr 24:7</ref></char></note>konnen ke Mwen se SENYÈ a, Bondye yo a, depi jou sa a, pou rive ale nèt. <verse eid="EZK 39:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 39:23"/>Nasyon yo va konnen ke lakay Israël te antre an egzil akoz <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">39:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 22:8-9">Jr 22:8-9</ref></char></note>inikite yo. Akoz yo te aji kon trèt ak Mwen, Mwen te kache figi Mwen de yo. Konsa, Mwen te livre yo nan men advèsè yo, e yo tout, te tonbe devan nepe. <verse eid="EZK 39:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 39:24"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">39:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 17:7">II Wa 17:7</ref></char></note>Selon salte yo e selon transgresyon yo, Mwen te aji avèk yo, e Mwen te kache figi Mwen de yo.”<verse eid="EZK 39:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 39:25"/>“Pou sa, pale Senyè BONDYE a: ‘Koulye a, Mwen va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">39:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 27:12-13">És 27:12-13</ref></char></note>restore avni a Jacob, e Mwen va gen mizerikòd pou tout lakay Israël, epi Mwen va jalou pou non sen Mwen an. <verse eid="EZK 39:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 39:26"/>Yo va bliye wont yo ak tout trèt yo te konn fè kont Mwen yo, lè y ap <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">39:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 4:25">I Wa 4:25</ref></char></note>viv ansekirite nan pwòp peyi pa yo, lè okenn p ap fè yo pè. <verse eid="EZK 39:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZK 39:27"/>Lè Mwen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">39:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 36:24">Éz 36:24</ref></char></note>mennen yo retounen soti nan lòt pèp yo, e rasanble yo soti nan peyi lènmi yo; nan lè sa a, Mwen va vin sanktifye de yo devan zye a anpil nasyon. <verse eid="EZK 39:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZK 39:28"/>Nan lè sa a, yo va konnen ke Mwen se SENYÈ a, Bondye yo a, akoz mwen te fè yo antre an egzil pami nasyon yo, e alò, Mwen te rasanble yo ankò nan pwòp peyi yo. Epi Mwen p ap kite okenn nan yo kaptif ankò. <verse eid="EZK 39:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EZK 39:29"/>Mwen p ap kache figi Mwen de yo ankò, paske M ap gen tan fin <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">39:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 32:15">És 32:15</ref></char></note>vide Lespri m sou lakay Israël,’ deklare Senyè BONDYE a.”<verse eid="EZK 39:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 39"/>
  <chapter number="40" style="c" sid="EZK 40"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 40:1"/>Nan venn-senkyèm ane egzil nou an, nan kòmansman ane a, nan dizyèm jou nan mwa a, nan katòzyèm ane apre <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">40:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 25:1-7">II Wa 25:1-7</ref></char></note>vil la te fin pran an, nan menm jou sa a, men SENYÈ a te sou mwen e Li te mennen mwen la. <verse eid="EZK 40:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 40:2"/>Nan vizyon a Bondye yo, Li te mennen m nan peyi Israël, Li te depoze m sou yon mòn byen wo. Epi sou li vè sid te gen yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">40:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 28:12-19">I Kwo 28:12-19</ref></char></note>konstriksyon tankou yon vil. <verse eid="EZK 40:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 40:3"/>Konsa, se la li te mennen mwen, epi gade byen, te gen yon nonm ak aparans tankou aparans a bwonz, yon lign fisèl fèt ak len ak yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">40:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 11:1">Rev 11:1</ref></char></note>baton apantaj nan men l. Konsa, li te kanpe nan pòtay la. <verse eid="EZK 40:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 40:4"/>Nonm nan te di m: “Fis a lòm, wè ak zye ou e prete atansyon a tout sa ke m va montre ou; paske ou te vin mennen isit la pou m ta ka montre ou li. Deklare a lakay Israël tout sa ke ou wè.”<verse eid="EZK 40:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 40:5"/>Gade byen, te gen yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">40:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 26:1">És 26:1</ref></char></note>miray sou deyò a tanp lan toutozanviwon, e nan men a nonm nan, te gen yon baton ki mezire sis koude. Yo chak te yon koude plis lajè a yon pla men.<verse eid="EZK 40:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 40:6"/>Konsa, li te ale nan pòtay ki te gen fas li vè lès. Li te monte sou eskalye li yo, e te mezire papòt pòtay la, yon ba kann nan lajè, epi lòt papòt la te yon ba kann nan lajè. <verse eid="EZK 40:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 40:7"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">40:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 40:10-21">Éz 40:10-21</ref></char></note>Chanm gad la te yon ba kann nan longè, e yon ba kann nan lajè, epi te gen senk koude antre chanm gad yo. Epi papòt pòtay la akote galri pòtay ki te ouvri pa anndan an te yon ba kann.<verse eid="EZK 40:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 40:8"/>Li te mezire galri a vè fas pòtay la pa anndan, yon ba kann. <verse eid="EZK 40:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 40:9"/>Li te mezire galri a pòtay la, uit koude, epi pilye akote li yo, de koude. Epi galri a pòtay la te vè kay la.<verse eid="EZK 40:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 40:10"/>Chanm gad a pòtay lès yo te twa nan kote sa a, ak twa de lòt kote. Toule twa nan de kote te gen menm mezi. Pilye akote yo te gen menm mezi a nan chak kote tou. <verse eid="EZK 40:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 40:11"/>Li te mezire lajè pòtay la, dis koude e longè pòtay la, trèz koude. <verse eid="EZK 40:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 40:12"/>Te gen yon mi baryè yon koude lajè nan chak kote, epi chanm gad yo te sis koude kare nan chak kote. <verse eid="EZK 40:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 40:13"/>Li te mezire pòtay la soti nan twati a youn nan chanm gad yo, rive nan twati a lòt la, yon lajè a venn-senk koude soti nan yon pòt jis rive nan pòt a lòt anfas la. <verse eid="EZK 40:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 40:14"/>Li te fè pilye akote yo swasant koude wotè, epi lakou a te rive nan pilye yo jis li antoure <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">40:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 27:9">Egz 27:9</ref></char></note>pòtay la. <verse eid="EZK 40:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 40:15"/>Soti devan antre a pòtay, antre a pou rive devan galri enteryè a, te gen senkant koude. <verse eid="EZK 40:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 40:16"/>Te gen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">40:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 6:4">I Wa 6:4</ref></char></note>fenèt ki fèt ak gri ki te vizavi a chanm gad yo, nan pozisyon akote pilye yo ak pòtay ki te antoure yo a, e menm jan pou galri yo. Epi te gen fenèt toutozanviwon pa anndan. Epi sou chak pilye akote yo, te gen dekorasyon pye palmis.<verse eid="EZK 40:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 40:17"/>Konsa, li te mennen mwen nan lakou eksteryè a, e gade byen, te gen chanm ak yon pave ki te fèt pou tout lakou a toupatou. Trant chanm yo te ouvri sou pave a. <verse eid="EZK 40:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 40:18"/>Pave a te akote pòtay yo, e te koresponn a longè pòtay yo, menm pave pi ba a. <verse eid="EZK 40:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 40:19"/>Epi li te mezire lajè a soti devan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">40:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 40:23-27">Éz 40:23-27</ref></char></note>pòtay pi ba a pou rive devan pati eksteryè a lakou enteryè a, yon santèn koude nan lès ak nan nò.<verse eid="EZK 40:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 40:20"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">40:20 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 40:6">Éz 40:6</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Jan pou pòtay lakou eksteryè ki bay fas vè nò a, li te mezire longè li ak lajè li. <verse eid="EZK 40:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 40:21"/>Li te gen twa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">40:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 40:7">Éz 40:7</ref></char></note>chanm gad chak kote. Pilye akote li yo ak galri li yo te gen menm mezi ak premye pòtay la. Longè li te senkant koude e lajè a te venn-senk koude. <verse eid="EZK 40:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 40:22"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">40:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 40:16">Éz 40:16</ref></char></note>Fenèt li yo, galri li yo ak dekorasyon pye palmis li yo te gen menm mezi ak pòtay ki te bay fas vè lès la. Epi li te vin jwenn pa sèt mach eskalye yo, e galri li te devan yo. <verse eid="EZK 40:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 40:23"/>Lakou enteryè a te gen yon pòtay anfas pòtay nan nò a, menm jan ak pòtay nan lès la. Li te mezire <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">40:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 40:19-27">Éz 40:19-27</ref></char></note>san koude soti nan yon pòtay a yon pòtay.<verse eid="EZK 40:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 40:24"/>Nan lè sa a, li te mennen m vè sid e gade byen, te gen yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">40:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 40:6-22">Éz 40:6-22</ref></char></note>pòtay vè sid la. Li te mezire pilye akote li yo ak galri li yo selon menm mezi sila yo. <verse eid="EZK 40:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 40:25"/>Pòtay ak galri li yo te gen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">40:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 40:16-29">Éz 40:16-29</ref></char></note>fenèt toutotou tankou lòt fenèt yo. Longè la te senkant koude e lajè a te venn-senk koude. <verse eid="EZK 40:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 40:26"/>Te gen sèt <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">40:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 40:6-22">Éz 40:6-22</ref></char></note>machpye ki t ap monte vè li e galri li yo te devan yo. Li te gen dekorasyon pye palmis yo sou pilye akote yo, youn nan chak kote. <verse eid="EZK 40:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZK 40:27"/>Lakou enteryè a te gen yon pòtay vè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">40:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 40:23-32">Éz 40:23-32</ref></char></note>sid. Li te mezire de pòtay a pòtay vè sid, san koude.<verse eid="EZK 40:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZK 40:28"/>Epi li te mennen m nan lakou enteryè a pa pòtay sid la, e li te mezire pòtay sid la <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">40:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 40:32-35">Éz 40:32-35</ref></char></note>selon menm mezi yo. <verse eid="EZK 40:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EZK 40:29"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">40:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 40:7-21">Éz 40:7-21</ref></char></note>Chanm gad li yo tou, pilye akote li yo ak galri li yo tout selon menm mezi yo. Epi te gen fenèt nan li ak galri yo ki te antoure l toupatou. Li te senkant koude nan longè e venn-senk koude nan lajè. <verse eid="EZK 40:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EZK 40:30"/>Te gen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">40:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 40:16-21">Éz 40:16-21</ref></char></note>galri yo toupatou, venn-senk koude longè e senk koude lajè. <verse eid="EZK 40:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EZK 40:31"/>Galri li yo te vè lakou eksteryè a. Dekorasyon pye palmis yo te sou pilye akote li yo e eskalye li a te gen uit <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">40:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 40:22-37">Éz 40:22-37</ref></char></note>machpye.<verse eid="EZK 40:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="EZK 40:32"/>Li te mennen m nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">40:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 40:28-35">Éz 40:28-35</ref></char></note>lakou enteryè a vè lès. Li te mezire pòtay la selon menm mezi sila yo. <verse eid="EZK 40:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EZK 40:33"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">40:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 40:29">Éz 40:29</ref></char></note>Chanm gad li yo tou, pilye akote li yo ak galri li yo te selon menm mezi sa yo. Pòtay ak galri li yo te gen fenèt toutotou. Li te senkant koude nan longè e venn-senk koude nan lajè. <verse eid="EZK 40:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EZK 40:34"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">40:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 40:16">Éz 40:16</ref></char></note>Galri li yo te vè lakou eksteryè a. Dekorasyon pye palmis yo te sou pilye akote li yo e eskalye a te gen uit machpye.<verse eid="EZK 40:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="EZK 40:35"/>Ankò, li te mennen mwen antre nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">40:35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 40:27-32">Éz 40:27-32</ref></char></note>pòtay nò a. Li te mezire li selon menm mezi yo— <verse eid="EZK 40:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="EZK 40:36"/>avèk <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">40:36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 40:7-29">Éz 40:7-29</ref></char></note>chanm gad li yo, pliye akote li yo ak galri li yo. Pòtay la te gen fenèt toutotou. Longè a te senkant koude e lajè a te venn-senk koude. <verse eid="EZK 40:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="EZK 40:37"/>Pilye akote li yo te vè lakou eksteryè a. Dekorasyon pye palmis yo te sou pilye akote li yo, youn sou chak kote. Eskalye li a te gen uit <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">40:37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 40:34">Éz 40:34</ref></char></note>machpye.<verse eid="EZK 40:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="EZK 40:38"/>Yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">40:38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 28:12">I Kwo 28:12</ref></char></note>chanm ak pòtay li te bò pilye nan pòtay yo. La, yo te lave ofrann brile yo. <verse eid="EZK 40:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="EZK 40:39"/>Nan galri pòtay la, te gen de tab nan chak kote, tab sou sila yo te touye <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">40:39 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 1:3-7">Lev 1:3-7</ref></char></note>ofrann brile yo, ofrann peche yo ak ofrann koupabilite a. <verse eid="EZK 40:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="EZK 40:40"/>Sou kote deyò a, pandan yon moun t ap monte vè pòtay nò a, te gen de tab, epi sou lòt kote galri pòtay la, te gen de tab. <verse eid="EZK 40:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="EZK 40:41"/>Kat <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">40:41 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 40:39-40">Éz 40:39-40</ref></char></note>tab te nan chak kote touprè pòtay la, ki fè uit tab antou sou sila yo te touye sakrifis yo. <verse eid="EZK 40:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="EZK 40:42"/>Pou ofrann brile yo, te gen kat tab an <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">40:42 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:25">Egz 20:25</ref></char></note>wòch taye, yon koude edmi nan longè, yon koude edmi nan lajè e yon koude nan wotè, tab sou sila yo poze enstriman avèk sila yo touye ofrann brile ak sakrifis la. <verse eid="EZK 40:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="EZK 40:43"/>Kwòk yo, longè a yon pla Men te enstale toupatou nan kay la. Sou tab yo, yo te mete chè ofrann nan.<verse eid="EZK 40:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="EZK 40:44"/>Soti deyò jis rive nan pòtay enteryè a, se te chanm pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">40:44 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 6:31-32">I Kwo 6:31-32</ref></char></note>chantè nan lakou enteryè yo. Youn nan sila yo te akote pòtay nò a, ak fas li vè sid ak youn akote pòtay sid la, ak fas li vè nò. <verse eid="EZK 40:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="EZK 40:45"/>Li te di mwen: “Sa se chanm ki bay fas vè sid la, ki pou prèt ki responsab <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">40:45 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 9:23">I Kwo 9:23</ref></char></note>lokipe tanp yo. <verse eid="EZK 40:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="EZK 40:46"/>Men chanm ki bay fas vè nò a se pou prèt ki responsab okipe lotèl yo. Sila yo se <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">40:46 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 2:35">I Wa 2:35</ref></char></note>fis a Tsadok yo, ki soti nan fis a Levi ki vin rapwoche yo de SENYÈ a pou fè sèvis Li.” <verse eid="EZK 40:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="EZK 40:47"/>Li te mezire lakou a, an fòm kare nèt, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">40:47 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 40:19-27">Éz 40:19-27</ref></char></note>san koude nan longè pa san koude nan lajè. Epi lotèl la te devan tanp lan.<verse eid="EZK 40:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="EZK 40:48"/>Nan lè sa a, li te mennen m nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">40:48 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 6:3">I Wa 6:3</ref></char></note>galri a tanp lan e li te mezire chak kote pilye a galri a, senk koude nan chak kote. Lajè a pòtay la te twa koude nan chak kote. <verse eid="EZK 40:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="EZK 40:49"/>Longè a galeri a te ven koude e lajè a te onz koude. Vè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">40:49 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 40:31-37">Éz 40:31-37</ref></char></note>eskalye pa sila li ta ka monte a, te gen kolòn ki te apatyen a pilye akote yo, youn nan chak kote.<verse eid="EZK 40:49"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 40"/>
  <chapter number="41" style="c" sid="EZK 41"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 41:1"/>Epi li te fè m rive kote <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">41:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 41:21-23">Éz 41:21-23</ref></char></note>chanm gran asanble tanp lan, e li te mezire pilye akote yo: sis koude nan lajè nan chak kote, se te lajè a pilye akote a. <verse eid="EZK 41:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 41:2"/>Lajè a antre a, te dis koude e akote chak antre yo, te dis koude nan chak kote, epi akote antre a te senk koude de chak kote. Li te mezire longè a chanm gran asanble tanp lan, ki te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">41:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 6:2-17">I Wa 6:2-17</ref></char></note>karant koude, e lajè a, ven koude.<verse eid="EZK 41:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 41:3"/>Konsa, li te antre <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">41:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 40:16">Éz 40:16</ref></char></note>anndan an e li te mezire chak pilye akote pòtay la, de koude, e pòtay la, sis koude nan wotè, epi lajè pòtay la, sèt koude. <verse eid="EZK 41:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 41:4"/>Li te mezire longè li, ven koude ak lajè li, ven koude, devan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">41:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 6:5">I Wa 6:5</ref></char></note>chanm gran asanble a, e li te di mwen: “Sa a se lye ki pi sen an”.<verse eid="EZK 41:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 41:5"/>Li te mezire miray a tanp lan, sis koude; epi lajè a chanm akote yo, kat koude, toutotou kay la nan chak kote. <verse eid="EZK 41:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 41:6"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">41:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 6:5-10">I Wa 6:5-10</ref></char></note>Chanm akote yo te nan twa etaj, youn anwo lòt, e trant nan chak etaj. Chanm akote yo te lonje rive nan miray ki te toupatou sou kote enteryè yo, pou yo ta ka twouve soutyèn, men pa tache nan miray a tanp lan li menm. <verse eid="EZK 41:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 41:7"/>Chanm akote ki te antoure tanp yo te vin pi laj nan chak nivo etaj yo. Akoz <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">41:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 6:8">I Wa 6:8</ref></char></note>konstriksyon ki te antoure tanp lan te monte pa etaj sou tout kote a tanp lan. Konsa, lajè a tanp lan te vin pi gwo pandan li t ap monte piwo. Konsa, yon moun ta monte soti nan pi ba etaj la pou rive nan piwo a pa yon pasaj nan dezyèm etaj la.<verse eid="EZK 41:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 41:8"/>Mwen te wè anplis ke kay la te gen yon plafon elve toutotou li. Fondasyon a chanm akote yo te yon bwa kann nèt de <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">41:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 40:5">Éz 40:5</ref></char></note>sis gran koude. <verse eid="EZK 41:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 41:9"/>Gwosè a miray eksteryè pou chanm akote yo te senk koude. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">41:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 41:11">Éz 41:11</ref></char></note>Men espas lib antre chanm akote yo te apatyen a tanp lan. <verse eid="EZK 41:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 41:10"/>Antre <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">41:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 40:17">Éz 40:17</ref></char></note>chanm yo te yon espas de ven koude toutotou tanp lan nan tout akote yo. <verse eid="EZK 41:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 41:11"/>Pòtay a chanm akote yo vè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">41:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 41:9">Éz 41:9</ref></char></note>espas lib la te yon sèl pòtay vè nò a ak yon lòt pòtay vè sid. Lajè a espas lib la te senk koude toutotou li.<verse eid="EZK 41:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 41:12"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">41:12 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 41:13-15">Éz 41:13-15</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Konstriksyon ki te devan kote ki apa nan bò vè lwès la, te swasann-dis koude lajè; epi miray a konstriksyon an te senk koude nan gwosè nan toutotou li e longè li te katre-ven-dis koude.<verse eid="EZK 41:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 41:13"/>Konsa, li te mezire tanp lan, yon santèn koude nan longè a; epi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">41:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 41:13-15">Éz 41:13-15</ref></char></note>kote apa a, konstriksyon an, ak miray li yo, te osi san koude nan longè. <verse eid="EZK 41:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 41:14"/>Anplis, lajè pa devan a tanp lan e lajè a kote apa yo avèk kote lès la, te vin fè total, san koude.<verse eid="EZK 41:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 41:15"/>Li te mezire longè a konstriksyon an avèk devan kote apa a dèyè li a, ak yon galri nan chak bò, san koude. Li te osi mezire enteryè a chanm gran asanble a, ak galri lakou yo, <verse eid="EZK 41:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 41:16"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">41:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 6:4">És 6:4</ref></char></note>papòt yo, fenèt ak gri yo, ak galri ki antoure twa etaj yo ki anfas papòt la, te fèt ak pano anbwa toupatou soti atè jis rive nan fenèt yo, (men fenèt yo menm te kouvri), <verse eid="EZK 41:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 41:17"/>rive nan antre a, nan anndan kay la, nan deyò ak nan tout miray la toutotou li nèt, ni anndan ni deyò, te mezire. <verse eid="EZK 41:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 41:18"/>Li te grave ak <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">41:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 6:29-35">I Wa 6:29-35</ref></char></note>cheriben ak pye palmis; epi yon pye palmis te antre cheriben ak cheriben e chak cheriben te gen de figi, <verse eid="EZK 41:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 41:19"/>Figi a yon nonm vè pye palmis lan sou yon bò e figi a yon jenn lyon vè pye palmis lan sou lòtbò a. Yo te grave menm jan sou tout lakay toutotou li. <verse eid="EZK 41:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 41:20"/>Soti atè jis rive anwo, nan antre a, cheriben yo ak <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">41:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 41:18">Éz 41:18</ref></char></note>pye palmis yo te grave e sou miray a chanm gran asanble a tou.<verse eid="EZK 41:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 41:21"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">41:21 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 6:33">I Wa 6:33</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Pilye pòt a chanm gran asanble a te an fòm kare. Epi devan sanktyè a, aparans a yon pilye pòt te menm ak lòt la. <verse eid="EZK 41:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 41:22"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">41:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 30:1-3">Egz 30:1-3</ref></char></note>Lotèl la te fèt an bwa, twa koude nan wotè e longè a, de koude. Kwen li yo, baz li e akote li yo te an bwa. Epi li te di mwen: “Sa se tab ki devan SENYÈ a.” <verse eid="EZK 41:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 41:23"/>Gran chanm asanble a ak sanktyè a, yo chak te gen yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">41:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 6:31-35">I Wa 6:31-35</ref></char></note>pòt doub. <verse eid="EZK 41:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 41:24"/>Chak nan pòt yo te gen de fèy, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">41:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 6:34">I Wa 6:34</ref></char></note>de fèy ki koube plwaye ouvri fèmen; de fèy pou yon pòt e de fèy pou lòt la. <verse eid="EZK 41:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 41:25"/>Anplis, te gen grave sou yo, sou pòt chanm gran asanble a, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">41:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 41:18">Éz 41:18</ref></char></note>cheriben ak pye palmis yo tankou sila ki te grave sou miray yo. Epi te gen yon papòt an bwa devan galeri pa deyò. <verse eid="EZK 41:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 41:26"/>Te gen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">41:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 41:16">Éz 41:16</ref></char></note>fenèt ak gri yo, ak pye palmis yo sou yon bò ak yon lòt, sou kote galeri yo. Se konsa chanm akote ak papòt kay yo te ye.<verse eid="EZK 41:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 41"/>
  <chapter number="42" style="c" sid="EZK 42"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 42:1"/>Epi li te mennen mwen deyò nan lakou a, nan chemen vè nò a. Li te mennen m nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">42:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 40:17">Éz 40:17</ref></char></note>chanm ki te anfas kote apa a, ak anfas konstriksyon an vè nò. <verse eid="EZK 42:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 42:2"/>Avèk longè a, ki te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">42:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 41:13">Éz 41:13</ref></char></note>san koude a, se te pòt nò a; lajè a te senkant koude. <verse eid="EZK 42:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 42:3"/>Anfas ven koude ki te pou lakou enteryè a, e anfas <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">42:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 40:17">Éz 40:17</ref></char></note>pave ki te apatyen a lakou eksteryè a, se te galri ki te koresponn ak galeri sou twa etaj yo. <verse eid="EZK 42:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 42:4"/>Devan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">42:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 46:19">Éz 46:19</ref></char></note>chanm yo, se te yon machpye pa anndan de dis koude nan lajè, yon chemen de san koude nan longè, epi ouvèti pa yo te vè nò. <verse eid="EZK 42:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 42:5"/>Alò, chanm anlè yo te pi piti akoz <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">42:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 42:3">Éz 42:3</ref></char></note>galri yo te pran plis espas sou yo ke sila nan baz ak mitan etaj nan konstriksyon yo. <verse eid="EZK 42:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 42:6"/>Paske se nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">42:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 41:6">Éz 41:6</ref></char></note>twa etaj yo te ye e pa t gen pilye tankou pilye nan lakou yo. Akoz sa, chanm anlè yo te vin pi etwat ke mitan ak piba yo. <verse eid="EZK 42:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 42:7"/>Pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">42:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 42:10-12">Éz 42:10-12</ref></char></note>miray eksteryè bò chanm yo, vè lakou deyò anfas chanm yo, longè li te senkant koude. <verse eid="EZK 42:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 42:8"/>Paske longè a chanm ki te nan lakou eksteryè yo te senkant koude. Epi gade byen, longè a sila anfas tanp yo te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">42:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 44:5">Éz 44:5</ref></char></note>san koude. <verse eid="EZK 42:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 42:9"/>Pi ba chanm sa yo, se te antre sou kote lès la, kote yon moun ka antre nan yo soti nan lakou eksteryè a.<verse eid="EZK 42:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 42:10"/>Nan epesè miray la sou kote lès, anfas kote apa a e anfas konstriksyon an, te gen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">42:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 40:17">Éz 40:17</ref></char></note>chanm yo. <verse eid="EZK 42:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 42:11"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">42:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 42:4">Éz 42:4</ref></char></note>Chemen devan yo a te sanble ak chanm ki te sou kote nò yo. Selon longè yo, konsa lajè yo te ye e tout kote pou antre sòti yo te menm selon aranjman ak ouvèti pa yo. <verse eid="EZK 42:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 42:12"/>Nan koresponn a pòt chanm ki te vè sid yo, te gen yon pòt nan tèt chemen an, chemen devan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">42:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 42:7">Éz 42:7</ref></char></note>miray ki te vè lès la, kote yon moun ta antre ladan yo.<verse eid="EZK 42:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 42:13"/>Konsa, li te di mwen: “Chanm nò yo ak chanm sid yo, ki anfas a kote apa a, yo se <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">42:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 29:31">Egz 29:31</ref></char></note>chanm sen kote prèt ki rapwoche de SENYÈ a va manje bagay ki sen pase tout lòt yo. La, yo va fè poze bagay pi sen yo, ofrann sereyal la, ofrann peche ak ofrann koupabilite a; paske kote sa a sen. <verse eid="EZK 42:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 42:14"/>Lè prèt yo antre, alò yo p ap sòti nan lakou eksteryè a lè yo kite sanktyè a san ke yo pa mete la vètman ak sila yo fè sèvis la, paske yo sen. Yo va mete lòt vètman sou yo; nan lè sa a, yo va pwoche sa ki pou pèp la.”<verse eid="EZK 42:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 42:15"/>Alò, lè l te fin mezire kay enteryè a, li te mennen mwen deyò pa chemen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">42:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 40:6">Éz 40:6</ref></char></note>pòtay ki te bay fas vè lès la e te mezire li toupatou. <verse eid="EZK 42:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 42:16"/>Li te mezire kote lès la ak baton mezi a, senk-san baton pa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">42:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 40:3">Éz 40:3</ref></char></note>mezi baton an. <verse eid="EZK 42:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 42:17"/>Li te mezire kote nò a, senk-san baton pa mezi baton an. <verse eid="EZK 42:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 42:18"/>Nan sid, li te mezire senk-san baton ak mezi baton an. <verse eid="EZK 42:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 42:19"/>Li te vire kote lwès e li te mezire senk-san baton ak mezi baton an. <verse eid="EZK 42:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 42:20"/>Li te mezire li nan kat kote yo. Li te gen yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">42:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 60:18">És 60:18</ref></char></note>miray ki te antoure l nèt; longè ki te senk-san ak lajè ki te senk-san an, pou te divize antre sa ki sen ak sa ki pwofàn.<verse eid="EZK 42:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 42"/>
  <chapter number="43" style="c" sid="EZK 43"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 43:1"/>Nan lè sa a, li te mennen m nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">43:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 10:19">Éz 10:19</ref></char></note>pòtay la; pòtay ki gen fas li vè lès la; <verse eid="EZK 43:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 43:2"/>Epi gade byen, glwa Bondye Israël la t ap vini soti nan chemen lès la. Vwa Li te tankou son anpil dlo; epi tè a te limen ak glwa Li. <verse eid="EZK 43:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 43:3"/>Epi se te tankou vizyon ke m te fè a, tankou vizyon ke m te fè lè Li te vini pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">43:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 1:10">Jr 1:10</ref></char></note>detwi vil la. Epi vizyon yo te tankou vizyon ke m te fè bò kote rivyè Kebar a; epi mwen te tonbe sou figi m. <verse eid="EZK 43:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 43:4"/>Konsa, glwa SENYÈ a te vini nan kay la pa chemen pòtay ki te gen fas li vè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">43:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 10:19">Éz 10:19</ref></char></note>lès la. <verse eid="EZK 43:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 43:5"/>Epi Lespri a te leve m anlè e te mennen m antre nan lakou enteryè a; epi gade byen, glwa SENYÈ a te ranpli kay la.<verse eid="EZK 43:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 43:6"/>Nan lè sa a, mwen te tande yon moun ki t ap pale ak mwen soti nan kay la, pandan yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">43:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 1:26">Éz 1:26</ref></char></note>nonm te kanpe akote mwen. <verse eid="EZK 43:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 43:7"/>Li te di mwen: “Fis a lòm, sa se plas pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">43:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 47:8">Sòm 47:8</ref></char></note>twòn Mwen an, ak plas machpye Mwen an, kote Mwen va demere pami fis Israël yo jis pou tout tan. Lakay Israël p ap souye non sen Mwen an ankò, ni yo menm ni wa yo, pa zak pwostitisyon yo, e pa kadav a wa yo lè yo fin mouri, <verse eid="EZK 43:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 43:8"/>lè yo te mete papòt pa yo akote papòt pa Mwen, poto pòt pa yo akote poto pòt pa Mwen. Te gen yon miray ki te antre Mwen ak yo. Epi yo te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">43:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 8:3-16">Éz 8:3-16</ref></char></note>souye non sen Mwen an ak abominasyon ke yo te komèt yo. Pou sa, Mwen te konsonmen yo nan gwo kòlè Mwen. <verse eid="EZK 43:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 43:9"/>Koulye a, kite yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">43:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 18:30-31">Éz 18:30-31</ref></char></note>mete akote zak pwostitisyon yo ak kadav a wa yo byen lwen Mwen. Konsa, Mwen va demere pami yo jis pou tout tan.”<verse eid="EZK 43:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 43:10"/>“Pou ou menm, fis a lòm, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">43:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 40:4">Éz 40:4</ref></char></note>bay detay a tanp lan a lakay Israël, pou yo ka wont de inikite yo; epi kite yo mezire plan an. <verse eid="EZK 43:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 43:11"/>Si yo vin wont de tout sa ke yo te fè yo, fè yo konnen dizay kay la, fòm li, antre ak sòti li yo, dizay li, tout règleman ak tout lwa li yo. Ekri li <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">43:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 12:3">Éz 12:3</ref></char></note>devan zye yo pou yo ka wè tout dizay ak tout règleman li yo pou fè yo.<verse eid="EZK 43:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 43:12"/>“Sa se lwa kay la: tout espas toutozanviwon anwo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">43:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 40:2">Éz 40:2</ref></char></note>mòn nan va sen pase tout kote. Gade byen, sa se lwa kay la.”<verse eid="EZK 43:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 43:13"/>“Epi sa yo se mezi lotèl la an koude <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">43:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 40:5">Éz 40:5</ref></char></note>(koude ki se yon koude plis mezi yon pla men): baz la va yon koude, lajè a va yon koude e arebò sou akote a va anviwon yon anpan; epi sa va wotè a baz lotèl la. <verse eid="EZK 43:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 43:14"/>Soti nan baz atè a pou rive <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">43:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 43:17-20">Éz 43:17-20</ref></char></note>piba ankadreman an, li va de koude, e lajè a va yon koude; epi soti nan pi piti ankadreman an pou rive nan pi gran ankadreman an, li va kat koude e lajè a va yon koude. <verse eid="EZK 43:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 43:15"/>Fou chofaj lotèl la va kat koude; epi soti nan fou chofaj la, kat kòn yo va monte anwo a. <verse eid="EZK 43:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 43:16"/>Alò, fou lotèl la va longè a douz koude pa douz nan lajè, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">43:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 27:1">Egz 27:1</ref></char></note>ak kare nan kat kote li yo. <verse eid="EZK 43:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 43:17"/>Ankadreman an va katòz koude nan longè, katòz nan lajè nan kat kote li yo, arebò li va mwatye koude a e baz li va yon koude toutozanviwon li; epi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">43:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:26">Egz 20:26</ref></char></note>eskalye li yo va bay fas vè lès.”<verse eid="EZK 43:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 43:18"/>Epi Li te di mwen: “Fis a lòm, konsa pale Senyè BONDYE a: ‘Sila yo se règleman pou lotèl la nan jou ke li bati a, pou ofri <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">43:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 40:29">Egz 40:29</ref></char></note>ofrann brile sou li e pou flite san sou li. <verse eid="EZK 43:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 43:19"/>‘Ou va bay a prèt Levit ki sòti nan fanmi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">43:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 2:35">I Wa 2:35</ref></char></note>Tsadok yo, ki rapwoche de Mwen pou fè sèvis Mwen yo,’ deklare Senyè BONDYE a, ‘yon jenn towo pou yon ofrann peche. <verse eid="EZK 43:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 43:20"/>‘Ou va pran kèk nan san li, mete li sou kat <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">43:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 8:15">Lev 8:15</ref></char></note>kòn yo, sou kat kwen ankadreman an ak toutotou arebò a. Konsa, ou va fè l vin pwòp e fè ekspiyasyon pou li. <verse eid="EZK 43:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 43:21"/>Ou va, anplis, pran towo pou ofrann peche a, e li va vin <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">43:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 29:14">Egz 29:14</ref></char></note>brile nan kote ki chwazi nan kay la deyò sanktiyè a.<verse eid="EZK 43:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 43:22"/>“‘Nan dezyèm jou a, ou va ofri yon mal kabrit san defo kon ofrann peche, e yo va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">43:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 43:20-26">Éz 43:20-26</ref></char></note>netwaye lotèl la jan yo te netwaye li ak towo a. <verse eid="EZK 43:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 43:23"/>Lè ou fin netwaye li, ou va prezante yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">43:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 29:1-10">Egz 29:1-10</ref></char></note>jenn towo san defo ak yon belye san defo ki soti nan bann mouton an. <verse eid="EZK 43:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 43:24"/>Ou va prezante yo devan SENYÈ a; prèt yo va jete <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">43:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 2:13">Lev 2:13</ref></char></note>sèl sou yo e yo va ofri yo kon ofrann brile a SENYÈ a.<verse eid="EZK 43:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 43:25"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">43:25 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 29:35-37">Egz 29:35-37</ref>
      </char>
    </note>“‘Pandan sèt jou, ou va prepare chak jou yon kabrit kon ofrann peche; anplis, yon jenn towo ak yon belye san defo ki soti nan bann mouton an, va vin prepare. <verse eid="EZK 43:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 43:26"/>Pandan sèt jou, yo va fè ekspiyasyon pou lotèl la e fè l vin pwòp; se konsa yo va konsakre li. <verse eid="EZK 43:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZK 43:27"/>Lè yo fin konplete nonb de jou yo, li va rive ke nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">43:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 9:1">Lev 9:1</ref></char></note>uityèm jou a e kontinye, prèt yo va ofri ofrann brile pa nou an sou otèl la ak ofrann lapè nou yo. Konsa, Mwen va aksepte nou,’ deklare Senyè BONDYE a.’”<verse eid="EZK 43:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 43"/>
  <chapter number="44" style="c" sid="EZK 44"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 44:1"/>Nan lè sa a, Li te mennen m retounen pa chemen a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">44:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 40:6-17">Éz 40:6-17</ref></char></note>pòtay eksteryè sanktiyè a, ki bay fas li vè lès la; epi li te fèmen. <verse eid="EZK 44:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 44:2"/>SENYÈ a te di mwen: “Pòtay sa a va fèmen. Li p ap louvri, ni pèsòn p ap janm antre pa li, paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">44:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 43:2-4">Éz 43:2-4</ref></char></note>SENYÈ Bondye Israël la te, antre pa li. Akoz sa, li va fèmen. <verse eid="EZK 44:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 44:3"/>Pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">44:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 34:24">Éz 34:24</ref></char></note>prens lan, li va chita ladann tankou prens pou manje pen devan SENYÈ a. Li va antre pa chemen galri pòtay la, e li va sòti pa menm chemen an.”<verse eid="EZK 44:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 44:4"/>Epi li te mennen m pa chemen pòtay nò a pou rive devan kay la. Konsa, mwen te gade e vwala <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">44:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 6:3-4">És 6:3-4</ref></char></note>glwa SENYÈ a te ranpli lakay SENYÈ a, e mwen te tonbe sou figi m.<verse eid="EZK 44:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 44:5"/>SENYÈ a te di mwen: “Fis a lòm, make byen, gade ak zye ou, e tande ak zòrèy ou tout sa ke M di ou konsènan tout <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">44:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 12:32">Det 12:32</ref></char></note>règleman lakay SENYÈ yo, e konsènan tout lwa li yo. Epi make byen antre kay la, ak tout sòti ki gen nan sanktyè a. <verse eid="EZK 44:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 44:6"/>Ou va di a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">44:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 2:5-7">Éz 2:5-7</ref></char></note>sila k ap fè rebèl yo: ‘Senyè BONDYE la di: “Se kont! Sispann fè tout abominasyon nou yo, O lakay Israël. <verse eid="EZK 44:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 44:7"/>Lè nou te mennen etranje yo antre, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">44:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 26:41">Lev 26:41</ref></char></note>ensikonsi nan kè yo ak ensikonsi nan chè yo, pou antre nan sanktyè Mwen an, pou pwofane li, menm lakay Mwen an, lè nou te ofri manje Mwen an, grès ak san an; paske yo te anile akò Mwen an—tout sa, anplis de tout abominasyon nou yo. <verse eid="EZK 44:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 44:8"/>Epi nou pa t <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">44:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 22:2">Lev 22:2</ref></char></note>rete responsab nou menm, de bagay sen Mwen yo, men te mete etranje yo responsab de sanktiyè mwen an.” <verse eid="EZK 44:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 44:9"/>Konsa pale Senyè BONDYE a: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">44:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 44:7">Éz 44:7</ref></char></note>“Okenn etranje ensikonsi nan kè, ak ensikonsi nan chè, tout etranje ki pami fis Israël yo, p ap antre nan sanktyè pa M nan.<verse eid="EZK 44:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 44:10"/>“‘“Men Levit ki te ale lwen Mwen lè Israël te vin egare a, ki te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">44:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 23:8-9">II Wa 23:8-9</ref></char></note>vin egare kite Mwen ki t ap kouri dèyè zidòl yo, va pote pinisyon pou inikite pa yo. <verse eid="EZK 44:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 44:11"/>Malgre sa, yo va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">44:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 3:5-37">Nonb 3:5-37</ref></char></note>fè sèvis nan sanktiyè Mwen an, pou gen zye sou pòtay kay yo, ak fè sèvis nan kay la. Yo va touye ofrann brile ak sakrifis pou pèp la, e yo va kanpe devan yo pou fè sèvis. <verse eid="EZK 44:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 44:12"/>Akoz yo te fè sèvis pou yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">44:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 16:10-16">II Wa 16:10-16</ref></char></note>devan zidòl yo, e yo te vin yon wòch chite, inikite, pou lakay Israël; akoz sa, Mwen te sèmante kont yo”, deklare Senyè BONDYE a: “Ke yo va pote pinisyon pou inikite pa yo a. <verse eid="EZK 44:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 44:13"/>Konsa, yo p ap <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">44:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 18:3">Nonb 18:3</ref></char></note>vin rapwoche de Mwen, pou sèvi kon prèt pou Mwen, ni vin rapwoche de okenn nan bagay sen Mwen yo, vè bagay ki sen pase tout lòt yo; men yo va pote wont ak abominasyon ke yo te fè yo. <verse eid="EZK 44:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 44:14"/>Malgre sa, Mwen va deziye yo pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">44:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 18:4">Nonb 18:4</ref></char></note>kenbe responsabilite kay la, pou tout sèvis ak tout sa k ap fèt ladann.<verse eid="EZK 44:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 44:15"/>“‘“Men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">44:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 33:18-22">Jr 33:18-22</ref></char></note>prèt Levit yo, fis a Tsadok yo, ki te kenbe responsabilite sanktyè pa M nan lè fis Israël yo te vin egare kite Mwen an, va vin rapwoche de Mwen pou fè sèvis pou Mwen. Yo va kanpe devan M pou ofri Mwen grès ak san an,” deklare Senyè BONDYE a. <verse eid="EZK 44:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 44:16"/>Yo va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">44:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 18:5-8">Nonb 18:5-8</ref></char></note>antre nan sanktiyè Mwen an. Yo va vin rapwoche de tab Mwen an pou fè sèvis Mwen, e kenbe responsabilite Mwe,n an.<verse eid="EZK 44:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 44:17"/>“‘“Li va fèt ke lè yo antre nan pòtay lakou enteryè yo, yo va abiye ak <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">44:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 28:42-43">Egz 28:42-43</ref></char></note>vètman len. Epi lenn p ap sou yo pandan y ap fè sèvis nan pòtay lakou enteryè yo ak anndan kay yo. <verse eid="EZK 44:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 44:18"/>Moso twal an len va sou tèt yo e souvètman fèt ak len va nan ren yo. Yo p ap abiye ak okenn bagay ki pou fè yo swè. <verse eid="EZK 44:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 44:19"/>Lè yo sòti deyò vè pèp la, nan lakou deyò a, yo va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">44:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 6:10">Lev 6:10</ref></char></note>retire vètman yo te sèvi nan fè sèvis la, e lage yo nan chanm sen yo. Yo va mete lòt vètman pou yo pa transmèt sentete a pèp la avèk vètman yo.<verse eid="EZK 44:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 44:20"/>“‘“Anplis, yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">44:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 21:5">Lev 21:5</ref></char></note>p ap pase razwa nan tèt yo, ni yo p ap kite cheve a vin long. Se sèl cheve nan tèt yo y ap koupe. <verse eid="EZK 44:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 44:21"/>Ni <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">44:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 10:9">Lev 10:9</ref></char></note>okenn nan prèt yo pa pou bwè divin pandan y ap antre nan lakou enteryè a. <verse eid="EZK 44:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 44:22"/>Epi yo p ap marye ak yon vèv ni yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">44:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 21:7-14">Lev 21:7-14</ref></char></note>fanm divòse, men yo va pran vyèj ki soti nan desandan lakay Israël yo, oswa yon vèv ki se vèv a yon prèt. <verse eid="EZK 44:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 44:23"/>Anplis, yo va enstwi pèp Mwen an pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">44:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 10:10">Lev 10:10</ref></char></note>distenge antre sa ki sen ak sa ki pwofàn, e fè yo distenge antre sa ki pa pwòp ak sa ki pwòp.<verse eid="EZK 44:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 44:24"/>“‘“Nan yon diskisyon, yo va kanpe pran plas yo pou jije. Yo va jije sa selon òdonans Mwen yo. Yo va anplis, kenbe lwa M yo, ak règleman Mwen yo, nan tout <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">44:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 23:2-4">Lev 23:2-4</ref></char></note>fèt chwazi Mwen yo. Yo va kenbe tout Saba Mwen yo sen.<verse eid="EZK 44:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 44:25"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">44:25 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 21:1-4">Lev 21:1-4</ref>
      </char>
    </note>“‘“Yo p ap ale kote yon moun mouri pou yo vin souye; sepandan, pou papa, manman, pou fis, fi, pou frè, oswa yon sè ki pa t gen mari, yo kapab souye tèt yo. <verse eid="EZK 44:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 44:26"/>Aprè li fin <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">44:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 19:13-19">Nonb 19:13-19</ref></char></note>netwaye, sèt jou va ekoule pou li. <verse eid="EZK 44:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZK 44:27"/>Nan jou ke li antre nan sanktiyè a, nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">44:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 44:17">Éz 44:17</ref></char></note>lakou enteryè pou fè sèvis nan sanktiyè a, li va ofri lofrann peche pa li a”, deklare Senyè BONDYE a.<verse eid="EZK 44:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZK 44:28"/>“‘Epi sa va konsidere kon yon eritaj pou yo, ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">44:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 18:20">Nonb 18:20</ref></char></note>se Mwen ki eritaj yo; epi ou p ap bay yo okenn posesyon an Israël——se Mwen menm ki posesyon yo. <verse eid="EZK 44:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EZK 44:29"/>Yo va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">44:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 18:9-14">Nonb 18:9-14</ref></char></note>manje ofrann sereyal la, ofrann peche a, ak ofrann koupabilite; epi tout bagay ki konsakre an Israël va pou yo. <verse eid="EZK 44:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EZK 44:30"/>Premye a tout premye fwi tout kalite ak tout don a tout kalite soti nan tout sa nou kontribye va pou prèt yo. Nou va, anplis, bay prèt la premye nan bòl farin nou yo, pou fè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">44:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAL 3:10">Mal 3:10</ref></char></note>benediksyon vin poze sou lakay nou. <verse eid="EZK 44:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EZK 44:31"/>Prèt yo p ap manje okenn zwazo, bèt ki te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">44:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 22:8">Lev 22:8</ref></char></note>mouri pa mò natirèl, oswa ki te dechire an mòso.<verse eid="EZK 44:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 44"/>
  <chapter number="45" style="c" sid="EZK 45"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 45:1"/>“‘“Anplis, lè ou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">45:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 34:13">Nonb 34:13</ref></char></note>divize pa tiraj osò, peyi eritaj la, ou va ofri yon pòsyon a SENYÈ a, yon pòsyon sen nan tè a. Longè li va venn-senk-mil koude, e lajè li va ven-mil koude. Li va sen anndan toutozanviwon lizyè li yo. <verse eid="EZK 45:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 45:2"/>Sòti nan pòsyon sa a, va gen pou kote sen an, yon pòsyon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">45:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 42:20">Éz 42:20</ref></char></note>senk-san koude pa senk-san koude, ak yon espas ouvri de senkant koude nan lajè ki antoure li. <verse eid="EZK 45:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 45:3"/>Soti kote sa a, ou va mezire yon longè venn-senk-mil koude ak yon lajè di-mil koude. Nan li, va gen sanktiyè a, kote ki sen pase tout kote a. <verse eid="EZK 45:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 45:4"/>Se va pòsyon ki sen nan peyi a. Li va pou prèt yo, sèvitè sanktiyè yo, ki te vin rapwoche pou fè sèvis SENYÈ a. Li va yon kote pou lakay yo e yon kote ki sen pou sanktiyè a. <verse eid="EZK 45:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 45:5"/>Yon kote <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">45:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 48:13">Éz 48:13</ref></char></note>venn-senk-mil koude nan longè e di-mil koude nan lajè va pou Levit yo, sèvitè kay yo ak posesyon pa yo, vil pou yo rete ladann.<verse eid="EZK 45:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 45:6"/>“‘“Ou va bay <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">45:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 48:15-18">Éz 48:15-18</ref></char></note>vil la yon pòsyon senk-mil koude nan lajè, ak venn-senk-mil koude nan longè, k ap akote pòsyon sen an. Sa va pou tout kay Israël la nèt.”<verse eid="EZK 45:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 45:7"/>“‘“Prens lan va gen tè a sou toude kote pòsyon sen an, ki pou vil la, akote espas sen an ak tè vil la, sou kote lwès vè lwès la, e sou kote lès vè lès la, ki koresponn nan longè a youn nan pòsyon a pòsyon yo, k ap sòti nan lizyè lwès peyi a, pou rive nan lizyè lès la. <verse eid="EZK 45:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 45:8"/>Nan peyi a, sa va tèren pa li an Israël. Epi prens Mwen yo p ap <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">45:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 11:3-5">És 11:3-5</ref></char></note>oprime pèp Mwen an ankò, men yo va kite lakay Israël gen tè selon tribi pa yo.”<verse eid="EZK 45:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 45:9"/>“‘Konsa pale Senyè BONDYE a: “Se ase! Nou menm ki prens an Israël yo! Kite vyolans ak destriksyon an pou pratike <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">45:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 22:3">Jr 22:3</ref></char></note>lajistis ak ladwati! Sispann fè piyaj sou pèp Mwen an,” deklare Senyè BONDYE a. <verse eid="EZK 45:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 45:10"/>“Ou va gen balans ki <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">45:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 19:36">Lev 19:36</ref></char></note>peze byen, yon mezi efa, ak yon mezi bat ki jis. <verse eid="EZK 45:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 45:11"/>Mezi efa a ak bat la va gen menm fòs, jiskaske yon mezi bat, gen yon dizyèm <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">45:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 5:10">És 5:10</ref></char></note>omè e yon mezi efa gen yon dizyèm omè; se selon omè yo va regle. <verse eid="EZK 45:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 45:12"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">45:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 30:13">Egz 30:13</ref></char></note>Sekèl la va gen ven gera; ven sekèl, plis venn-senk sekèl, plis kenz sekèl va sèvi kon mezi min ou.”<verse eid="EZK 45:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 45:13"/>“‘“Men ofrann ke ou va ofri a: yon sizyèm efa soti nan yon omè ble; yon sizyèm efa soti nan yon omè lòj; <verse eid="EZK 45:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 45:14"/>Epi pòsyon lwil la jan li etabli a; yon dizyèm bat soti nan chak kò, (kò a tankou omè a, gen 10 bat). <verse eid="EZK 45:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 45:15"/>Epi yon mouton soti nan chak bann mouton ak de-san bèt ki soti kote ki awoze an Israël yo——pou yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">45:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 45:17">Éz 45:17</ref></char></note>ofrann sereyal, yon ofrann brile, ak ofrann lapè yo, pou fè ekspiyasyon pou yo”, deklare Senyè BONDYE a. <verse eid="EZK 45:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 45:16"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">45:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 30:14-15">Egz 30:14-15</ref></char></note>“Tout pèp peyi a va bay ofrann sa a pou prens Israël la. <verse eid="EZK 45:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 45:17"/>Se va devwa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">45:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 46:4-12">Éz 46:4-12</ref></char></note>prens lan pou founi ofrann brile yo, ofrann sereyal yo ak ofrann bwason yo nan fèt yo, nan fèt nouvèl lalin yo, nan Saba yo, nan tout fèt etabli pou lakay Israël yo. Li va founi ofrann peche a, ofrann sereyal la ak ofrann brile a, pou fè ekspiyasyon pou lakay Israël.”<verse eid="EZK 45:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 45:18"/>“‘Konsa pale Senyè BONDYE a: “Nan premye mwa a, nan premye nan mwa a, ou va pran yon jenn towo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">45:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 22:20">Lev 22:20</ref></char></note>san defo pou netwaye sanktiyè a. <verse eid="EZK 45:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 45:19"/>Prèt la va pran kèk nan san soti nan ofrann peche a pou mete li sou poto pòt yo, nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">45:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 16:18-20">Lev 16:18-20</ref></char></note>kat kwen ankadreman lotèl la ak sou poto pòtay la nan lakou enteryè a tanp lan. <verse eid="EZK 45:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 45:20"/>Konsa nou va fè nan setyèm jou nan mwa a pou tout moun ki <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">45:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 4:27">Lev 4:27</ref></char></note>vin egare kite chemen dwat la, oswa ki fè enpridans. Konsa ou va fè ekspiyasyon pou kay la.<verse eid="EZK 45:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 45:21"/>“‘“Nan premye mwa a, nan katòzyèm jou nan mwa a, ou va fè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">45:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 12:1-24">Egz 12:1-24</ref></char></note>Pak la, yon fèt pandan sèt jou; pen san ledven va manje. <verse eid="EZK 45:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 45:22"/>Nan jou sa a, prens lan va founi pou tèt li ak tout pèp peyi a, yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">45:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 4:14">Lev 4:14</ref></char></note>towo pou yon ofrann peche. <verse eid="EZK 45:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 45:23"/>Pandan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">45:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 23:8">Lev 23:8</ref></char></note>sèt jou nan fèt la, li va founi kon yon ofrann brile a SENYÈ a sèt towo ak sèt belye san defo chak jou nan sèt jou yo ak yon mal kabrit chak jou kon yon ofrann peche. <verse eid="EZK 45:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 45:24"/>Li va founi kon yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">45:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 28:12-15">Nonb 28:12-15</ref></char></note>ofrann sereyal, yon efa ak yon towo, yon efa ak yon belye, e yon mezi lwil ak yon efa.”<verse eid="EZK 45:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 45:25"/>“‘“Nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">45:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 23:33-43">Lev 23:33-43</ref></char></note>setyèm mwa a, nan kenzyèm jou a, nan fèt la, li va founi konsa, sèt jou pou ofrann peche a, ofrann brile a, ofrann sereyal la ak lwil la.”<verse eid="EZK 45:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 45"/>
  <chapter number="46" style="c" sid="EZK 46"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 46:1"/>“‘Konsa pale Senyè BONDYE a: “Pòtay pou lakou enteryè ki bay fas vè lès la va fèmen pandan sis <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">46:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:9">Egz 20:9</ref></char></note>jou travay yo; men li va ouvri nan Saba a, e li va vin ouvri nan jou nouvèl lin nan. <verse eid="EZK 46:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 46:2"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">46:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 44:3">Éz 44:3</ref></char></note>Prens lan va antre pa chemen galri a, soti deyò pou kanpe akote poto pòtay la. Epi prèt yo va founi ofrann brile li yo ak ofrann lapè li yo, li va adore nan papòt pòtay la, e li va sòti. Men pòtay la p ap fèmen jis rive nan aswè. <verse eid="EZK 46:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 46:3"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">46:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 1:10">Luc 1:10</ref></char></note>Pèp peyi a osi va adore nan papòt pòtay la devan SENYÈ a, nan Saba yo, ak nouvèl lin yo. <verse eid="EZK 46:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 46:4"/>Ofrann brile ke prens lan va ofri a SENYÈ a nan jou Saba, a va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">46:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 28:9">Nonb 28:9</ref></char></note>sis jenn mouton san defo, ak yon belye san defo; <verse eid="EZK 46:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 46:5"/>epi ofrann <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">46:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 28:12">Nonb 28:12</ref></char></note>sereyal la va yon efa ak belye a, ofrann sereyal la ak jenn mouton yo, va kantite ke li kapab bay la e yon mezi lwil ak yon efa. <verse eid="EZK 46:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 46:6"/>Nan jou nouvèl <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">46:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 46:1">Éz 46:1</ref></char></note>lin nan, li va ofri yon jenn towo san defo; anplis, sis jenn mouton ak yon belye ki san defo. <verse eid="EZK 46:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 46:7"/>Epi li va founi yon ofrann sereyal, yon efa ak towo a, yon efa ak belye a, ak jenn mouton yo, kantite ke li kapab bay la, yon mezi lwil ak yon efa. <verse eid="EZK 46:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 46:8"/>Lè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">46:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 44:3">Éz 44:3</ref></char></note>prens lan antre, li va antre pa galri pòtay la, e li va sòti pa menm chemen an.”<verse eid="EZK 46:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 46:9"/>“‘“Men lè pèp peyi a vini <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">46:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 34:23">Egz 34:23</ref></char></note>devan SENYÈ la nan fèt chwazi yo, sila ki antre pa pòtay nò pou adore a, va sòti pa pòtay sid la. Epi sila ki antre pa pòtay sid la, va sòti pa pòtay nò a. Pèsòn pa pou retounen pa menm chemen ke li te antre a, men li va sòti tou dwat. <verse eid="EZK 46:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 46:10"/>Lè yo antre, prens lan va antre <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">46:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 6:14-15">II Sam 6:14-15</ref></char></note>pami yo; epi lè yo sòti, li va sòti.”<verse eid="EZK 46:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 46:11"/>“‘“Nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">46:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 45:17">Éz 45:17</ref></char></note>fèt ak jou fèt chwazi yo, ofrann sereyal yo va yon efa ak yon towo, yon efa ak yon belye, ak jenn mouton yo, kantite ke l ap kapab bay la, yon mezi lwil ak yon efa. <verse eid="EZK 46:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 46:12"/>Lè prens lan founi yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">46:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 23:38">Lev 23:38</ref></char></note>ofrann bòn volonte, yon ofrann brile, oswa ofrann lapè kon ofrann bòn volonte a SENYÈ la, pòtay vè lès la va vin ouvri pou li. Epi li va founi ofrann brile pa li a, ak ofrann lapè li a, jan li konn fè nan jou Saba a. Epi li va sòti e pòtay la va vin fèmen lè li fin sòti.<verse eid="EZK 46:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 46:13"/>“‘“Epi ou va founi yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">46:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 28:3-5">Nonb 28:3-5</ref></char></note>mouton yon lane, san defo pou yon ofrann brile a SENYÈ a chak jou; chak maten, ou va founi li. <verse eid="EZK 46:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 46:14"/>Anplis, ou va founi yon ofrann sereyal ak li chak maten, yon sizyèm efa ak yon tyè mezi lwil pou mouye farin fen an, yon ofrann sereyal a SENYÈ a tout tan selon yon òdonans ki p ap janm fini oubyen chanje. <verse eid="EZK 46:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 46:15"/>Konsa, yo va founi yon ofrann sereyal ak li chak maten, kon yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">46:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 29:42">Egz 29:42</ref></char></note>ofrann brile ki va fèt tout tan.”<verse eid="EZK 46:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 46:16"/>“‘Konsa pale Senyè BONDYE a: “Si prens lan bay yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">46:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 21:3">II Kwo 21:3</ref></char></note>don eritaj a nenpòt nan fis li yo, li va apatyen a fis li yo; se posesyon pa yo selon règleman eritaj la. <verse eid="EZK 46:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 46:17"/>Men si li bay yon don nan eritaj li a youn nan sèvitè li yo, sa va pou li jis rive nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">46:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 25:10">Lev 25:10</ref></char></note>ane libète a; epi li va retounen a prens lan. Eritaj li va sèl pou fis li yo; li va apatyen a yo menm. <verse eid="EZK 46:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 46:18"/>Prens lan pa pou pran nan eritaj a pèp la e mete yo deyò nan pwòp posesyon pa yo. Li va bay fis li yo yon eritaj k ap sòti nan pwòp posesyon pa li, pou pèp Mwen an pa vin divize, okenn moun, de posesyon pa li a.”’”<verse eid="EZK 46:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 46:19"/>Epi li te mennen m pase nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">46:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 42:9">Éz 42:9</ref></char></note>antre akote pòtay la, antre anndan chanm sen pou prèt yo, ki te bay fas vè nò. Epi gade byen, te gen yo plas pa dèyè nèt vè lwès. <verse eid="EZK 46:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 46:20"/>Li te di mwen: “Sa se plas kote prèt yo va bouyi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">46:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 35:13">II Kwo 35:13</ref></char></note>ofrann koupab ak ofrann peche a ak kote yo va kwit ofrann sereyal la, pou yo pa oblije mennen yo deyò nan lakou eksteryè a, pou l ta transmèt sentete a pèp la.”<verse eid="EZK 46:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 46:21"/>Konsa, li te mennen m deyò nan lakou eksteryè a, e te mennen m travèse kat kwen lakou a; epi gade byen; nan chak kwen lakou a, te gen yon ti lakou. <verse eid="EZK 46:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 46:22"/>Nan kat kwen lakou a, te gen ti lakou fèmen karant koude nan longè e trant koude nan lajè, yo tout te nan menm mezi. <verse eid="EZK 46:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 46:23"/>Te gen yon miray ki te antoure yo, antoure yo toule kat, e pozisyon pou bouyi yo a te fèt toutozanviwon anba mi yo. <verse eid="EZK 46:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 46:24"/>Epi li te di m: “Sila yo se plas bouyi kote sèvitè kay yo va bouyi sakrifis a pèp yo.”<verse eid="EZK 46:24"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 46"/>
  <chapter number="47" style="c" sid="EZK 47"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 47:1"/>Epi li te mennen m retounen nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">47:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 41:2">Éz 41:2</ref></char></note>pòt kay la; epi gade byen dlo t ap koule soti anba papòt kay la vè lès, paske kay la te bay fas vè lès. Epi dlo a t ap koule soti pa anba, soti akote dwat kay la, soti kote sid lotèl la. <verse eid="EZK 47:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 47:2"/>Li te mennen mwen deyò pa chemen pòtay nò a, epi te mennen m ozanviwon pa deyò rive nan pòtay eksteryè a, pa chemen pòtay ki bay fas vè lès la. Epi gade byen, dlo t ap koule soti nan kote sid la.<verse eid="EZK 47:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 47:3"/>Lè mesye a te sòti deyò vè lès ak yon kòd mezi nan men l, li te mezire mil koude, e li te mennen m pase nan dlo a, dlo ki te rive nan cheviy pye l yo. <verse eid="EZK 47:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 47:4"/>Ankò, li te mezire mil koude e li te mennen m pase nan dlo ki rive jis nan jenou yo. Ankò, li te mezire mil koude, e li te mennen m pase nan dlo ki rive nan senti a. <verse eid="EZK 47:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 47:5"/>Ankò, li te mezire mil koude; epi yon rivyè ke m pa t ka travèse, paske dlo a te vin leve, te gen ase dlo naje ladann, yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">47:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 11:9">És 11:9</ref></char></note>rivyè ki pa t ka janbe sou pye.<verse eid="EZK 47:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 47:6"/>Li te di m: “Fis a lòm, èske ou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">47:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 8:6">Éz 8:6</ref></char></note>wè sa a?” Konsa, li te mennen m retounen rive arebò rivyè a. <verse eid="EZK 47:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 47:7"/>Alò, lè m te retounen, gade byen, akote rivyè a, te gen anpil <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">47:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 60:13-21">És 60:13-21</ref></char></note>pyebwa nan yon kote yo ak nan lòt la. <verse eid="EZK 47:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 47:8"/>Li te di mwen: “Dlo sila yo sòti nan rejyon lès pou desann rive nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">47:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 3:17">Det 3:17</ref></char></note>dezè a. Depi la, yo kontinye vè lanmè, menm antre nan lanmè. Lanmè a ap soti, e dlo lanmè yo va geri. <verse eid="EZK 47:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 47:9"/>Li va vin rive ke tout kreyati vivan ki naje tout kote ke rivyè a ale, yo va viv. Konsa, va genyen anpil pwason, paske dlo sa yo ale la e dlo lanmè yo va geri. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">47:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 12:3">És 12:3</ref></char></note>Tout bagay va viv nenpòt kote rivyè a ale. <verse eid="EZK 47:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 47:10"/>Epi li va vin rive ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">47:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 4:19">Mat 4:19</ref></char></note>mesye lapèch yo va kanpe akote li. Soti En-Guédi jis rive En-Églaïm, va gen kote pou ouvri filè yo. Pwason pa yo va selon espès pa yo, tankou pwason Gwo Lanmè a, anpil, anpil. <verse eid="EZK 47:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 47:11"/>Men marekaj li yo ak fòs li yo p ap geri; yo va rete <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">47:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 29:23">Det 29:23</ref></char></note>sale. <verse eid="EZK 47:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 47:12"/>Akote rivyè a, arebò li, soti yon kote a yon lòt, va grandi tout pyebwa ki bay manje. Fèy yo p ap fennen e fwi yo p ap manke. Yo va donnen chak mwa akoz dlo yo koule soti nan sanktiyè a, fwi pa yo va pou manje e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">47:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 22:2">Rev 22:2</ref></char></note>fèy yo va pou gerizon.”<verse eid="EZK 47:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 47:13"/>Konsa pale Senyè BONDYE a: “Sa va sèvi kon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">47:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 34:2-12">Nonb 34:2-12</ref></char></note>lizyè ak sila nou va divize peyi a kon eritaj pami douz tribi Israël yo. Joseph va gen de pòsyon. <verse eid="EZK 47:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 47:14"/>Nou va divize li kon eritaj, chak egal ak lòt; paske Mwen te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">47:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 1:8">Det 1:8</ref></char></note>sèmante pou bay li a papa zansèt nou yo, e peyi sa a va tonbe a nou menm kon eritaj.<verse eid="EZK 47:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 47:15"/>“Sa se <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">47:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 34:7-9">Nonb 34:7-9</ref></char></note>lizyè peyi a: nan kote nò, soti nan Gwo Lanmè a, pa chemen Hethlon, jis rive nan antre a Tsedad; <verse eid="EZK 47:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 47:16"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">47:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 13:21">Nonb 13:21</ref></char></note>Hamath, Bérotha, Sibraïm, ki antre lizyè Damas ak lizyè Hamath; Hatzer-Hatthicon, kote lizyè Havran nan. <verse eid="EZK 47:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 47:17"/>Lizyè a va rive soti nan lanmè a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">47:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 34:9">Nonb 34:9</ref></char></note>Hatsar-Énon nan lizyè Damas e nan rejyon nò, vè nò, se lizyè Hamath la. Sa se fwontyè nan kote nò a.”<verse eid="EZK 47:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 47:18"/>“Nan kote <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">47:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 34:10-12">Nonb 34:10-12</ref></char></note>lès la, soti nan antre Havran, Damas Galaad ak peyi Israël, se va Larivyè Jourdain an; soti nan lizyè nò a jis rive nan lanmè lès la, ou va mezire li. Sa se kote lès la.”<verse eid="EZK 47:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 47:19"/>“Nan kote sid la, vè sid li va soti Thamar jis rive nan dlo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">47:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 32:51">Det 32:51</ref></char></note>Meriba-Kadès, pou rive nan flèv Égypte la ak nan Gwo Lanmè a. Sa se kote sid la, vè sid.”<verse eid="EZK 47:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 47:20"/>“Nan kote <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">47:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 34:6">Nonb 34:6</ref></char></note>lwès la, se va Gwo Lanmè a, soti nan lizyè sid la pou rive nan yon pwent anfas Lebo-Hamath. Sa se kote lwès la.”<verse eid="EZK 47:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 47:21"/>“Konsa nou va pataje peyi sa pami nou menm selon trib Israël yo. <verse eid="EZK 47:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 47:22"/>Ou va divize li pa tiraj osò kon eritaj pami nou menm e pami letranje ki rete nan mitan nou yo, ki fè fis nan mitan nou yo. Epi yo va pou nou tankou moun peyi natal, pami fis Israël yo; yo va resevwa yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">47:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 11:18">Trav 11:18</ref></char></note>eritaj avèk nou pami tribi Israël yo. <verse eid="EZK 47:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 47:23"/>Epi nan tribi kote etranje a rete a, se la ou va bay li eritaj li,” deklare Senyè BONDYE a.<verse eid="EZK 47:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 47"/>
  <chapter number="48" style="c" sid="EZK 48"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 48:1"/>Alò, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">48:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 1:1">Egz 1:1</ref></char></note>sila yo se non a tribi yo: soti nan pwent nò a, akote chemen a Hethlon rive Lebo-Hamath, Hatsar-Énon nan lizyè Damas la, vè nò a akote Hamath, ki kouri soti nan lès pou ale nan lwès Dan, yon pòsyon.<verse eid="EZK 48:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 48:2"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">48:2 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOS 19:24-31">Jos 19:24-31</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Akote lizyè a Dan nan, soti nan kote lès la pou rive nan kote lwès la, Aser, yon pòsyon.<verse eid="EZK 48:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 48:3"/>Akote lizyè Aser a, soti nan kote lès la pou rive nan kote lwès la, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">48:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 19:32-39">Jos 19:32-39</ref></char></note>Nephthali, yon pòsyon.<verse eid="EZK 48:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 48:4"/>Akote lizyè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">48:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 13:29-31">Jos 13:29-31</ref></char></note>Nephthali a, soti nan kote lès la, pou rive nan kote lwès la, Manassé, yon pòsyon.<verse eid="EZK 48:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 48:5"/>Akote <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">48:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 16:5-9">Jos 16:5-9</ref></char></note>lizyè Manassé a, soti nan kote lès la, pou rive nan kote lwès la, Éphraïm, yon pòsyon.<verse eid="EZK 48:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 48:6"/>Akote <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">48:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 13:15-21">Jos 13:15-21</ref></char></note>lizyè Éphraïm nan, soti nan kote lès la, pou rive nan kote lwès la, Ruben, yon pòsyon.<verse eid="EZK 48:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 48:7"/>Akote <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">48:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 15:1-63">Jos 15:1-63</ref></char></note>lizyè Ruben an, soti nan kote lès la, pou rive nan kote lwès la, Juda, yon pòsyon.<verse eid="EZK 48:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 48:8"/>Epi akote <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">48:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 12:6">És 12:6</ref></char></note>lizyè Juda a, soti nan kote lès la, jis rive nan kote lwès la, va yon pòsyon ke nou va mete akote, venn-senk-mil koude nan lajè ak nan longè, kon youn nan pòsyon yo, soti nan kote lès la, pou rive nan kote lwès la; epi sanktiyè a va nan mitan li.<verse eid="EZK 48:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 48:9"/>Pòsyon ke nou va rezève pou SENYÈ a, venn-senk-mil koude nan longè, e di-mil koude nan lajè. <verse eid="EZK 48:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 48:10"/>Pòsyon sen an va pou sila yo; pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">48:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 44:28">Éz 44:28</ref></char></note>prèt yo, vè nò, venn-senk-mil koude nan longè vè lwès, di-mil nan lajè, e vè sid, venn-senk-mil nan longè; epi sanktiyè SENYÈ a va nan mitan l. <verse eid="EZK 48:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 48:11"/>Li va pou prèt ki sen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">48:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 40:46">Éz 40:46</ref></char></note>pami fis a Tsadok yo, ki te kenbe responsabilite Mwen an, ki pa t vin egare lè fis Israël yo te vin egare, jan Levit yo te egare a. <verse eid="EZK 48:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 48:12"/>Li va yon pòsyon pou yo soti nan pòsyon peyi a, yon kote ki sen pase tout kote, akote pòsyon Levit yo.<verse eid="EZK 48:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 48:13"/>Akote lizyè prèt yo, Levit yo va gen venn-senk-mil koude nan longè, e di-mil nan lajè. Longè total la va venn-senk-mil koude, e lajè a va di-mil koude. <verse eid="EZK 48:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 48:14"/>Anplis, yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">48:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 25:32-34">Lev 25:32-34</ref></char></note>p ap ni vann ni fè echanj okenn ladann, ni anile okenn nan pòsyon chwazi nan teren sa a; paske li sen a SENYÈ a.<verse eid="EZK 48:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 48:15"/>Rès la, senk-mil koude nan lajè e venn-senk-mil koude nan longè, va pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">48:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 42:20">Éz 42:20</ref></char></note>sèvis vil la, pou kay yo ak pou espas ouvri yo; epi lavil la va nan mitan li. <verse eid="EZK 48:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 48:16"/>Sa yo va mezi li: Nan kote nò a, kat-mil-senk-san koude, kote sid la, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">48:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 21:16">Rev 21:16</ref></char></note>kat-mil-senk-san koude, kote lès la, kat-mil-senk-san koude, e kote lwès la, kat-mil-senk-san koude. <verse eid="EZK 48:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 48:17"/>Vil la va gen espas ouvri yo: Nan nò, de-san-senkant koude, nan sid, de-san-senkant koude, nan lès, de-san-senkant koude e nan lwès, de-san-senkant koude. <verse eid="EZK 48:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 48:18"/>Rès longè akote pòsyon ki sen an, va di-mil koude vè lès, e di-mil koude vè lwès; epi li va kouri akote pòsyon sen an. Epi pwodwi li yo va vin manje pou ouvriye vil yo. <verse eid="EZK 48:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 48:19"/>Ouvriye vil yo, ki sòti nan tout tribi Israël yo, va kiltive li. <verse eid="EZK 48:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 48:20"/>Tout pòsyon an va venn-senk-mil pa venn-senk-mil koude; nou va mete apa pòsyon sen an, yon pòsyon an fòm kare, ak teren vil la.<verse eid="EZK 48:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 48:21"/>Tout sa ki rete va pou prens lan, de yon kote a yon lòt kote, de pòsyon sen an ak teren vil la; devan venn-senk-mil koude a pòsyon an vè lizyè lès la, e vè lwès, devan venn-senk-mil koude vè lizyè lwès la, akote pòsyon yo, li va pou prens lan. Epi pòsyon sen an ak sanktiyè kay la va nan mitan li. <verse eid="EZK 48:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 48:22"/>Apa de teren Levit yo ak teren vil la, ki nan mitan a sila ki apatyen a prens lan, tout bagay antre lizyè Juda a ak lizyè Benjamin an va pou prens lan.<verse eid="EZK 48:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 48:23"/>Pou tout rès tribi yo: Soti nan kote lès la pou rive nan kote lwès la, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">48:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 18:21-28">Jos 18:21-28</ref></char></note>Benjamin, yon pòsyon.<verse eid="EZK 48:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 48:24"/>Akote lizyè Benjamin an, soti nan kote lès la pou rive nan lwès la, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">48:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 19:1-9">Jos 19:1-9</ref></char></note>Siméon, yon pòsyon.<verse eid="EZK 48:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 48:25"/>Akote lizyè Siméon an, soti nan kote lès la pou rive nan kote lwès la, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">48:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 19:17-23">Jos 19:17-23</ref></char></note>Issacar, yon pòsyon.<verse eid="EZK 48:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 48:26"/>Akote lizyè Issacar a, soti nan kote lès la, pou rive nan kote lwès la, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">48:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 19:10-16">Jos 19:10-16</ref></char></note>Zabulon, yon pòsyon.<verse eid="EZK 48:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZK 48:27"/>Akote lizyè Zabulon an, soti nan kote lès la pou rive nan kote lwès la, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">48:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 13:24-28">Jos 13:24-28</ref></char></note>Gad, yon pòsyon.<verse eid="EZK 48:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZK 48:28"/>Akote lizyè Gad la, soti nan kote vè sid la, lizyè a va soti <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">48:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 14:7">Jen 14:7</ref></char></note>Thamar jis rive nan dlo a Meriba yo nan Kadès, nan flèv Égypte la, jis rive nan Gwo Lanmè a.<verse eid="EZK 48:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EZK 48:29"/>Sa se <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">48:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 47:13-20">Éz 47:13-20</ref></char></note>peyi ke nou va divize selon tiraj osò bay tribi Israël yo, kon eritaj e sila yo se pòsyon pa yo,” deklare Senyè BONDYE a.<verse eid="EZK 48:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="EZK 48:30"/>“Sa yo se kote pou sòti nan vil la: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">48:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 48:32-34">Éz 48:32-34</ref></char></note>Nan kote nò a, kat-mil-senk-san koude pa mezi, <verse eid="EZK 48:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EZK 48:31"/>Sa yo va pòtay vil yo, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">48:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 21:12-13">Rev 21:12-13</ref></char></note>ki gen non a tribi Israël yo, twa pòtay vè nò: pòtay Ruben an, youn; pòtay Juda a, youn; pòtay Levi a, youn.<verse eid="EZK 48:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="EZK 48:32"/>“Nan kote lès la, kat-mil-senk-san koude, va gen twa pòtay sila yo: pòtay Joseph la, youn; pòtay Benjamin an, youn; pòtay Dan nan, youn.<verse eid="EZK 48:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="EZK 48:33"/>“Nan kote sid la, kat-mil-senk-san koude pa mezi, va gen twa pòtay: pòtay Siméon an, youn; pòtay Issacar a, youn; pòtay Zabulon an, youn.<verse eid="EZK 48:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="EZK 48:34"/>“Nan kote lwès la, kat-mil-senk-san koude, twa pòtay: pòtay Gad la, youn; pòtay Aser a, youn; pòtay Nephthali a, youn.<verse eid="EZK 48:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="EZK 48:35"/>“Vil la va diz-ui-mil koude antoure nèt; epi non a vil la soti nan jou sa a va: ‘SENYÈ a la’.”<verse eid="EZK 48:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 48"/>
</usx>
